\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 321\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Jacobus de Voragine}}\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Legenda aurea}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 . (1\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\endash vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Prolog: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit prologus super legendam \plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 sanctorum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 >, \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 quam compilavit frater Iacobus Voragine Januensis de ordine fratrum predicatorum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 Universum tempus presentis vite in quatuor distinguitur \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 usque ad adventum domini\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 . (1\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 3\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kapitelverzeichnis. (3\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 321\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Text: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit legenda fratris Jacobi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 (3\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 Januensis. De adventu domini\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 Adventus domini per quatuor agitur ebdomadas \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 (8\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Cap. 2. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 Interpretatio nominis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 Andreas interpretatur decorus vel respondens vel virilis ab andros, quod est vir \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 (8\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 De sancto Andrea apostolo legenda. Andreas et quidam alii discipuli tribus vicibus sunt vocati a domino \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 mortuus autem circa annos domini trecentesimo nonagesimo\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: Maggioni, Legenda aurea. Innerhalb des Textbestandes dieser Hs. treten einige nicht zum \u8222 \'84Legenda aurea\ldblquote -Corpus geh\u246 \'f6rende Legenden auf. Bestand: (3\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) [\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Vita sanctae Scholasticae\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ]. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 Sancta Scolastica, virgo Cristi, ad fratrem suum Benedictum abbatem venire semel consueverat. Ad quam vir dei non longe \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 vgl. BHL Nr. 7514; Text \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. C 9, 38\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\endash va\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ; (3\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 13\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap. 1\endash 3 (Kap. 3 unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig: Textverlust); (14\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 23\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap. 12\endash 16 (Kap. 12 ohne Anfang; vom Kap. 16 nur der 1. Satz); (24\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 35\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap. 54\endash 58 (Kap. 54 ohne Anfang); (35\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 69\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap 61\endash 73; (69\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 71\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap. 76; (71\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 72\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap. 77; (72\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 96\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap. 79\endash 86; (96\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 101\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap. 88\endash 90; (101\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 115\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap. 92\endash 95; (115\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 117\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap. 60; (117\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap. 91; (117\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 122\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap. 164 (gek\u252 \'fcrzt); (122\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 122\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 De sancta Barbara\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 Sancta Barbara, virgo gloriosa et omni laude digna, Dyoscori Nicomediensis unica fuit filia, quam pater inclusit in quadam turri propter eius pulchritudinem \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 Text \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. C 9, 3\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 4\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ; (122\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 124\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 De sancta Dorothea\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 In diebus illis in provincia Capadocie apud civitatem Cesaream erat quedam dei puella nomine Dorothea \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 BHL 2323 (+ Suppl. Nr. 2323c). (125\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 126\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 De sancto Ludgero\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 Beatus Ludgerus ex patre Tyatgrimino, matre vero Liatburga ortus est \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 BHL Nr. 4946 (Schluss abweichend); Text \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. C 9, 53\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 54\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ;(126\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 127\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap. 105; (127\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\endash vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap. 111; (127\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 Walburgis virginis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 Beata Walburgis, virgo de anglorum gente oriunda, Willibaldi, episcopi Eistadensis, et Winniboldi abbatis soror fuit \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 Text mit gleichem Anfang \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. C 9, 45\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 46\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ; (128\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 130\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap. 96 (gek\u252 \'fcrzt); (130\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 132\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap. 97; (132\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 134\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap. 99\endash 101; (134\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 136\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap. 103; (136\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 137\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap 104; (137\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 153\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap. 106\endash 110; (153\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 175\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) 112\endash 116; (175\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 193\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap. 119\endash 121; (193\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 195\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap. 123; (195\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 207\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap. 127\endash 131; (207\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 272\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap. 133\endash 163; (273\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 317\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) 165\endash 178; (317\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 321\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kap. 132. Zum Textbestand gegen\u252 \'fcber der Ausgabe von Th. Graesse (s.o.) vgl. B. Fleith, Studien zur \u220 \'dcberlieferungsgeschichte der lateinischen Legenda aurea, Br\u252 \'fcssel 1991 (Subsidia hagiographica, 72), S. 105; S. 508 (Hs. erw\u228 \'e4hnt). Entgegen den Angaben auf S. 105 sind Kap. 115 und 165 in dieser Hs. vorhanden; Kap. 56 ist unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. Kaeppeli Nr. 2154 (Hs. genannt).}

