\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 324\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 326\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Richardus de Wetheringsett}}\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Summa de officio sacerdotis}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpt. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 Qui bene presunt presbiteri \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 [I Tim 5,17]. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 Presbiter grece, senex latine dicitur. Et dicuntur presbiteri duo habere per gratiam, que senes habent per naturam, scilicet continentiam et sapientiam \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 (326\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 Hec sunt precipue sermonibus insinuenda per ordinem possunt induci auctoritates scripturarum et sententie magistrorum et specialiter dicta bone memorie magistri Wilhelmi de Montibus, cuius anime propitietur deus. Bis sex articuli fidei septemque petenda. Virtutes, vitia, presertim crimina septem. Septem sacra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 menta\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 )\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 , duo domini mandata decemque. Legis iustorum, merces peneque malorum. In quibus erratur, quid vitandum, quid agendum. \plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 Bloomfield Nr. 4583 (+ Suppl.); Glorieux, R\u233 \'e9pertoire, Nr. 118a; Sharpe Nr. 1405 (S. 519); Hamesse/Szyller Nr. 27053.}

