\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 3\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 262\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ludolphus de Saxonia]}}\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Vita Iesu Christi}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 , pars 1, cap. 41\endash 92. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 De curacione leprosi. Capitulum xli\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 .< Auf dem oberen Rand: \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 Dominica tertia post epiphanie domini. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Cum descendisset \u8230 \'85 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [Mt 8,1]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 . Lege ergo ewangelica in monte data, consequenter ponitur eius confirmacio per miracula}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 ac dirige in viam veritatis et iusticie, ac salutis eterne. Amen\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit liber secundus de vita Ihesu Christi. Finitus et completus per me, Johannem Vulstal de Boichem, clericum Coloniensis diocesis, Assindie, in domo honorabilis viri domini Rutgeri Vulstal, scholastici Assidensis, anno domini millesimo quadrigentesimo tricesimo secundo, die Martis nona mensis decembris. Hoc opus exegi, festum sepissime fregi. Orate ergo pro scriptore\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 .< Vgl. Colophons Nr. 21995. \endash  Druck: Ludolphus the Carthusian, Vita Christi, Bd. 2, Paris u.a. 1865 (Nachdruck Salzburg 2006) (Analecta Cartusiana, 241), hier ab S. 191. Kaeppeli Bd. 3, S. 92; Stegm\u252 \'fcller RB Nr. 5437. VL\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 Bd. 5, Sp. 976\endash 977. Teile dieses Werkes \u252 \'fcberliefert in Ms. B 61 und Ms. C 15. Weitere Angaben in: Kat. D\u252 \'fcsseldorf, Bd. 1, S. 210. (261\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 \endash 262\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26 ) Kapitelverzeichnis. \endash  262\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26  und 262\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

