\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 37vb\endash 44ra [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 JACOBUS DE MARCHIA}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 HOMILIA DE SANCTA MARIA MAGDALENA}}\plain \f1\fs22 ]. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 In illo tempore Maria stabat ad monumentum \u8230 \'85 [Io 20,11]. In presenti solempnitate locuturus auribus vestre karitatis, dilectissimi, amor venit ad memoriam, quo beata Maria Magdalena dominum nostrum diligendo discipulis fugientibus eum ad mortem eundo sequebatur}}\plain \f1\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 quia vidi dominum et hec dixit michi. Cui est honor et gloria cum patre et spiritu sancto in secula seculorum. Amen. Explicit omelia. \endash  D. Lasi\u263 c, Sermones S. Iacobi de Marchia in cod. Vat. Lat. 7780 et 7642 asservati, in: Archivum Franciscanum Historicum 63, 1970, S. 476\endash 565, hier S. 495.}

