\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 1ra\endash 83ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 ACTUS SANCTI FRANCISCI ET SOCIORUM EIUS}}\plain \f1\fs22 , Fassung A. >Hijr synt de namen van sunte Franciscus gesellen, dy irst van hem geropen weren to den oirden ende vort an, wo sie begunnen een geystelick leuen.< Die irste vam [!] em vas Francyscus selue van gade gheropen \u8230 \'85 (1rb) To den irsten suldy veten, dat die hillighe man sunte Francyscus ser ghelick was in vele punten onsen lieuen here Ihesum Christum \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 Des mote he syn gebenedijt, die syne creature aldus versien kan in tijt vnde in ewicheit. Amen. \endash  Druck: St. Schoutens, Die capittelen vanden ghesellen S. Francisci, Antwerpen 1904. D. de Kok, Les \u233 \'e9tudes franciscaines en Hollande depuis 1894, in: Archivum Franciscanum historicum 5, 1912, S. 448\endash 458, hier S. 457; Schlusemann, Bibliographie, S. 405 (Hs. jeweils genannt).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 83ra\endash 91vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 AEGIDIUS ASSISIAS}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 DICTA, Teil I}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >Hir begynnen somyghe wordekyn, die broder Egydyus plach to seggen to syne broderen. Unde begynt aldus.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Die genade gades vnde dogede syn recht als eyn ledder vnde eyn weg in den hemel mede to climmen}}\plain \f1\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 unde hoert syn orber pynt to trecken. \endash  Druck: St. Schoutens, Sommeghe guldenen woerde seer stichtich die broeder Egidius ghesproeken heeft. Sinte Franciscus vermaninghen, Antwerpen 1904, S. 7\endash 24, hier S. 7\endash 14. VL2 Bd. 1, Sp. 76 ff. W. de Vreese, De handschriften van Jan van Ruusbroec\rquote s werken, Bd. 1, Gent 1900 (Uitgaven der Koninklijke Vlaamsche Academie voor Taal- & Letterkunde, R. 6, 23), S. 438, Anm. 2; Schlusemann, Bibliographie, S. 3 f. (Hs. jeweils genannt).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 91vb\endash 141rb [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 LEO ASSISIAS}}\plain \f1\fs22 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 SPECULUM PERFECTIONIS SEU SANCTI FRANCISCI ASSISIENSIS LEGENDA ANTIQUISSIMA, Fassung B1}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >Hir begynt een spygel der volcomenheit, dar der mynre bruder staet in begunnen is.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Dit werke is vergadert to somigen alden legenden, die sunte Franciscus gesellen in alre hande stede schreuen ende schrijuen deden \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 unde segede myt groter vrolicheit welkome moit myn zuster, die doit wesen. \endash  Druck: St. Schoutens, Alde legenden van sente Franciscus, Antwerpen 1904, S. 7\endash 77. LMA Bd. 5, Sp. 1882; M. Bernards, Speculum virginum. Geistigkeit und Seelenleben der Frau im Hochmittelalter, 2., unver\u228 \'e4nderte Aufl., K\u246 \'f6ln 1982 (Beihefte zum Archiv f\u252 \'fcr Kulturgeschichte, 16), S. 3, Anm. 22 (Hs. genannt; mit falschem Hinweis auf Heinrich Herp als Verfasser dieses Textes); Schlusemann, Bibliographie, S. 464 (Hs. genannt). }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 141rb\endash 163ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 ACTUS SANCTI FRANCISCI ET SOCIORUM EIUS, Fassung E2}}\plain \f1\fs22 . Hyr begynnen (141va) >somige wonderlike wercke, die sunte Franciscus unde syne iersten gesellen deden.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 In den iersten is to weten, dat sunt Franciscus in al synen werken onsen heren Ihesum Christum vnde medeformich was \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 alle genesen vnde worden gesont. \endash  Druck: St. Schoutens, Alde legenden van sente Franciscus, Antwerpen 1904, S. 78\endash 102, hier S. 78\endash 100. Schlusemann, Bibliographie, S. 459. }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 163ra\endash 175ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 AEGIDIUS ASSISIAS}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 DICTA, Teil II}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >Broder Egidius woirde van versmanysse der werlt.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 De den mensche, die syn herte vnde syn begerte vnde syne crachte in ertsche dyngen settet}}\plain \f1\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 tegen dat licht van eynre glorificierder zielen. >Hyr eyndet somige nutte woerdekens, die broder Eigidius plach to seggene.< \endash  Druck: s. o. Angaben zu Bl. 83ra, hier S. 14\endash 24. VL2 Bd. 1, Sp. 76 ff.; Schlusemann, Bibliographie, S. 3 f. (Hs. genannt).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 175ra\endash 177ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 ACTUS SANCTI FRANCISCI ET SOCIORUM EIUS, Fassung E2}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >Wo broder Johan mysse dede vnde sach, dat zielen verloist worden.< Bo [!] broder Johan mysse dede (175rb) vor alle die gelouige zielen \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 vnde oic die heligen armode seluen. \endash  Druck: St. Schoutens, Alde legenden van sente Franciscus, Antwerpen 1904, S. 101 f. (in dieser Ausgabe nur ein Kapitel vorhanden).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 177ra\endash 182ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 FRANCISCUS ASSISIAS}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 ADMONITIONES}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >Wo dat sich nymant verhouerdigen ensal mer verbliden inde cruce ons heren.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Mmensche (recte: O mensche), merc- (177rb) -ke, in wo groter hoicheit god, onse here, dy gesat heuet \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 den leuendige warachtige got altit te anbeden vnde toe schouwen. Hir endet werke vnde worde ens dels van sonte Francyscus vnde syne irste bruderen. \endash  Druck: St. Schoutens, Sommeghe guldenen woerde seer stichtich die broeder Egidius ghesproeken heeft. Sinte Franciscus vermaningen, Antwerpen 1904, S. 27\endash 32. VL2 Bd. 2, Sp. 837\endash 842; DLL MA Bd. 1, Sp. 572\endash 575, hier Sp. 572 f. Schlusemann, Bibliographie, S. 454 (Hs. genannt). 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Zu den o. g. Texten vgl. S. Clasen, Legenda antiqua s. Francisci. Untersuchung \u252 \'fcber die nachbonaventurianischen Franziskusquellen, Legenda trium sociorum, Speculum perfectionis, Actus b. Francisci et sociorum eius und verwandtes Schrifttum, Leiden 1967 (Studia et documenta Franciscana, 5), S. 75 (Hs. genannt als Cod. 22).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 182ra\endash 187ra [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 BONAVENTURA}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 LEGENDA MAIOR FRANCISCI ASSISIENSIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 ], cap. 15. Hir volget nae, woe he verheuen wart. Die irste lexce op den dach synre verheuynge. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 <S>onte Francyscus, een knecht vnde een vrynt (182rb) des alre ouerste gades, was een insetter vnde een vorgander van der mynre bruder orden \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 ere onde glorie, die dat wrachte van eue to eue. Amen. \endash  Druck: St. Schoutens, Sente Franciscus leven, Aalst 1903. VL2 Bd. 1, Sp. 937\endash 947, bes. 943; DLL MA Bd. 1, Sp. 782\endash 789, hier Sp. 787; Schlusemann, Bibliographie, S. 32 f. (Hs. genannt). Zur lat. Vorlage vgl. CALMA Bd. 2,4, S. 456, Nr. 39. }

