\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 2ra\endash 197va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 JACOBUS DE VORAGINE}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 LEGENDA AUREA}}\plain \f1\fs22 , pars aestivalis; cap. 82\endash 131; 134\endash 163; 165\endash 167; 169; 170; 173. \u220 \'dcbersetzung des \u8222 \'84Bijbelvertaler van 1360\ldblquote . Kapitelangaben nach: Maggioni, Legenda aurea. >Hyr begynt das sommerstuck van den passionael der hellighen.< (2ra\endash 3va) >Ende ten irsten van den tween hellighen mertelers Johanne ende Paulo.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Iohan ende Paulus waren Constancie, Constantinus dochter des keisers, vorbor praeste \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  LA 82; (3va\endash 5va) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Van den seuen scleepers}}\plain \f1\fs22 < LA 97; (5va\endash 6ra) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Van sunt Leo paus}}\plain \f1\fs22 < LA 83; (6ra\endash 11vb) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Van sunt Peter apostel}}\plain \f1\fs22 < LA 84; (12ra\endash 20va) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Van sunt Paulus apostel}}\plain \f1\fs22 < LA 85; (20va\endash 21ra) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[5].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Van den seuen bruderen}}\plain \f1\fs22 < LA 86; (21ra\endash 22va) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[6].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Van su<n>te Theodora jonfer}}\plain \f1\fs22 < LA 88; (22va\endash 23vb) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[7].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Van sunte Margarete jonfer}}\plain