erts hoern \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 ende der verdiensten des guden sunte Huberts, des heligen bisscops. \endash  Williams-Krapp, Legendare, S. 420 (Hs. genannt). (177va\endash 179ra) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[82].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Van sunte Leonaert, syn leuen, syn doet ende syn myraculen}}\plain \f1\fs22 < LA 151. \endash  Williams-Krapp, Legendare, S. 432 (Hs. genannt); (179rb\endash va) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[83].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Van den vier gecroenden mertelers}}\plain \f1\fs22 < LA 160; (179va\endash 180ra) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[84].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Van sunte Theodorus martir}}\plain \f1\fs22 < LA 161; (180ra\endash 184vb) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[85].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Van sunt Martinus confessoir}}\plain \f1\fs22 < LA 162; (185ra\endash va) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[86].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Van sunte Brictius bisscop}}\plain \f1\fs22 < LA 163; (185va\endash 188va) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[87].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Van sunte Cecilia ionfer et martyr}}\plain \f1\fs22 < LA 165; (188va\endash 192vb) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[88].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Van sunte Clemens paus}}\plain \f1\fs22 < LA 166; (192va\endash 193ra) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[89].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Van sunte Crisogonus martir}}\plain \f1\fs22 < LA 167; (193rb\endash 195ra) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[90].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Van sunte Theophilus}}\plain \f1\fs22 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Theophilus, des richters amptman, bespotten sunte Doratheen, die helige jonffer \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 ende is die achte dach in februarius. \endash  Williams-Krapp, Legendare, S. 464 (Hs. genannt). (195ra\endash b) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[91].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Van sunte Saturninus bisscop}}\plain \f1\fs22 < LA 169; (195rb\endash 197ra) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[92].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Van sunte Iacob dem gloriosen merteler}}\plain \f1\fs22 < LA 170; (197ra\endash va) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[93].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Van sunte Moyses den abt}}\plain \f1\fs22 < LA 173. \endash  Hier liegt die \u8222 \'84S\u252 \'fcdmittelniederl\u228 \'e4ndische Legenda aurea\ldblquote  vor; vgl. dazu VL2 Bd. 4, Sp. 457 ff. (weitere Angaben zum Text in der Beschreibung zu Ms. C 20, 25ra); Axters, Bibliotheca, S. 166 (Hs. genannt); C. L\u228 \'e4ken, Nogmaals de Legenda aurea in druk. De verhouding tussen handschriften en drukken, in: A. Berteloot u. a. (Hg.), \u8222 \'84Een boeck dat men te Latine heet Aurea Legenda\ldblquote , s. o., S. 129\endash 164 (Hs. genannt S. 137: Sigle D\u252 \'fc2); Mazurek, Handschriften, S. 94.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

