\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 1ra\endash 24vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 CAESARIUS HEISTERBACENSIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 HOMILIAE DE PASSIONE DOMINI}}\plain \f1\fs22 , homiliae 1\endash 7, unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. >Epistola Cesarij in expositionem moralem super passionem Christi secundum omnes evangelistas.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Viris religiosis et dominis suis in Christo karissimis, Alexandro de Claustro et Petro de Loco sancte Marie, prioribus, sic Christi participare passioni, ut in futuro consortes esse mereamini gloriose eius resurrectionis \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 ne prolixitas legentibus fastidium generaret. >Explicit epistola.< (1rb\endash 6ra) Homilia 1. >Incipit homelia prima moralis in passionem domini.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 In illo tempore dixit Ihesus discipulis suis: Scitis, quia post biduum \u8230 \'85 [Mt 26,2]. >Omelia de eadem leccione.< Passione domini salvatoris nostri moraliter editurus auxilium ipsius \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 ipso prestante, qui cum patre et spiritu sancto vivit et regnat per omnia secula seculorum. Amen. >Explicit omelia prima.< (6ra\endash 8vb) Homilia 2, Schluss fehlt. >Incipit omelia secunda.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Prima autem die azimorum \u8230 \'85 [Mt 26,17\endash 19]. Dies azimorum septem erant, in quibus iudei azima, id est panem fermentatum, non comederunt \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  (\u8230 \'85) quam deus in homine sine homine cre-|| (9ra\endash vb) Homilia 3, Anfang fehlt. || Anne filiam uxorem dederat \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 qui cum patre et spiritu sancto vivit et regnat per omnia sesula seculorum. Amen. >Explicit omelia iii.< (9vb\endash 14vb) Homilia 4. >Incipit omelia iiiita.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Principes sacerdotum et omne concilium querebant \u8230 \'85 [Mt 26,59\endash 60]. Principes isti sacerdotum, sicut supra dictum est, consilium fecerant \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 Qui cum patre et spiritu sancto vivit et regnat per omnia secula seculorum. Amen. >Explicit omelia iiiita.< (14vb\endash 19va) Homilia 5. >Incipit omelia vta.<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Ihesus stetit ante presidem \u8230 \'85 [Mt 27,11]. Quia ab hoc loco usque ad illum, ubi introivit iterum in pretorium Pylatus \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 Cui cum patre et spiritu sancto laus sit et gloria per infinita secula seculorum. Amen. >Explicit omelia vta.< (19va\endash 24ra) Homilia 6. >Incipit vita.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Salvatoris nostri pene et iniurie, que pro nobis a nocentibus innocenter pertulit, multum nos movere multumque terrere debent \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 (23vb) in quo idem dominus ac salva- (24ra) -tor noster cum patre et spiritu sancto vivit et regnat per omnia secula seculorum. Amen. >Explicit omelia vi.< (24ra\endash vb) Homilia 7, Schluss fehlt. >Incipit omelia vii.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Hactenus de Christi tormentis dictum est \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  (\u8230 \'85) Et ex illa hora accepit eam || \endash  A. Hilka (Hg.), Die Wundergeschichten des Caesarius von Heisterbach, Bd. 1, Bonn 1933 (Publikationen der Gesellschaft f\u252 \'fcr Rheinische Geschichtskunde, 43), S. 6, Nr. 23 (irrt\u252 \'fcmlich Sigle D3 statt D), S. 23 ff. und 42 (Kurzbeschreibung der Hs.). Steg-m\u252 \'fcller RB Nr. 1883. VL2 Bd. 1, Sp. 1152\endash 1168; CALMA Bd. 2,5, S. 541, Nr. 6. }

