\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 1ra\endash 3vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Augustinus <Aurelius>}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 REGULA RECEPTA}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >Incipit regula beati Augustini episcopi, patris nostri.< Schlussrubrik: >Explicit regula beati Augustini episcopi, patris nostri. Sequitur in exposicione magistri Humberti super eandem regulam.< \endash  Druck: PL 32, Sp. 1377\endash 1384. Ed. des \u8222 \'84Praeceptum\ldblquote : L. Verheijen, La R\u232 \'e8gle de Saint Augustin, Bd. 1: Tradition manuscrite, Paris 1967 (\u201 \'c9tudes Augustiniennes, 15), S. 417\endash 437. CPL Nr. 1839b; CPPM Bd. 2, Nr. 3590, 3593. Hamesse/Szyller Nr. 2972. \endash  162v leer.}

