\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 4ra\endash 177ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 HUMBERTUS DE ROMANIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 EXPOSITIO REGULAE SANCTI AUGUSTINI}}\plain \f1\fs22 . (4ra\endash 6rb) Kapitelverzeichnis. >Exposicio regule beati Augustini episcopi secundum fratrem Humbertum quondam magistrum ordinis predicatorum.< (6va) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Cogitanti michi de sermone, qui exiit inter fratres de regula beati Augustini \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 (176vb) deficientes sub- (177ra) -levat, vincentes coronat. Hec Bernardus. Explicit exposicio regule beati Augustini episcopi edita a venerabili magistro Humberto ordinis predicatorum. >Completa anno domini Mocccco70, quarto nonas Julii, per manus fratris Henrici de Werdenborch, ad honorem omnipotentis dei et utilitatem atque profectum fratrum sancte Crucis in Duysseldorp.< Hic additur in fine, ut sciat quicumque hec: Impleverit se totam regulam implesse et ad amplius non teneri. >Jhesus Maria.< \endash  Ed.: J. J. Berthier, B. Humberti de Romanis quinti praedicatorum magistri generalis opera de vita regularis, Bd. 1, Rom 1888. Kaeppeli Nr. 2016; Hamesse/Szyller Nr. 7690. Van den Bosch, Obervantie, S. 143, Anm. 92.}

