\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 84r\endash 96v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 BENEDICTUS XII. PAPA}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 BULLA \u8218 \'82FULGENS SICUT STELLA MATUTINA\lquote }}\plain \f1\fs22 . Hoc est transumptum quarumdam litterarum apostolicarum, quarum tenor inferius de verbo ad verbum inseritur et primo tenor prime sequitur in hunc modum: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Benedictus episcopus, servus servorum dei, ad perpetuam rei memoriam. Fulgens sicut stella matutina in medio nebule, sacer Cisterciensis ordo in ecclesia militante strennue militat operibus et exemplis \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 Datum apud Pontensorgie [!] Avinionensis dyocesis, iiii idus julii, pontificatus nostri anno primo. \endash  Druck: Canivez, Statuta, Bd. 3, S. 410\endash 436; Nomasticon Cisterciense S. 473\endash 495; Magnum Bullarium Romanum, Bd. 3,2, S. 203\endash 213. CALMA Bd. 2,2, S. 188, Nr. 111.}

