\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 98v\endash 99r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 BENEDICTUS XII. PAPA}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 BULLA \u8218 \'82REGULAREM VITAM\lquote }}\plain \f1\fs22 . >Tenor tercie littere.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Benedictus episcopus, servus servorum dei, ad perpetuam rei memoriam. Regularem vitam professis sic expedit subtrahi omnem inquietudinis et turbacionis materiam \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 Datum Avinionensis iiiio nonas julii, pontificatus nostri anno primo. \endash  Druck: Magnum Bullarium Romanum, Bd. 3,2, S. 203. CALMA Bd. 2,2, S. 189, Nr. 118. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend notarielle Best\u228 \'e4tigung f\u252 \'fcr diese Bullen: Et ego {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes quondam Reynardi Scriptoris de Cubito}}\plain \f1\fs22 , clericus Pragensis dyocesis, publicus apostolica et imperiali auctoritate notarius, prefatas litteras apostolicas vidi, legi et tenui et aliis impeditus presentem copiam per alium scribi feci et signum meum consuetum apposui in signum veritatis. Quod signum reverendus pater dominus abbas Campensis in rotulo suo, de quo supradicta omnia transsumpsimus, habet inpressum. (99rv) Sp\u228 \'e4tere Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge. 1) Clausula zu: BENEDICTUS XII. PAPA: BULLA \u8218 \'82FULGENS SICUT STELLA MATUTINA\lquote . >Ista est clausula primi privilegii.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Quia vero tanta est incentoris maligni versucia et malicia pervigil et solers \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 plenam atque liberam concedimus tenore presencium potestatem. [\u8230 \'85] et cetera; 2) (99v) FORMA IURAMENTI. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Possessiones vel jura ad monasterium istud spectancia non vendam}}\plain \f1\fs22 , non alienabo, non inpingnorabo, non de novo infeodabo, nec per aliquem modum donabo, nisi per modum in ordinacione domini Benedicti pape duodecimi contentum. Sic me juvet deus et hec sancta ewangelia. }

