\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 27v\endash 28r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 COMMEMORATIO DEFUNCTORUM}}\plain \f1\fs22  (am 17. September). Anschlie\u223 \'dfend: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 PS.-ANSELMUS CANTUARIENSIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 ADMONITIO MORIENTI}}\plain \f1\fs22 ], Exzerpt. >Sic debet frater proximus morti interrogari.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Frater, letaris, quod in fide christiana moreris? \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 In manus tuas commendo spiritum meum, redemisti me, domine, deus veritatis. >Securus moritur, cui hec ante mortem dicuntur nec videbit mortem eternam.< \endash  Druck: PL 158, Sp. 685\endash 688, hier bis Sp. 687 (mit Abweichungen). Rudolf, Ars moriendi, S. 57 ff.}

