\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 1v\endash 113r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 LIBELLUS ANTIQUARUM DEFINITIONUM ORDINIS CISTERCIENSIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >Incipit libellus statutorum ordinis Cisterciensis. Illorum videlicet, que ad regularem observationem, correptionem morum viteque disciplinam pertinere noscuntur. Prologus in Cartam charitatis factam anno domini millesimo centesimo septimo.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Antequam ordo Cisterciensis esset plurimum dilatatus, domnus Stephanus, abbas Cistercii, in conventu suo ceterique diffinitores abbates predicti ordinis de conventuum suorum consensu unanimi \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  (2r) \u8230 \'85 et humanis exequitur et exquirit. >Explicit Prologus.< (2r\endash 8v) CHARTA CARITATIS POSTERIOR. >Incipit Carta Charitatis de uniformitate ordinis in moribus et cantu. Capitulum primum.< Quia unius veri regis et magistri nos omnes servos licet inutiles esse cognoscimus \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 sed ubi a quattuor primis supranominatis previsum fuerit, celebrabitur. >Explicit carta Caritatis.< \endash  Druck: Nomasticon Cisterciense S. 68\endash 73. (8v\endash 22v) CLEMENS PAPA IV.: BULLA \u8218 \'82PARVUS FONS\lquote . >Incipit prefatio super Clementinam. Prefatio.< Supradictum itaque decretum seu caritatis cartam \u8230 \'85 >Unde habeatur ortum Clementina.< Verum inimico humani generis caritati predictorum (9r) patrum et fratrum invidente \u8230 \'85 >Incipit Ordinatio domini Clementis pape quarti de commendatione ordinis Cisterciensis.< Clemens episcopus, servus servorum dei, dilectis filiis suis abbati Cisterciensi et universis coabbatibus eius in generali capitulo congregatis salutem et apostolicam benedictionem. Ad perpetuam rei memoriam. Fons parvus, qui crevit in flumine \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 Datum Parisii, quinto Idus Julii, pontificatus nostri anno primo. >Explicit Clementina.< \endash  Druck: Magnum Bullarium Romanum, Bd. 3,1, S. 429\endash 433; Nomasticon Cisterciense S. 367\endash 376. Potthast Nr. 19185. >Incipit secunda distinctio. Ut in omnibus monasteriis ordinis habeantur transcripta privilegiorum et ut omnes presertim abbates ad tuitionem ipsorum incendant. Capitulum primum.< Supradictam domini Clementis pape quarti decisionem et ordinacionem tam graciosam tamque utilem necnon et sepe dictam caritatis cartam \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et observent ipse ac faciant ab aliis firmiter observari. >Finis coronat.< \endash  Druck: Nomasticon Cisterciense S. 376\endash 470. Winter, Zisterzienser, Bd. 1, S. 299 (Hs. genannt). }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 113v\endash 158v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 LIBELLUS NOVELLARUM DEFINITIONUM ORDINIS CISTERCIENSIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >Prologus Novelle et est prima distinctio.< (114r) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Ut statutorum Cistercien-sis ordinis scrutationes brevius inveniant, quod exoptant, diffinitiones ipsius ordinis capituli generalis ab anno domini millesimo ccc xvio, quo diffinitionum libellus extitit compilatus usque ad annum quinquagesimum sub eisdem titulis et aliquibus augmentatis, que continentur in eodem \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  (114v) >Explicit distinctio prima. Incipit distinctio secunda, que continet tria capitula. Ut in omnibus monasteriis ordinis habeantur transcripta privilegorum. Capitulum primum.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Omnibus abbatibus ordinis precipitur, quatinus privilegia ordinis communia habeant \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  approbentur per dictos patres abbates vel etiam reprobentur. >Expliciunt Novelle diffinitiones Capituli generalis.< \endash  Druck: Nomasticon Cisterciense S. 498\endash 536. \endash  159r leer.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;\red255\green204\blue153;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 159v\endash 193r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 BENEDICTUS XII. PAPA}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 CONSTITUTIO PRO REFORMATIONE ORDINIS CISTERCIENSIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 . (159v\endash 191v): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 BULLA \u8218 \'82FULGENS SICUT STELLA MATUTINA\lquote }}\plain \f1\fs22 . >Incipit ordinatio sive reformatio ordinis cisterciensis per sanctissimum dominum papam Benedictum duodecimum de eodem ordine assumptum ex sua magna bulla plumbata extracta hic per capitula annotata in codice, in qua multa statuit et ordinat ab omnibus eiusdem ordinis personis regularibus perpetue observanda. Quequidam bulla seu privilegium ab omnibus personis ordinis prefati ordinis Cisterciensis vocatur Benedictina. (160r) >Qualiter ordo Cisterciensis commendatur quantum ad contemplativam vitam. Capitulum primum.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Benedictus episcopus, servus servorum dei, ad perpetuam rei memoriam. Fulgens sicut stella matutina in medio nebule, sacer est ordo Cisterciensis in ecclesia militante, strenue militat operibus et exemplis \u8230 \'85 }}\plain \f1\fs22 \endash  \u8230 \'85 Datum apud Pontem Sorgie Avinionensis dyocesis, quarto idus julii, pontificatus nostri anno primo. >Explicit Benedictina.< \endash  Druck: Canivez, Statuta, Bd. 3, S. 410\endash 436; Nomasticon Cisterciense S. 473\endash 495; Magnum Bullarium Romanum, Bd. 3,2, S. 203\endash 213. CALMA Bd. 2,2, S. 188, Nr. 111. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend: (191v\endash 193r) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Premissa bulla domini Benedicti est in forma gloriosa}}\plain \f1\fs22 , sed est alia executionis eiusdem sub cordula canapis in forma rigorosa, que sic incipit: Benedictus episcopus, servus servorum dei, dilecto filio Guillermo, abbati monasterii Cisterciensis Cabilonensis diocesis salutem et apostolicam benedictionem. Ad statum sacri tui ordinis etc. Ubi omnia (192r) prosequitur, que in bulla precedenti habentur, deinde in fine habetur clausula sequens. >Ista infra scripta concessio est concessa a sanctissimo patre nostro domino Benedicto papa xiio domino Cistercii omni tempore pro illis, qui transgressi fuerunt ea, que in magna sua et generali bulla sunt contenta. Potestas.< Quia vero tanta est \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 plenam atque liberam tenore presentium concedimus potestatem. Datum apud (193r) Pontem Sorgie Avinionensis diocesis quarto idus julii pontificatus nostri anno primo. >Explicit ordinatio domini Benedicti pape duodecimi pro reformatione et consuetudine conservationis ordinis Cisterciensis.< \endash  Druck: Nomasticon Cisterciense S. 495 f.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;\red255\green204\blue153;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 193r\endash 194r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 REMISSIONES BENEDICTINAE}}\plain \f1\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Quia tamen in sua maiori bulla multa visa sunt austera valde, ideo per aliquos subsequentes summos pontifices fuit super eis dispensatum, ut inferius patebit \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  Schlussrubrik: >Et hec de Remissionibus Benedictine.< \u196 \'c4nderungen zu den Kapiteln 8, 13, 15, 17, 26, 29 und 30 der o. g. Bulle, die von den P\u228 \'e4psten Clemens [VI. ?], Sixtus IV., Pius II. und Innozenz VIII. vorgenommen wurden.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;\red255\green204\blue153;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 194v\endash 206v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 LIBELLUS ANTIQUARUM DEFINITIONUM ORDINIS CISTERCIENSIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 , dist. 2 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 DE LIBERTATIBUS, PRIVILEGIIS, IMMUNITATIBUS ET INDULGENTIIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 ). >Sequntur decem capitula excerpta ex privilegiis communibus ordinis, que pro secunda distinctione libelli diffinitionum multi ponunt.< Bonum inappreciabile est libertas. >Capitulum primum.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Libertas igitur in privilegiis et indulgentiis a sede apostolica nobis concessis inviolabiliter observetur \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et indulgentias ordinis infringere. >Quodquidem capitulum habetur scriptum ante in capitulo secundo secunde distinctionis Libelli diffinitionum.< Et hec de privilegiis ordini concessis. \endash  Druck: Nomasticon Cisterciense S. 378\endash 389. Canivez, Statuta, Bd. 4, S. XI und ebd. Bd. 6, S. X (Hs. jeweils genannt). \endash  207 leer. }

