\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 223v\endash 225r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 LECTIONES ANTE EPISCOPUM IN CAPITULO LEGENDAE}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >Lectio ante episcopum recitanda cum venerit in capitulum quodcumque ordinis.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Audiat unusquisque de regno dei, quod amet, audiat de supplicio, quod timeat \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 (224v) >Alia lectio, quam coram episcopo vel abbate consueverunt facere legi fratres de Monte Syon.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Dicit Gregorius in Pastorali: Fit prelatus discretus in silentio, utilis in verbo \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 ipse qui perpetrant.}

