\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 125r\endash 163r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 LIBER ORDINARIUS ORDINIS CISTERCIENSIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 . (125ra\endash vb) Kapitelverzeichnis. >Incipit ordinarius ordinis cysterciensis de divinis officiis.< (126r) >De dominicis et festivis diebus, qui veniunt in adventu domini. Capitulum primum.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 In prima dominica adventus domini in primis vesperis capitulum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  (162v) >De processione in die palmarum.< Dominica palmarum post terciam abbas accepta virga pastorali super gradum presbiterii arborum ramos ante terciam a secretario ibi locatos benedicat \u8230 \'85 (\u8230 \'85) qui et ipse subdyaconus interim aquam benedictam ponat. Text bricht ab, Fortsetzung von einer anderen Hand: (163r) Ubi sibi visum fuerit, cum vero dyaconus stola amictus fuerit \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et stando subdyaconus semper precedat dyaconum. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend: [LIBELLUS ANTIQUARUM DEFINITIONUM ORDINIS CISTERCIENSIS], dist. 7, cap. 5 (Exzerpt). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Studeant abbates, monachi et conversi, ut quando ad colloquium venerint, ipsorum colloquia gravitatem redoleant \u8230 \'85 }}\plain \f1\fs22 \endash  \u8230 \'85 ultimi omnium habeantur. \endash  Druck: Nomasticon Cisterciense S. 420.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

