\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 163v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 JACOBUS DE NUTIA (MONACHUS CAMPENSIS)}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 DE INFIRMIS MONACHIS VEL CONVERSIS TEMPORE INTERDICTI.}}\plain \f1\fs22  Am oberen Rand: Item qualiter tempore interdicti generalis agatur circa infirmos et decedentes magister Jacobus de Nucia, monachus Campensis. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 <S>ciendum quod infirmis monachis et conversis nostri ordinis confessio et sacramentum eukaristie tempore interdicti nullatenus sunt deneganda \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 Servi vel familiares seu extranei non possunt nec debent in nostris monasteriis seu cimeteriis sepeliri tempore interdicti. Et sic est finis. Text \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. C 86, 54rv.}

