\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 164v [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 LIBER SEXTUS}}\plain \f1\fs22 ], Exzerpt (VI.5.11.24). >Quomodo tempore generali interdicti divina officia celebrentur et ecclesiastica sacramenta ministrentur.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Alma mater ecclesia plerumque nonullam racionabiliter ordinat \u8230 \'85 }}\plain \f1\fs22 \endash  \u8230 \'85 celebrant supra dictis. \endash  Ed.: Friedberg Bd. 2, Sp. 1106 f. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Andree dicit in Glossa super predictum capitulum \u8218 \'82Alma mater\lquote , quod quando civitas, villa vel locus alius seu universitas interdicti existunt \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 quia tunc est iusta. \endash  165r\endash 166r leer.}

