\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 89ra\endash 104ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 CONSTITUTIONES FRATRUM SANCTAE CRUCIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 . (89ra\endash b) Prolog: >Prologus constitutionum fratrum sancte crucis. Hec sunt constitutiones fratrum sanctae crucis ordinis sancti Augustini.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Quoniam ex precepto regule iubemur habere cor unum et animam unam in domino \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 diligenter conscripsimus, in quo duas distinctiones annotavimus. (89rb\endash 104ra) Text: >Illi qui legunt constitutiones in conventu, legant rubricas sive titulos singulis capitulis anno- (89va) -tatos cum numero capitulorum hoc modo: distinctio prima, de officio ecclesie capitulum primum, de inclinationibus secundum capitulum et sic de ceteris. Prima distinctio continet viginti capitula. Incipit tabula de constitutionibus (\u8230 \'85) (89vb) >Prima distinctio. De officio ecclesie capitulum primum.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Matutinas et missam et omnes horas simul audiant fratres nostri, nisi cum aliquibus prelatus aliter dispensare in ecclesia voluerit \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 nec in libris studeant. \endash  Ed.: A. van de Pasch, De tekst van de constituties der Kruisheren van 1248, in: Bulletin de la Commission royale d\rquote histoire 117, 1952, S. 46\endash 95 (mit Ber\u252 \'fccksichtigung dieser Hs.); Beschreibung der Hs. ebd. S. 20 ff. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge: (104ra\endash vb) >De professione.< Hec sunt, que debent dici ad professionem faciendam \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 fratribus suis redeat ad locum suum. (104vb\endash 105rb) >De capitulo cotidiano.< Modus tenendi capitulum \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et fratres culpas faciant.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 105rb\endash 119ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 NOVAE CONSTITUTIONES FRATRUM SANCTAE CRUCIS}}\plain \f1\fs22  (1464/66). (105rb\endash vb) Prolog: >Prologus novarum constitutionum seu diffinitionum generalis capituli ordinis sancte crucis (105va) a tempore reformationis eiusdem ordinis, que facta fuit anno domini Mo CCCCo Xo usque ad annum presentem, scilicet Millesimum ccccm lxiiiim et ii duos [!] annos sequentes.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Quoniam patres et institutores nostre religionis in constitutionibus nostris capitulo generali tradiderunt auctoritatem interpretandi \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et ordinatas revocamus, cassamus et annichilamus. (105vb\endash 119ra) Text: >De officio no-vorum festorum.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Officium novorum festorum in missis et horis nocturnis pariter et diurnis volumus uniformiter iuxta formam instar ordinarii tradi-tam ab omnibus observari \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et ob id iuxta canonicas sanctiones male narrantes male impetrare. Zwischen den Kapiteln stellenweise Raum freigelassen. \endash  119rb und 119v leer.}

