\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22\cf1 132ra\endash 145vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 CONSTITUTIONES FRATRUM SANCTAE CRUCIS}}\plain \f1\fs22\cf1 . Prolog: \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 >Prologus constitutionum fratrum sancte crucis. Hec sunt constitutiones fratrum sanctae crucis ordinis sancti Augustini.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Quoniam ex precepto regule iubemur habere cor unum et animam unam in domino \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \endash  \u8230 \'85 diligenter conscripsimus, in quo duas distinctiones annotavimus\plain \f1\fs22\cf1 . (132rb\endash 145vb) Text: \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Illi qui legunt constitutiones in conventu}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , legant rubricas sive titulos singulis capitulis annotatos cum numero capitulorum n hoc modo: distinctio prima, \plain \f1\fs22\cf1 (132va) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 de officio ecclesie capitulum primum, de inclinationibus secundum capitulum et sic in ceteris. Prima distinctio continet viginti capitula. Incipittabula de constitutionibus< \plain \f1\fs22\cf1 (\u8230 \'85) (132vb) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 >Prima distinctio. De officio ecclesie capitulum primum.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Matutinas et missam et omnes horas simul audiant fratres nostri, nisi cum aliquibus prelatus aliter dispensare in ecclesia voluerit \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \endash  \u8230 \'85 nec in libris studeant\plain \f1\fs22\cf1 . \endash  Ed.: A. van de Pasch, De tekst van de constituties der Kruisheren van 1248, in: Bulletin de la Commission royale d\rquote histoire 117, 1952, S. 46\endash 95 (unter Benutzung dieser Hs.), Beschreibung der Hs. S. 22f.; E. A. Overgaauw, Het officium capituli \u8230 \'85, s.o., S.60f. (Hs. genannt mit dem Text der Anleitung f\u252 \'fcr die Benutzer aus Ms. C 2). Anschlie\u223 \'dfend Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge:(146ra\endash va) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 >Deprofessione.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Hec sunt, que debent dici ad professionem faciendam \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \endash  \u8230 \'85 fratribus suis redeat ad locum suum\plain \f1\fs22\cf1 . (146va\endash 147ra) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 >De capitulo cotidiano.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Modus tenendi capitulum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et fratres culpas faciant\plain \f1\fs22\cf1 .}

