\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 147ra\endash 162vb\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 EVANGELISTARIUM}}\plain \f1\fs22 . \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 >Incipiunt lectiones evangeliorum legende cum kalendis per totum annum.< \plain \f1\fs22 (147rb\endash 127va) TEMPORALE. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 >Dominicaprima adventus. Secundum Matheum.< In illo tempore. Cum appropinquasset \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Mt 21,1\endash 3]. (154ra) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 >In festo dedicacionis ecclesie.Secundum Lucam.< In illo tempore. Ingressus Ihesus \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Lc 19,1\endash 4]. (154rb\endash 162vb) SANCTORALE. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 >Sancti Andree apostoli.< Secundum Matheum.< In illo tempore. Ambulans Ihesus \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Mt 4,18\endash 20]. An den R\u228 \'e4ndern zahlreiche Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge (15. Jh., Ende bis zum 18. Jh.).}

