\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 7v\endash 126v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 USUARDUS SANGERMANENSIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 MARTYROLOGIUM}}\plain \f1\fs22 . Dem Text gehen Anweisungen zum Gebrauch des Kalendars:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Lecturus in capitulo etati lune deputa numerum \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 und Exzerpte aus den \u8222 \'84Institutiones Capituli Generalis Cisterciensis 1240 et 1256\ldblquote , dist. 6: De capitulo quotidiano et de emendatione culparum, voraus: (I)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  >Quod singulis annis in festo sancti Benedicti inchoetur regula.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 In festo sancti Benedicti annuatim regula inchoetur \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 inclinetur a conventu\plain \f1\fs22 . \endash  Druck: Nomasticon Cisterciense S. 316; (II)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  >De anniversariis abbatum.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Abbatum anniversaria in capitulo pronunciamus sic}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 : Obiit dominus N., nonus abbas Campi Sancte Marie \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et aliorum plurimorum sanctorum, martyrum, confessorum atque virginum\plain \f1\fs22 . \endash  Vgl.\plain \f2\charscalex99\expndtw60\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 ebd., S.\plain \f2\expndtw-30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 317. Text: <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 VIIII\plain \f1\fs22 > \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 kalendas Januarii luna. Vigilia natalis domini \u8230 \'85 \endash \plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 miracula\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 creberr