\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 127v\endash 180r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 BENEDICTUS DE NURSIA}}\plain \f1\fs22 :{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 REGULA}}\plain \f1\fs22 . (127v\endash 129v) Prolog: \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  >Incipit prologus regule beati Benedicti abbatis. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ausculta, o filia, precepta magistri et inclina aurem cordis tui \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 ut regni eius mereamur esse consortes\plain \f1\fs22 .(129v\endash 180r) Text:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  >De generibus monachorum.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Monachorum quatuor esse genera manifestum est \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 doctrine virtutumque culmina deo protegente pervenies. Tu autem domine miserere nostri. Deo gracias\plain \f1\fs22 . Stellenweise niederdeutsche Glossen (129r, 134r, 134v, 136r, 137r, 137v, 140r, 140v, 142r, 152v, 164r, 164v, 165r, 175r, 176v). \endash  Ed.: \plain \f1\fs24 CSEL\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 75,\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 S.\plain \f2\expndtw-15\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 1\endash 181\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 (ohne Kap.\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 60).\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 In\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 dieser\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 Hs.\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 liegt\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 die\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 zisterziensische\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 Fassung\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 des\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 Textes\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 vor;\plain \f2\charscalex99\expndtw75\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 vgl.\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 dazu\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 ebd.,\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 S.\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 LXIII\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 f.\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 CPL\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 Nr.\plain \f2\expndtw-15\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 1852;\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 CALMA\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 Bd.\plain \f2\expndtw-15\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 2,2,\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 S.\plain \f2\expndtw-15\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 210.\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 Anschlie\u223 \'dfend (180\plain \f2\lang1033\fs16 r\plain \f1\fs24 \endash 182\plain \f2\lang1033\fs16 r\plain \f1\fs24 )\plain \f2\expndtw-15\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen zum Martyrologium: Texte\plain \f2\expndtw-15\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 zum 11. Januar und 20. November;\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 (180\plain \f2\lang1033\fs16 v\plain \f1\fs24 \endash 181\plain \f2\lang1033\fs16 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) Psalmen und Gebete, die bei der Aufnahme\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 ins\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 Kloster\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 gesprochen\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 werden.\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Domine\plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Ihesu\plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Christe,\plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 qui\plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 dixisti\plain \f2\i\charscalex99\expndtw60\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 apostolis\plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 tuis:\plain \f2\i\expndtw30\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Ubi\plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 duo\plain \f2\i\expndtw30\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 vel\plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 tres\plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 congregati\plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 sunt\plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 [Mt\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 18,20].\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Tu\plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 hodie\plain \f2\i\charscalex99\expndtw45\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 medius\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 nostrum\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 adesse\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 digneris\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 \endash \plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 pervenire\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 valeamus.\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Qui\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 vi\plain \f1\fs24 (vit)\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 et\plain \f2\i\charscalex99\expndtw60\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 reg\plain \f1\fs24 (nat); \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Protege, domine, fideles tuos \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs24 vgl. CO Nr.\plain \f2\expndtw-30\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 4756b; ein Initium unleserlich;\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 (181\plain \f2\lang1033\fs16 r\plain \f1\fs24 )\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine deus omnipotens, qui elegisti locum istum ad serviendum tibi \u8230 \'85 2,}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 propter nomen tuum magnum\plain \f1\fs22 . Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 93. (181rv)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine, miserere nostri et ne despicias peccata nostra, sed respice ad deprecacionem \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 adiuva nos, sicut scis necessitatem nostram. Amem \plain \f1\fs22 [!]. (181v) Exkommunikationsformel. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Excommunicatio in ramis palmarum.\plain \f1\fs22 <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Auctoritate dei omnipotentis patris et filii et spiritus sancti et beate Marie et omnium sanctorum et ex parte tocius ordinis excommunicamus omnes conspiratores\u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 donec respiciant\plain \f1\fs22 . Gebet zur Haarschur (beim Eintritt ins Kloster). >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quando aliquis vel aliqua condetur, dicat hec collecta\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Presta, quesumus, omnipotens deus, ut famula tua, cuius hodie capitis comam pro divino amore deposui \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 in sempiternum custodias. Per Christum dominum nostrum. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . (182r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Commemoracio \plain \f1\fs22 der Verstorbenen des Ordens im Kapiteloffizium. \endash  182v leer.}

