\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 183r\endash 185v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 LIBELLUS ANTIQUARUM DEFINITIONUM ORDINIS CISTERCIENSIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 , dist. 15, cap. 1\endash 4.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  >De vita et religione monalium \plain \f1\fs22 [!]\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  distinctio. De paternitate, visitacione et incorporacione earum, capitulum primum.< Filie Syon exultent in rege suo, quem pater luminum eis patrem constituit et pastorem. Quicumque igitur pater abbas paternitatem alicuius abbacie monalium \plain \f1\fs22 [!]\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  iusto titulo \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 <ab aliis firmiter> observari. >Ista sunt sumpta ex diffinicionibus annalibus.< \plain \f1\fs22 \endash  Druck: Nomasticon Cisterciense S. 367\endash 470, hier S. 465\endash 470. Es folgt ein weiterer, zu gro\u223 \'dfen Teilen unleserlicher Text:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  M\plain \f1\fs22 <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 oniales\plain \f1\fs22 >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  inobedientes et \plain \f1\fs22 [\u8230 \'85]\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  possumus ab ordine separare \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 ordine celebrentur\plain \f1\fs22 .}

