\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 1\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 va\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 303\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 JACOBUS DE VORAGINE}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 LEGENDA AUREA}}\plain \f1\fs22 . (1\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ra\endash va\plain \f1\fs22 ) Prolog: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit prologus super legendas sanctorum, quam conpilavit frater Iacobus de natione \plain \f1\fs22 (?)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Ianuensis de ordine fratrum predicatorum\plain \f1\fs22 .< (Nachtrag von einer sp\u228 \'e4teren Hand:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Episcopi Genuensis\plain \f1\fs22 ).\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Universum tempus presentis vite in quatuor distinguitur \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 usque ad adventum\plain \f1\fs22 . (1\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 va\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 2\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 rc\plain \f1\fs22 ) Kapitelverzeichnis. (2\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 rc\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 303\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 vb\plain \f1\fs22 ) Text:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  >De adventu domini.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Adventus domini per quatuor septimanas agitur \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (5\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 vb\plain \f1\fs22 ) Cap. 2. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De ethimologia nominis\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Andreas interpretatur decorus vel respondens vel virilis ab andor, quod est nix }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 [!]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (\u8230 \'85) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De sancto Andrea apostolo.< Andreas et quidam alii discipuli tribus vicibus a domino sunt vocati \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 Tercium sacrificium iusticie, quod sacrificium constitit in obla \plain \f1\fs22 || \endash  Ed.: Maggioni, Legenda aurea. Kap. 60 fehlt. Zum Textbestand vgl. B. Fleith, Studien zur \u220 \'dcberlieferungsgeschichte der lateinischen Legenda aurea, Br\u252 \'fcssel 1991 (Subsidia hagiographica, 72), S. 105 (diese Hs.: LA 177); S. 361, Anm. 60; S. 508 (Hs. erw\u228 \'e4hnt). Kaeppeli Nr. 2154 (Hs. genannt).}

