\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 2ra\endash 107v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 LECTIONARIUM OFFICII}}\plain \f1\fs22 . (2ra\endash 14va) Dedicatio ecclesiae bis Octava dedicationis. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo dedicationis ecclesie. Sermo Augustini. Lectio prima\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quocienscumque, fratres carissimi, altaris vel templi festivitatem colimus \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (14va\endash 41vb) De sancta cruce. (14va\endash 18vb) Winterteil.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  >Iste sunt lecciones de sancta cruce legende in sextis feriis ab octava epyphanie domini usque ad septuagesimam. Johannes Crisostomus in Omelia xiii de sancta cruce. Prima feria sexta. Lectio prima.< \plain \f1\fs22 (14vb) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Si nosse desideras, karissime, crucis virtutem, audi, quanta dicere possum ad ipsius laudem \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22  (18vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Expliciunt lecciones de sancta cruce hyemales\plain \f1\fs22 .< (18vb\endash 41vb) Sommerteil.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  >Incipiunt lecciones de eadem estivales. Iste sunt leccio\plain \f1\fs22 - (19ra) -\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 nes legende in sextis feriis, quando fit officium in conventu de sancta cruce. A \u8218 \'82Deus omnium\lquote  usque ad adventum domini. Et notandum, quod quandoque ponitur plurale pro singulari licet raro, ut rogamus pro rogo vel huiusmodi. Prima feria sexta. Sermo beati Augustini episcopi de eo, quod dicit apostolus: Michi autem absit gloriari, nisi in cruce domini \plain \f1\fs22 [Gal 6,14]\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 . Lectio prima.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hec est doctrina, humilitatis preceptum, humilitatis commendacio, ut non gloriemur, nisi in cruce domini nostri Ihesu Christi \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (42ra\endash 63va) De beatavirgine. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sabbato primo post octavas epyphanie de beata virgine lectio prima. Iste sermo Augustini est de annunciacione. Iste sunt lecciones legende in sabbatis, quando fit officium de beata virgine\plain \f1\fs22 <EsfolgenErl\u228 \'e4uterungenzudenLesungen. (42rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sabbato primo. Lectio prima\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Castissimum Marie virginis uterum, clausum ventris cubiculum, signatum pudoris cenaculum merito plenissime collaudarem \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (47rb\endash 63rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Iste sunt lecciones legende in sabbatis, quando fit officium de beata virgine a \u8218 \'82Deus omnium\lquote  usque ad adventum.\plain \f1\fs22 < (47va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sermo beati Augustini de annunciacione. Lectio prima\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Adest nobis, dilectissimi, dies venerabilis beate Marie virgini dedicatus \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Es\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 fehlen\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Lesungen\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 vom\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 14.\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 bis\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 zum\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 22.\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Samstag;\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Lesungen\plain \f2\charscalex99\expndtw60\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 zum\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 13.\plain \f2\expndtw