\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 19va\endash 22rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 GREGORIUS TURONIENSIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 MIRACULORUM LIBRI VIII, Exzerpte}}\plain \f1\fs22 . (19va\endash 22rb) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 DE VIRTUTIBUS SANCTI MARTINI LIBRI IV, lib. 1}}\plain \f1\fs22 , cap. 11; lib. 2, cap. 24 und 25; lib. 3, cap. 8; lib. 4, cap. 29\endash 32, 42. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Textus sancti Gregorii Turonensis archiepiscopi de miraculis sancti Martini episcopi et confessoris\plain \f1\fs22 .< (19va\endash 20rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De Gallis suavis conversis\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Deficit lingua sterilis \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 si tempus persecutionis adesset\plain \f1\fs22 . (20rb\endash va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De homine omnibus menbris con\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 t\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 racto\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  In Biturico fuit quedam mulier, que concipiens peperit filium \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 per multorum annorum spatia perferatur\plain \f1\fs22 . (20va\endash 21 ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De paralitico sanato\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Illud pre ceteris admirandum miraculum vobis orantibus explicabo \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 Christi presidio roborati sunt\plain \f1\fs22 . (21ra\endash va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De mortuo suscitato\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Eo tempore, quo talia apud urbem Turonicam gerebantur \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 gesta cognovi\plain \f1\fs22 . (21va\endash b) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De fonte, quem vivens sanctus ut oriretur, obtinuit\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Exinde egressi Sanctonicum territorium ingressi sumus \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 super quem sanctus sedit antistes\plain \f1\fs22 . (21vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De incendio urbis Pictave\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Nec illud silendum puto \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et sic ecclesia liberata est\plain \f1\fs22 . (21vb\endash 22ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De eo, quod Agnes, Pictavensis abbatissa, de nauta quodam retulit\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Venerabilis vero Agnes, Pictavarum sanctimonialium abbatissa \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 non remo ducente\plain \f1\fs22 . (22ra\endash b) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De virtutibus beati viri Locotiacensi in monasterio\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Tempore post habito, cum usque Pictavam accessissemus urbem \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 quasi stadia quadraginta\plain \f1\fs22 . (22rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De contracto\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Puer quidam manibus pedibusque contractis \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 directus abscessit\plain \f1\fs22 . \endash  Ed.: MGH SS rer. Merov., Bd. 1,2, S. 134\endash 211 (hier S. 144 ff., 167 f., 184, 207 f., 206\endash 208 und 210). BHL Nr. 5618. (22rb) LIBER IN GLORIA CONFESSORUM,Kap. 7.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Fuit et in Nobiliacense pago urbis Turonice arbor \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 hanc arborem erectam\plain \f1\fs22 . \endash  Ed.: MGH, s.o., S. 294\endash 370 (hier S. 303). CPL Nr. 1024.}

