\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 319ra\endash 329vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 LECTIONES DE ASSUMPTIONE BMV}}\plain \f1\fs22 . (319ra\endash 328vb) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 PASCHASIUS RADBERTUS}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 EPISTULA BEATI HIERONYMI AD PAULAM ET EUSTOCHIUM DE ASSUMPTIONE BMV}}\plain \f1\fs22 ]. ||\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  rum fatear, Christi preconia \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et vos appareatis in gloria. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . \endash  Ed.: CCCM 56C, S. 109\endash 162, hier ab S. 111, Z. 35 (Text unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig durch Blattverlust). CPL Nr. 633; CPPM Bd. 2, Nr. 858; BHL (Novum Suppl.) Nr. 5355d; Lambert Bd. 3A, Nr. 309. (328va\endash 329vb) RADULPHUS CANTUARIENSIS (PS.-ANSELMUS LAUDUNENSIS): HOMILIA IN ASSUMPTIONE BMV. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit argumentum domini Anselmi Cantuariensis archiepiscopi\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Intravit Iesus \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Lc 10,38].\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Quoad gloriosam virginem, dei genitricem, lectio ista pertineat \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 scribere aggrediar\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Explicit argumentum. Lectio sancti evangelii secundum Lucam\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  In illo tempore. Intravit Iesus \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Lc 10,38\endash 39]. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Omelia venerabilis Anselmi Cantuariensis archiepiscopi de eadem lectione \u8218 \'82Intravit Iesus\plain \f1\fs22 <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  in quoddam castellum\lquote . In scriptura sacra res una et eadem locutionis invenitur diversa significare \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 sitientem lacte potavit, infirmum\plain \f1\fs22 || \endash  Druck: PL 95, Sp. 1505\endash 1508 (im Homiliar des Paulus Diaconus; hier bis Sp. 1507B; Text unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig durch Blattverlust); CCCM 64, S. 199\endash 203, hier bis S. 201. (330ra\endash vb) BEDA VENERABILIS: HOMILIA 25 IN DEDICATIONE ECCLESIAE (Lc 6,43\endash 48). ||\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  manna et virga Aaron \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Hbr 9,4].\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  In qua namque archa \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 dabit nos videre bona sua in terra viventium Ihesus Christus dominus noster, qui vivit et regnat cum patre in unitate spiritus sancti deus per omnia secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . \endash  Ed.: CC 122, S. 368\endash 378, hier ab S. 376, Z. 303 (Text unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig durch Blattverlust). CPL Nr. 1367.}

