\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 31vb\endash 33rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 GREGORIUS TURONENSIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 MIRACULORUM LIBRI VIII}}\plain \f1\fs22  (DE VIRTUTIBUS SANCTI MARTINI LIBRI IV, lib. 1, cap. 4\endash 6). >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Item de transitu sancti Martini confessoris\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Beatus autem Severinus, Coloniensis civitatis episcopus \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 fuisse revelatum\plain \f1\fs22 . (32rb\endash va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud capitulum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Eo namque tempore beatus Ambrosius \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 se eius exequiis deservisse\plain \f1\fs22 . (32va\endash b\endash 33rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De translacione corporis beati Martini episcopi et confessoris\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Opere precium est enim eciam illud inserere \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 silere nequimus. Adiuvante domino nostro Ihesu Christo. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . \endash  MGH SS rer. Merov., Bd. 1,2, ed. nova, S. 134\endash 211 (hier S. 140 ff.; Kap. 5: Exzerpt).}

