\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 99v\endash 100r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 GREGORIUS TURONENSIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 : [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 HISTORIARUM LIBRI X}}\plain \f1\fs22 , lib. 1, cap. 48]. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit epistola Gregorii Turonensis episcopi de transitu beati Martini\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Archadio et Honorio inperantibus sanctus Martinus Thuronorum episcopus, plenus virtutibus et sanctitate \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 anni quadringenti duodecim computantur\plain \f1\fs22 . \endash  Ed.: MGH SS rer. Merov., Bd. 1,1, ed. altera, S. 32 ff. CPL Nr. 1023. Text \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. C 10a, 22rb und Ms. C 11, 31ra.}

