\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\fs22 100r\endash 101r [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\fs22\chcbpat17 GREGORIUS TURONENSIS}}\plain \f2\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\fs22\chcbpat17 MIRACULORUM LIBRI VIII}}\plain \f2\fs22  (DE VIRTUTIBUS SANCTI MARTINI LIBRI IV, lib. 1, cap. 4\endash 6)]. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 De eo quod sanctus Severinus in transitu beati Martini vidit\plain \f2\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Beatus Severinus, Coloniensis episcopus \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 audivit psallencium chorum\plain \f2\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 De eo quod sanctus Ambrosius in transitu eius vidit\plain \f2\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Eo tempore beatus Ambrosius \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\fs22 (100v)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  cuius laus ab ore eius numquam recessit. Ihesus Christus dominus noster. \plain \f2\fs22 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Qui cum patre vivit etc.\plain \f2\fs22 < >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Quomodo translatum est corpus eius\plain \f2\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Opere precium est enim inserere lectioni \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 silere nequivimus. Adiuvante domino nostro Ihesu Christo. Qui cum patre et spiritu sancto vivit et regnat per omnia secula seculorum. \plain \f2\fs22 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Amen\plain \f2\fs22 .< >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Explicit translacio beati Martini episcopi\plain \f2\fs22 .< \endash  Ed.: MGH SS rer. Merov., Bd. 1,2, S. 134\endash 211 (hier S. 140 ff.). Text \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. C 10a, 23ra\endash vb. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend Notae::{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Nota quod beatus Iheronymus dicit in Vitaspatrum de quodam viro sancto, qui rogavit dominum, ei ostenderet, qualiter anima de corpore sine angustia duceretur \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 ad celum protinus evolavit. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Nota quod olim in Constantinopoli in quadam ecclesia erat ymago beati virginis. Ante quam dependebat velum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 que precedit diem dominicam\plain \f2\fs22 . \endash  101v leer.}

