\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 124ra\endash 171va [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 VERBA SENIORUM}}\plain \f1\fs22 ] (= Vitaspartum, lib. 5\endash 6). (102ra\endash b) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Cum omnis prefacio textum oportune preveniens aut sequentis materie predicet  qualitatem \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 detrimenta non novit\plain \f1\fs22 . (124ra\endash b) Kapitelverzeichnis.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Prima igitur pars continet de profectu monachi, ydonee satis ostendens \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 confirmata quam verbis. Incipit liber quartus de vita, verbis et exemplis sanctorum partum in partes decem et novem divisus ad profectum monachi\plain \f1\fs22 . (124va\endash 163rb)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ad profectum conversacionis quidam frater venire cupiens, interrogavit senem quondam \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 sed magis convertatur et vivat. >Huc usque de greco in latinum transtulit Pelagius diaconus ecclesie romane. Ab hinc autem Johannes subdyaconus.< \plain \f1\fs22 (163rb\endash 171va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Capitulum primum.\plain \f1\fs22 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Abiit aliquando Sacharias ad abbatem suum Silvanum et invenit eum in excessu mentis \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et vocavit eam dominus. Sic erit et anime. >Finit liber quartus.< \plain \f1\fs22 (171va\endash 172ra)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Hec sunt verba septem, que misit abbas Moyses abbati Pastori, in quibus continetur consummata virtus et perfectio monachi.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Dixit abbas Moyses primo: Quia debet homo quasi mortuus esse socio suo \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et in sempiternum est requies, gracia verbo dei. Amen. \plain \f1\fs22 >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Explicit.\plain \f1\fs22 < \endash  Druck: PL 73, Sp. 855\endash 1022 (umfangreichere Fassung, ohne Prolog und Kapitelverzeichnis). BHL Nr. 6528 und 6529; Lambert Bd. 3B, Nr. 570. Text \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. B 54, 72ra (weitere Angaben in: Kat. D\u252 \'fcsseldorf, Bd. 1, S. 195). \u8222 \'84Verba septem abbatis Moysis\ldblquote  (171va) \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. B 54, 138va. \endash  172rb und 172v leer.}

