\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 183r\endash 193r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 RABBI SAMUEL}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 EPISTULA AD RABBI ISAAC DE ADVENTU MESSIAE ALPHONSO BONIHOMINIS INTERPRETE}}\plain \f1\fs22 . \endash  Druck: PL 149, Sp. 337\endash 368.  Exzerpt dieses Textes \u252 \'fcber liefert in Ms. B 5, 354r. Stegm\u252 \'fcller RB Nr. 1183,1; D\u237 \'edaz y D\u237 \'edaz Nr. 2098; Kaeppeli Nr. 146. Weitere Angaben in: Kat. D\u252 \'fcsseldorf, Bd. 1, S. 63. \endash  193v leer.}

