\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 I r\endash Cxlvii r [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes <Contractus>}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 SERMONES DE SANCTIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 ]. Bestand: Schneyer Bd. 3, S. 439\endash 443, Nr. 88\endash 91; 94\endash 107; 109; 110; 112\endash 118; 121\endash 123; 125\endash 129; 131\endash 133. Schluss abweichend bei Nr. 88, 98, 100, 101, 123, 129, 131 und 133. Zwischen den Sermones des Johannes Contractus finden sich folgende Predigten aus anderen Quellen: (24v\endash 27v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In cathedra sancti Petri\plain \f1\fs22 .< Schneyer Bd. 9, S. 617, Nr. 24; (34r\endash 38r) [GUILELMUS DE HISPANIA: SERMO DE ANNUNTIATIONE BMV].Schneyer Bd. 2, S. 463, Nr. 45 (Schluss abweichend); (76r\endash 79v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De sancto Dominico.\plain \f1\fs22 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Surrexit Helias \u8230 \'85 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 [Sir 48,1]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 . Verbum illud congrue potest exponi ad commendacionem beati Dominici}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 . Legitur siquidem \plain \f1\fs22 (76v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  in eius legenda, quod mater sua \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 ubi cum deo sine fine regnant, quo nos meritis sancti Dominici perducat, qui cum patre et spiritu sancto per infinita secula vivit et regnat. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . (82r\endash 85v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De sancta Clara.\plain \f1\fs22 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Venerunt nupcie agni \u8230 \'85 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 [Apc 19,7]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 . Verbum illud congrue potest exponi de beata Clara, que Christum elegerat in sponsum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 (85r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  virtute sunt repulsi. Rogemus Christum, ut beate Clare intervencione nos ab hostibus \plain \f1\fs22 (85v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  protegat et ad regnum eternum perducat. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . (92r\endash 94v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De sancto Augustino.\plain \f1\fs22 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Exultate et letamini \u8230 \'85 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 [Ioel 2,23]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 . Verba ista possunt sumi ad commendacionem sancti Augustini, doctoris egregii}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 . Et commendatur hic a duobus. Primo a doctrine utilitate \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 eterno honore perfruitur. Ipso concedente, qui vivit et regnat sine fine. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . (94v\endash 97r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De decollatione beati Johannis.\plain \f1\fs22 < Schneyer Bd. 9, S. 895, Nr. 133 (Schluss abweichend); (106r\endash 109r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De sancto Mauricio\plain \f1\fs22 .< Schneyer Bd. 9, S. 896, Nr. 144; (114r\endash 116r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De sancto Luca ewangelista\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Eccesupermontes \u8230 \'85 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 [Na 1,15]. }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Verba ista possunt sumi ad commendacionem sancti Luce ewangeliste, qui commendatur hic a duobus. Primo a sanctitate vite, quam in se habuit \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 Ideo ad montem superne habitacionis pervenit. Quo nos eciam perducat, qui per omnia secula regnat. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . (118v\endash 122r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De animabus\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sancta et salubris est cogitacio \u8230 \'85 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 [II Mcc 12,46]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 . In verbis istis describitur duplex effectus oracionis \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et ad gaudia celi perducantur, ubi cum deo sancti sine fine gaudebunt. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . (124v\endash 126v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De sancta Elisabeth.\plain \f1\fs22 < Schneyer Bd. 9, S. 897, Nr. 158; (132r\endash 137v) [GUILELMUS BERNARDI DE NARBONNE: SERMO IN VIGILIA NATIVITATIS DOMINI]. Schneyer Bd. 2, S. 422, Nr. 5 (Schluss abweichend); (137v\endash 142v) [GUILELMUS BERNARDI DE NARBONNE: SERMO IN NATIVITATE DOMINI]. Schneyer Bd. 2, S. 441, Nr. 277 (Schluss abweichend). \endash  Druck: Hain/Copinger 5676. (Cxlvii v\endash CXLIX r) Alphabetisches Register;anschlie\u223 \'dfend Vermerk von einer anderen Hand:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Scriptus est iste liber per manus fratris Henrici de Morsa dyaconi et finitus circa annum domini M cccc lxxiii\plain \f1\fs22 . \endash  CXLIX v und CL leer.}

