\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 30v\endash 42ar {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 PROCESSUS IN ELECTIONE NOVI ABBATIS AUT NOVAE ABBATISSAE}}\plain \f1\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 In novellis diffinicionibus, distinctione octava, capittulo sexto habetur sic: In vacantibus monasteriis ad novi pastoris substitucionem nullatenus procedatur, nisi patre abbate vel eius commissario requisito primitus et presente \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (38r) Forma iuramenti electoris\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ego frater N iuro et promitto omnipotenti deo et beate Marie virgini et super hoc ewangelium Christi illum eligere in abbatem huius monasterii, quem credam futurum esse in spiritualibus et temporalibus utiliorem\u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (40r) PRG XXVI, Nr. 14, 15a; ebd. XXXII, Nr. 14; Rituale cisterciense S. 516. (40v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oremus\plain \f1\fs22 .< Deshusses Nr. 198, 4119;Rituale cisterciense S. 400. (41r) Forma iuramenti.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Non vendam neque alienabo neque impignerabo neque de novo infeudabo possessiones vel iura ac bona ad monasterium meum pertinencia \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 Tradimus vobis et comittimus per has claves regimen et curam huius monasterii in spiritualibus et temporalibus et attendatis, ut semper sitis fidelis et prudens dispensator in domo domini\plain \f1\fs22 . Sp\u228 \'e4terer Nachtrag: \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Eamus in pace. Et sic electio tota facta\plain \f1\fs22 .}

