\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 42v\endash 43v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 MODUS ABSOLVENDI VIVORUM ET DEFUNCTORUM}}\plain \f1\fs22 . <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Item si conventus absolucionem pecierit et legerit \u8218 \'82Confiteor\lquote , poterit eos capitulariter ibi absolvere a casibus sibi reservatis hoc modo vel simili: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Indulgenciam et remissionem omnium peccatorum nostrorum}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  per graciam sancti spiritus tribuat nobis omnipotens et misericors dominus. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Alia absolucio\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Dominus noster Ihesus Christus per suam magnam misericordiam nos absolvat \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eciam poterit dare certis confessoribus auctoritatem suam ad absolvendum personas monasterii infra certum tempus. Absolucio super defunctos ordinis visitando sepul\plain \f1\fs22 - (43r) -\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 chras\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  In primis legantur psalmi \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 (\u8230 \'85)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Oremus.\plain \f1\fs22 Bruylants, Oraisons, Nr. 214; Deshusses Nr. 1444; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Deinde absolvantur in hunc modum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Dominus noster Ihesus Christus dignetur nos absolvere et ego auctoritate ipsius atque paterna vos absolvo ab omnibus sentenciis et irregularitatibus \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 quando statim baptizati fuistis. In nomine patris et filii et spiritus sancti. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 .}

