\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 53r\endash 54r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 EXCOMMUNICATIO IN RAMIS PALMARUM}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Item excommunicacio in ramis palmarum. Singulis annis secundum diffiniciones in ramispalmarum in omnibus capitulis ordinis post habitum sermonem postquam abbas aut alius loco eius presidens pro statu universalis sancta matris ecclesie ac pro unus et \plain \f1\fs22 (53v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  defunctis oraciones instituerit exposueritque laicis articulos hic contentos surgens accepta stola et candela accensa et pastorali baculo, si abbas fuerit, publicabit sentenciam excommunicacionis hoc modo\plain \f1\fs22 :< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Auctoritate dei omnipotentis patris et filii et spiritus sancti ac beate Marie et omnium sanctorum generalisque capituli et tocius ordinis nostri cisterciensis excommunicamus et excommunicatos denunciamus omnes conspiratores \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 donec se emendaverint et resipiscant\plain \f1\fs22 .}

