\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 60r\endash 67v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 DE INVESTITIONE ET PROFESSIONE SORORUM ORDINIS SANCTI AUGUSTINI}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De investicione sororum ordinis sancti Augustini\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Postquam puella vel persona illa, que ad habitum religionis assumenda est, sufficienter in his, que religio postulat, examinata fuerit}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 Hymnus AH Bd. 50, Nr. 144. (60v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Collecta\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus, qui corda fidelium sancti spiritus illustracione docuisti \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 CO Nr. 1666;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Acciones nostras, quesumus, domine, et aspirando preveni \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 CO Nr. 74; anschlie\u223 \'dfend Psalmen 14, 23 und 50; (61v\endash 62v) Litanei; (62v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oremus\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Omnipotens, sempiterne deus, qui iustis supplicantium peticionibus semper presto es, exaudi preces nostras \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus, amator castitatis et auctor, qui beatum Iohannem apostolum et ewangelistam relictis thalamis te sequi fecisti \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Wilmart, Auteurs spirituels, S. 503; (63r) CAO Nr. 7524;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  deinde alius versus: Elegi abiecta esse in domo domini mei Iesu Christi \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Collecta\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus misericors, deus clemens, cui bona cuncta placent \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Tu famulabus tuis, quesumus domine, bonos mores placatus institue \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; CO Nr. 889a/b; PRG XX, Nr. 22; (63v) Antiphonen CAO Nr. 4403 (4404), 5251,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Que preparate\plain \f1\fs22 , CAO Nr. 5328. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ingressa vero clausuram a priorissa et subpriorissa ante fores in osculo pacis suscipitur et consequenter ab aliis sororibus in dextro choro et deinde in sinistro supplicans singulis iunctis minibus et dicens: Ora pro me. Et postea dirigatur ad locum\plain \f1\fs22 .< Bl. 60r: Hufnagelnotation auf drei Linien. \endash  Zum Einkleidungsritus vgl. R. T. M. van Dijk, De constituties der Windesheimse vrouwen kloosters v\u243 \'f3\u243 \'f3r 1559. Bijdrage\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 tot\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 de\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 institutionele\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 geschiedenis\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 van\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 het\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 kapittel\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 van\plain \f2\charscalex99\expndtw75\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Windesheim,\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 2\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Bde.,\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Nijmegen\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 1986,\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Bd.\plain \f2\expndtw-30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 1,\plain \f2