\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 73r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 ORDO PROFESSIONIS MONACHORUM}}\plain \f3\lang1033\fs22 , \plain \f1\fs22 Fortsetzung.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Deus, qui nos a vanitate saeculi conversos ad supernae vocationis bravium accendis \plain \f1\fs22 (CO Nr. 1835)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 ad ea, quae perseverantibus in te dignatus es promittere, pertingamus. Per \plain \f1\fs22 >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Christum Dominum nostrum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . \endash  Vgl. Rituale cisterciense S. 392\endash 400. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend: F ORMA IURAMENTI, dt. und lat.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ich N. N. schwere, da\u223 \'df wan mir einiges ambt soll auffgetragen werden \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 also woll mir Gott helffen vnd alle seine liebe heiligen\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Forma iuramenti exprimenda a profitente\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ego frater >N.< juro, quod si mihi aliquod officium commitatur \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 Sic me deus adjuvet et hec sancti evangelii verba \u8218 \'82In principio erat verbum\lquote \plain \f1\fs22 . \endash  73v leer.}

