\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 246rv {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 LIBELLUS NOVELLARUM DEFINITIONUM ORDINIS CISTERCIENSIS}}\plain \f3\lang1033\fs22 , \plain \f1\fs22 dist. 13, cap. 2. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ex novellis diffinitionibus capitulum secundum distinctionis terciedecime. De carnibus non comedendis\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quicumque notorie fuerit deprehensus \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 Esum carnium nullus de iure vel consuetudine audeat petere, nisi secundum quod in diffinicione, distinc. xiii, capitulo De pitanciis continetur, sub penis ibi contentis\plain \f1\fs22 . \endash  Druck: Nomasticon Cisterciense S. 531 f. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend: (246v) LIBELLUS ANTIQUARUM DEFINITIONUM ORDINIS CISTERCIENSIS, dist. 13, cap. 3, Exzerpt.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Ubi sic habetur: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 De pitantiis petendis antiquus ordo servetur et ad abbatis arbitrium omnia disponantur \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 nisi infirmis fuerit aut minutus. >Hec ibi Capitulo iiio\plain \f1\fs22 .< \endash  Druck: Ebd. S. 457.}

