\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 246v\endash 249r Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge. 1) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 [PS.-]ANSELMUS CANTUARIENSIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 ADMONITIO MORIENTI}}\plain \f1\fs22 , Exzerpt.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Interrogacio beati Anselmi episcopi Cantuariensis circa circa \plain \f1\fs22 [!]\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  morientem. Sic debet frater proximus morti interrogari: Frater, letaris, quia in Christi fide morieris \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 Et securus moriatur, cui hec dicuntur nec videbit mortem in eternum\plain \f1\fs22 . \endash  Druck: PL 158, Sp. 685. Vgl. Rudolf, Ars moriendi, S. 57.2) (247r) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 GLOSSA ORDINARIA}}\plain \f1\fs22 ], Exzerpt.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Cassiodorus super psalmo \u8218 \'82Dirupisti vincula mea\lquote  etc\plain \f1\fs22 . [Ps 115,17].\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Iste versus tante virtutis a quibusdam creditur \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 trina confessione dicatur. \plain \f1\fs22 \endash  Druck: PL 113, Sp. 1038.3){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 INDULGENTIAE ORDINIS CISTERCIENSIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 . Erw\u228 \'e4hnt sind die Abl\u228 \'e4sse der P\u228 \'e4pste Urban VI. (1383) und Sixtus IV. (1471). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 <}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 S}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 >}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ciendum, quod anno incarnacionis dominice 1383 o sanctissimus in throno pater et dominus dominus Urbanus papa sextus concessit universis abbatibus, prioribus, monachis ceterisque personis utriusque sexus cisterciensis ordinis omnium peccatorum, de quibus corde contriti et ore confessi fuerint, plenam remissionem semel tamen in mortis articulo\u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \plain \f1\fs22 (247v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 prout in Bulla desuper data melius continetur\plain \f1\fs22 . 4) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 FORMAE ABSOLUTIONIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 .\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Forma absolucionis generalis indulgencie a pena et culpa in mortis articulo dicenda\plain \f1\fs22 . (248r) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 <A>uctoritate dei et sancte Marie et beatorum Petri et Pauli apostolorum et sancte romane ecclesie michi concessa ego te absolvo \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et do tibi sanctissimum iubileum in nomine patris et filii et spiritus sancti. Amen. In casu inopinate mortis forte satis est, si dicatur: \plain \f1\fs22 <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 E\plain \f1\fs22 >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 go te absolvo ab omnibus sentenciis, penis et culpis in nomine patris et filii et spiritus sancti. Amen. Forma absolucionis circa morientes fratres nostros premissis igitur \u8218 \'82Confiteor\lquote  et \u8218 \'82Misereratur\lquote . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 <D>ominus noster Jhesus Christus per suam piissimam misericordiam et }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 (248v) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 meritum sue dignissime passionis te absolvat \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 in nomine patris et filii et spiritus sancti. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 .}

