\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 173ra\endash 296vb [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 GUILELMUS PERALDUS}}\plain \f1\fs22 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 DE ERUDITIONE RELIGIOSORUM}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit prologus in librum erudicionis religiosorum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Erudire Iherusalem ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 [Ier 6,8]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 . Iherusalem secundum nominis interpretacionem, que est pacifica..}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f1\fs22  (175ra\endash 177vb) Inhalts\u252 \'fcbersicht zum Werk. (177vb) Text: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit liber erudicionis religiosorum\plain \f1\fs22 ;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  prima pars huius libri de gracia et eductione a seculo facta. Capitulum primum.\plain \f1\fs22 <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Qui graciam acceptam non agnoscit\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  de ea gracias non agit ... \endash  ... O quam gloriosa dicta sunt de te\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  civitas dei \plain \f1\fs22 [Ps 86,3]\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\fs22 >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Explicit liber qui intitulatur eruditio religiosorum. Anno domini millesimo quadringentesimo sexagesimo quarto, decimo nono kal. februarii luna iii ipso die sancti Felicis pesbiteri et confessoris \plain \f1\fs22 (= 14.Jan.).< \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Per manus fratris Arnoldi de Stypell alias de Erley\plain \f1\fs22 . \endash  Druck: Speculum\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 religioso-\plain \f2\charscalex99\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 rum\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 sive\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 opusculum\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 de\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 eruditione\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 religiosorum\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 ...\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 fratris\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Humberti\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 de\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Romanis\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 ...,\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Breslau\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 1747\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (Hs.\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 verglichen).\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Bloomfield/Guyot\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Nr.\plain \f2\expndtw-30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 1939\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (mit Suppl.); Kaeppeli Nr.\plain \f2\expndtw-30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 1625; Hamesse/Szyller Nr.\plain \f2\expndtw-15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 14116, 27091. VL2\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Bd.\plain \f2\expndtw-30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 10,\plain \f2\charscalex99\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Sp.\plain \f2\expndtw-30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 1116\endash 1129. Werk \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. B 92, 1r.
