\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 1r\endash 10r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 BIRGITTA SUECICA}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 REGULA SALVATORIS (Fassung \u931 S)}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit Regula sancti salvatoris de humilitate, castitate et paupertate. Cap. I.\plain \f1\fs22 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Principium itaque huius religionis et et }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 [!]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  salutis est vera humilitas \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 quod terra sunt et in terram revertuntur\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 1452\plain \f1\fs22 .< Darunter: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Explicit Regula beate Brigitte, cui coniugi debet regula beati Augustini, ut stet regula sancte Brigitte pro constitucionibus. Et regula sancti Augustini pro regula illius religionis novelle. Quia constitucio ecclesiastica tenet, quod non fiant alique congregaciones aut conventicula religionum nisi sub aliqua regula approbata etc\plain \f1\fs22 .< \endash  Ed.:\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 S.\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Eklund\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (Hg.),\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Sancta\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Birgitta,\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Opera\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 minora,\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Bd.\plain \f2\expndtw-15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 1:\plain \f2\charscalex99\expndtw60\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Regula\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 sancti\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Salvatoris,\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Stockholm\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 1975\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (Hs.\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 genannt\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 S.\plain \f2\expndtw-30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 11),\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 S.\plain \f2\expndtw-30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 146\endash 172;\plain \f2\charscalex99\expndtw60\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 zur Textfassung\plain \f2\expndtw-15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 vgl. S.\plain \f2\expndtw-30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 25\plain \f2\expndtw-30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 f. K. B. Westman, Birgitta-Studier, Bd.\plain \f2\expndtw-30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 1, Uppsala\plain \f2\charscalex99\expndtw75\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 1911,\plain \f2\expndtw60\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 S.\plain \f2\expndtw-15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 271\plain \f2\expndtw60\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (mit\plain \f2\expndtw60\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Nennung\plain \f2\expndtw60\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 dieser  Hs.); VL2 Bd.\plain \f2\expndtw-15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 1,\plain \f2\expndtw60\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Sp.\plain \f2\expndtw-15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 869\plain \f2\expndtw-30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 f.;\plain \f2\expndtw60\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 CALMA Bd.\plain \f2\expndtw-30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 2,4, S.\plain \f2\expndtw-30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 411, Nr.\plain \f2\expndtw-30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 2.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

