\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 10r\endash 21v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 VITA, CANONIZATIO ET MIRACULA BEATAE BIRGITTAE}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Excerpta de vita, morte, translatione et canonizacione beate Brigitte et miraculis eius, que fuit ducissa Swecie. Scripta per fratrem Albertum, monachum monasterii Vallis Sancti Petri in Heistirbach, sub anno domini Millesimo quadringentesimo quinquagesimo tercio, quarta decima mensis julii\plain \f1\fs22 .< (10v\endash 14r) BIRGERUS UPPSALENSIS: VITA BIRGITTAE. BHL Nr. 1335 (ohne Prolog;gek\u252 \'fcrzt; Schluss abweichend). CALMA Bd. 2,4, S. 410, Nr. 2. (14r\endash 18v) Miracula.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Cum autem transferri deberet ad Sweciam a suis, latrones a quodam castro }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 (14v) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 exierunt armati, ut eos spoliarent \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 Qui confusi cum admiracione redierunt ad castrum suum\plain \f1\fs22 . Vgl. AASS Okt. Bd. 4, S. 531. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud miraculum in Polonia\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 In monasterio quodam regni Polonie portitores corporis eius intraverunt ad audiendam missam \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 Inicium vero signorum eius in terra Swecie hoc fuit\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Miraculum in regno Swecie primum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Anno domini Mocococolxxiiii, feria tercia post penthecostes, nobilis quidam Haquinus captus est a inimicis et strictissime ligatus ductus est ad mare, ut portaret ad terram Almanie \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 (15r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Postea per regem et procures libertati datus et restitutus est\plain \f1\fs22 . BHL Nr. 1349 (Bartholdus de Roma: Vita et miracula sanctae Birgittae, Exzerpt, hier: AASS Okt. Bd. 4, S. 531). >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud miraculum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Nobilis quidam Iohannes nomine, nacione Alamanus, blasphemavit beatam Brigittam, dum primo audivit reliquias eius in Watzsteno locatas \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et tanta facilitate peregit iter ac si infirmus non fuisset\plain \f1\fs22 . BHL Nr. 1349 (s.o., Exzerpt, hier: AASS Okt. Bd. 4, S. 532). >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud valde horrendum miraculum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Quedam mulier, cum communicasset in die pasche, recepit corpus Christi de ore suo et ligavit in vitta sua \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 (15v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Et postea ponit videre corpus Christi et in ecclesia ad adorandum persistere\plain \f1\fs22 . Vgl. AASS Okt. Bd. 4, S. 532. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud miraculum\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quidam in xl annis numquam confessus est, qui audita fama beate Brigitte ivit ad confessionem et dixit se nichil pecasse \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et gracias egit deo\plain \f1\fs22 . BHL Nr. 1349 (s.o., Exzerpt, hier: AASS Okt. Bd. 4, S. 532). >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud miraculum\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Mulier quedam prope Alvastrum, monasterium ordinis cisterciensis, pauper in peculio, sed dives vita pura, continuo decem annis in sinistro brachio dolorem gravissimum est perpessa\u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 adhuc super est induratis gravis affliccio ire ei\plain \f1\fs22 . BHL Nr. 1349 (s.o., Exzerpt, hier: AASS Okt. Bd. 4, S. 532). >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud miraculum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Rusticus quidam de parochia Dingetuna, cum intraret lectum cum uxore sua de sero \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 (16r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  deus per ipsam multa miracula ostendit, ut eius sanctitatem declaret\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud miraculum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Dominus Andriolus, miles de Neapulis, habebat guerram cum aliquibus nobilibus eiusdem civitatis, qui dicuntur de Constancia, tam implacabilem guerram, quod multi ex utraque parte interempti sunt \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 (16v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Aliud quod pax miraculose facta fuit, quam tamen nec papa nec regina antea facere potuerunt\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud miraculum\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Frater quidam ordinis minorum, secretarius regine Cypri, qui vocabatur Anthonius de Arragonia, cum domina Brigitta venit de Famagusta ad Iherusalem \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \plain \f1\fs22 (17r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 ut aliquid inde consolacionis recipiatis\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De miraculis eius\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 <I>gitur postquam dominus dedit requiem beate Brigitte a laboribus suis \u8230 \'85 }}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 per sollempnes viros, qui causa prolixitatis hic non inseruntur\plain \f1\fs22 . (18v\endash 20r) De canonizatione beatae Birgittae. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Que requirantur ad canonizacionem\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quoniam, ut tradunt iuriste, ad canonizacionem alicuius sancti vel sancte requiritur primo, ut expectatur, quod alique persone honeste et auctentice denuncient factum romano pontifici \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 auctoritate summi pontificis sancti approbate\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De Adam Cardinali anglico\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[13].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Iste Adam cardinalis ex consensu et eleccione pape prebuit se respondere omnibus adversariis \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 (20r) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Hucusque cardinalis Adam, qui mortuo Urbano et succedente Bonifacio nono restitutus est in gradum suum\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De canonizacione beate Brigitte\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[14].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Igitur Urbano sexto defuncto successit eidem Bonifacius nonus, qui beatam Brigittam cum magna sollempnitate cathologo sanctorum ascripsit \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22   \endash  \u8230 \'85  et nos errare non permittat eum invocando devote dicamus\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ympnum\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 50, Nr. 144 (Str. 1). >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur canonizacio\plain \f1\fs22 .< (20v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ad honorem >omnipotentis< patris et filii et spiritus sancti et ad exaltacionem fidei christiane religionis augmentum et sedacionis scismatis et fidei ac ecclesie unionem \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 Oretis pro me, dicit Summus pontifex\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Finit canonizacio. Sequitur miraculum valde insigne\plain \f1\fs22 .< (21r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[16].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quidam in Ytalia nomine Silvester, curatus in Monteca ecclesia, que distat ab alma et inclita urbe Roma ad duas dietas cum dimidia, infirmabatur per quinquaginta continuosdies \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 quod pro quocumque sanctissima Brigitta apud altissimum oraverit, impetrabit. 1453, 14. julii\plain \f1\fs22 .}

