2v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Incipit liber quintus celestium revelacionum Christi ad beatam Brigittam de regno Swecie \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 prout alios libros translare solitus erat\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Explicit prologus secundus\plain \f1\fs22 .< (73r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Vidi tronum in celo, in quo sedebat dominus Ihesus Christus ut judex \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et cogitacionibus finietur vita et spes eius\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Explicit liber questionum\plain \f1\fs22 .< (86v\endash 92v) Exzerpte\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 aus\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 den\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 B\u252 \'fcchern\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 2,\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 4,\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 6,\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 7.\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Capitulum\plain \f2\i\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 xxxix\plain \f2\i\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 sexti\plain \f2\i\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 libri\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Demon\plain \f2\i\charscalex99\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 quidam apparuit in divino iudicio \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 ad tuum monasterium consolator\plain \f1\fs22 . \endash  Ed.: Buch 1: C.-G. Undhagen (Hg.), Sancta Brigitta: Revelaciones, Book I\plain \f2\charscalex99\expndtw75\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 with Magister Mathias\rquote  prologue, U