\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 153\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 177\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 LIBER USUUM CISTERCIENSIS, Exzerpt}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequuntur aliqua cerimonialia capitula ex usibus extracta, que ignorari non debent, eo quod sepe sunt necessaria\plain \f1\fs22 .< (153\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 154\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 ) Kapitelverzeichnis. (154\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  r\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur brevis doctrina quasi metrice docens ordinem, quem debent habere fratres circa morientes atque defunctos\plain \f1\fs22 .< >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quo ordine precedendum fit ad communicandum infirmum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Taliter est danda communio denique sancta \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Walther I Nr. 19097. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Qualiter se habeant fratres iniungendo infirmum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Ungens ter pulsat moriens quarter et tabulam dat \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quo ordine procedant fratres ad morientem sive defunctum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Hinc ad defunctum vadant hoc ordine fratres / fons thus lux crux abbas senes iuvenes novi convers\plain \f1\fs22 (?)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\fs22 >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quo ordine ef- feratur defunctus ad ecclesiam.< Cum lotus fuerit, sic in choro baiuletur / fons thus lux crux, hinc monachi iuvenesque senesque \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quo ordine stent abbas et ministri circa defunctum in ecclesia\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Sic stent in choro fons, thus, lux, crux simul abbas\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quo ordine efferatur corpus ad tumultum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Ibunt ad tumultum fons thus crux simul abbas \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 (154\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quo ordine redeant a tumulto\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Vaditur a tumulto fons thus lux crux simul abbas \u8230 \'85 Ne corrumpatis usus vicio novitatis \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quo ordine inungantur et communicentur infirmi. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Ad inungendum infirmum pulsetur signum tamdiu donec unum, Pater noster possit dici \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 discernere poterit lector intelligens. Et ideo de his dicta sufficiant\plain \f1\fs22 .}

