\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 178\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 189\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 DE DIVINO OFFICIO}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Parvum abbreviatum docens quomodo agendum sit divinum officium tam in missis quam in commemoracionibus et hystoriis. Et hoc inchoandis a festo beati Johannis Baptiste usque prope septuagesimam secundum litteras a, b, c, d, e, f, g pro littera dominicali currentes. Et primo quando pro littera dominicali currit A, tunc sic fit\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  A littera dominicalis. In die circumcisionis domini ad laudes prima commemoracio exit de dominica antiphona \u8218 \'82Dum medium silen\plain \f1\fs22 (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 cium\plain \f1\fs22 )\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 \lquote  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 Deinde de octavis sanctorum per ordinem. Explicit. Deo gracias\plain \f1\fs22 .}

