\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 190\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 201\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 LIBER USUUM CISTERCIENSIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 , Fortsetzung des Textes vom Bl. 153\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 177\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 . ><\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Q\plain \f1\fs22 >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 uomodo et quo ordine libri biblie legantur in refectorio et ubi lector mense incipere debet\plain \f1\fs22 .< <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 I\plain \f1\fs22 >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 n adventu domini legitur Ysaias propheta \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 (190\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 ) Liturgische Merkverse. <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 D\plain \f1\fs22 >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 isce per hoc scriptum, quid sit vel quando legendum\plain \f1\fs22 /\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Adventus proprie vult sermones Ysaie \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 Walther I Nr. 4536 und Nr. 559. \endash  202\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r \plain \f1\fs22 leer.}

