\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 Ir Namen der Altenberger \u196 \'c4bte (sp\u228 \'e4tere Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge):\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Petrus Neuwenar \plain \f1\fs22 (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 abbas anno 1581\plain \f1\fs22 );\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Bartholomaeus Anstell \plain \f1\fs22 (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 anno 1591\plain \f1\fs22 );\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Petrus Rodekirchen \plain \f1\fs22 (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 anno 1614\plain \f1\fs22 );\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Melchior Mondorf \plain \f1\fs22 (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 electus anno 1627\plain \f1\fs22 );\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Joannes Blanckenberg \plain \f1\fs22 (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 abbas 1643\plain \f1\fs22 );\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Godefridus Gummersbach \plain \f1\fs22 (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 abbas et vicarius generalis 1662, electus 17 Julii\plain \f1\fs22 );\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  frater Aegidius Sipenius \plain \f1\fs22 (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Theologiae licentiatus et vicarius generalis, abbas electus anno 1679\plain \f1\fs22 );\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  frater Joannes Jacobus Lohe \plain \f1\fs22 (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 monasterii restaurator, abbas electus anno 1686\plain \f1\fs22 );\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Reverendissimus domnus Joannes Henning \plain \f1\fs22 (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 abbas electus anno 1706\plain \f1\fs22 );\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Rev. dom. Paulus Eiskirchen \plain \f1\fs22 (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 abbas electus anno 1720\plain \f1\fs22 );\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Rev. dom. Godefridus Engels \plain \f1\fs22 (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 abbas electus 1723\plain \f1\fs22 );\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Rev. dom. Joannes Matthias Hoerth \plain \f1\fs22 (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 abbas electus 1739\plain \f1\fs22 ). Zu den genannten Personen vgl. die \u196 \'c4bteliste bei Mosler S. 168\endash 184.}

