plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 S.\plain \f2\expndtw-30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 141\endash 145.\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (218ra\endash 220va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Van\plain \f2\i\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 sante\plain \f2\i\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Nyclais\plain \f1\fs22 <\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 LA\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 3.\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Schlusemann,\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Bibliographie,\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 S.\plain \f2\expndtw-30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 320\plain \f2\expndtw-30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 f.;\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (220va\endash 222rb)\plain \f2\expndtw60\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 [PS.-]ANSELMUS \plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 CANTUARIENSIS:\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 SERMO \plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 DE \plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 CONCEPTIONE \plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 BMV. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Van\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 sant\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ancelmus\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 uns\plain \f2\i\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 vrouwe\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 ontfan\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ancelmus, die ertsche busschoff van Cantelenberge ende der engelscher lude hyrde, heil ind ewige benedixe in dem heren. Die ersamiche ontfennysse der moder gotz ende maget Marien, alre gemynste broder, mois hoeren ur liefde mych vezellende. Sicher in der tzijt, dat behagede der gotlicker goedertierenheit zo corrigieren dat engelsche volck van iren quaden\u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 dat ons verleen onse here Ihesus Christus, ir son. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . \endash  Druck der Vorlage: PL 159, Sp.\plain \f2\expndtw-15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 319\endash 324 (hier gek\u252 \'fcrzt).\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Text \u252 \'fcberliefert\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 auch\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 in\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Ms.\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 C 120,\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 8rb\endash 9ra.\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Williams-Krapp,\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Legendare,\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 S.\plain \f2\expndtw-30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 437\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (Hs.\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 genannt).\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Schlusemann,\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Bibliographie,\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 S.\plain \f2\expndtw-30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 309\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 \endash \plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Hier\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 liegt\plain \f2\charscalex99\expndtw75\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 die\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 \u8222 \'84S\u252 \'fcdmittelniederl\u228 \'e4ndische\plain \f2\expndtw60\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Legenda\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 aurea\ldblquote \plain \f2\expndtw60\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 vor;\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 f\u252 \'fcr\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 weitere\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Angaben\plain \f2\charscalex99\expndtw75\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 vgl. Bl. 25ra\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 dieser Hs. Nicht zum Grundbestand der Legenda aurea geh\u246 \'f6ren\plain \f2\charscalex99\expndtw75\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 die\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Legende\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 der\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 hl.\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Barbara\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 und\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 die\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Predigt\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 zu\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Mari\u228 \'e4\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Empf\u228 \'e4ngnis.\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 \endash \plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 222v\plain \f2\expndtw60\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 leer.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

