\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 245rb\endash 247va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 VITA SANCTI WENZESLAI}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Van deme seligen Wentzelae\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  De salige Wentzelao was geboren van edelem geslechte der hertogen. Syne moder was eyn heydynnen, sonder syn vader was eyn goit kirsten man ende eyn hertoge \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 dair got durch wirckde vyl myrakel to eiren deme gloriosen merteler Christi. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . \endash  Williams-Krapp, Legendare, S. 470; Schlusemann, Bibliographie, S. 372 f. (Hs. genannt); VL2 Bd. 10, Sp. 855\endash 862, hier Sp. 860; DLL MA Bd. 2, Sp. 697\endash 700 (Hs. genannt Sp. 697).}

