\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 6r\endash 29v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 BENEDICTIONES ET ORATIONES}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio devota, quam edidit Benedictus papa, qui eam devote legentibus magnas contulit indulgentias\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Benedicat me imperialis maiestas, protegat me regalis divinitas \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 68; Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 80, Anm. 462, S. 86, Anm. 507, S. 91, Anm. 539 und S. 124, Anm.738; Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 105, G146. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Alia oratio devota\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Laudo et benedico ,glorifico et saluto dulcissimum et benignissimum cor fidelissimi amatoris mei Ihesu Christi \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 91, Anm. 539. (6v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Alia devota gratiarum actio\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Gracias et laudes tibi ago, dulcissime domine Ihesu Christe, pro beneficio creacionis \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (7r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequens oratio legitur revelata fuisse sancto Augustino \plain \f1\fs22 (7v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  a spiritu sancto, quas si quis penes se habuerit vel legerit illo die nec diabolus potest ei nocere nec subitanea morte deo concedente morietur\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus propicius esto michi peccatori et custos mei omnibus diebus ac noctibus vite mee \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 396 (Register); Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 73, Anm. 405;Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 103, G134. (8r) [BERNARDINUS SENENSIS (?)]: ORATIO DE NOMINE IESUS. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio beati Bernardi abbatis de mellifluo nomine Ihesu legenda devote et attente pro peccatorum suorum veniam impetracione\plain \f1\fs22 .< (8v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O bone Ihesu, o piissime Ihesu, o dulcissime Ihesu, o Ihesu,fili virginis Marie, plenus misericordia et pietate \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Druck: Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 345 (mit Abweichungen). Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 81, Anm. 474; VL 2 Bd. 1, Sp. 789\endash 793, hier Sp. 792 f.; DLL MA Bd. 2, Sp. 872 ff., hier Sp. 874; Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 77 f., G8; D. Pacetti, De sancti Bernardini Senensis operibus, Quaracchi 1947, S. 101 f. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend (9v) Versikel:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Sit nomen domini nostri Ihesu Christi et nomen gloriosissime virginis Marie benedictum in eternum et ultra. Nos cum prole pia benedicat virgo Maria\plain \f1\fs22 . Walther II Nr. 18779. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Collecta\plain \f1\fs22 .< CO Nr. 1645. (10r\endash 13r) ORATIONES ANTE CELEBRATIONEM MISSAE. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipiunt orationes devote ante celebrationem sacre misse\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 In omni charitate dilectissimi filii tui, domini nostri Ihesu Christi, rogo te, domine, sancte pater omnipotens, da michi corpus et sanguinem eiusdem filii tui tam digne tractare et sumere, ut per hoc merear remissionem peccatorum meorum accipere \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (10v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Alia devota oratio ante missam\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus, qui de indignis dignos, de inmundis mundos, de peccatoribus iustos facis, munda cor et corpus meum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 1, S. 156; Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 20, Anm. 102; Wilmart, Auteurs spirituels, S. 118, Anm. 51. (11r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad beatam virginem Mariam ante missam oratio devotissima et efficax\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O pulcherrima et suavissima virgo Maria, ad sacratissimum convivium, in quo Christus Ihesus, benedictus fructus ventris tui, sumitur accessurus, prius ad te omni, qua possum, fiducia confugio \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (11v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio beati Bonaventure dicenda flexis genibus antequam sacerdos induat se sacris vestibus\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Ecce, celestis rex et pater, recolens mortem illam uni\plain \f1\fs22 - (12r) -\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 geniti tui, domini nostri Ihesu Christi, offero tibi hostiam hanc \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ; [PS.-ANSELMUS CANTUARIENSIS: ORATIONES(Oratio33)]. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In accessu ad sacrum altare oratio beati Jheronimi presbiteri\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Si tantum, o clementissime pater, reatum nostre delinquencie cogitamus \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Druck: PL 158, Sp. 926. Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 1, S. 51. (12v) [BERNARDUS CLARAEVALLENSIS: SERMONES IN ADVENTU DOMINI (Sermo 2, Exzerpt)]. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio beati Bernardi abbatis ad beatam virginem Mariam ante misse celebratione\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Per te accessum habeamus ad filium, o benedicta inventrix gracie, genitrix vite, mater salutis \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Ed.: Leclercq/Rochais Bd. 2, S. 174. Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 347. (13r\endash 15v) GRATIARUM ACTIONES POST MISSAM. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipiunt devote graciarum actiones legende post missam\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Reum nimis et culpabilem me recognosco \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (13v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Alia gratiarum actio post missam devota\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Gracias tibi ago, dulcissime domine Ihesu Christe, lux vera, salus credencium, solatium tristium, gaudium angelorum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 244. (14r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Alia graciarum actio post missam\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Graciarum actiones pro posse fragilitatis mee tue tremende maiestati ac immense pietati, piissime Ihesu, refero \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (14v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad sequentem orationem Innocentius papa concessit xl dies indulgenciarum pro negligentiis commissis in missa\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[13].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Satisfaciat tibi, domine, sancte pater, pro peccatis nostris, quibus te offendimus sanguis dilecti filii tui in ara crucis effusus \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (15r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad beatam virginem Mariam oratio devota post missam\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[14].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Serenissima et inclita mater domini nostri Ihesu Christi, pia et perpetua virgo Maria \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Druck: Klapper, Schriften, S. 272 f., Nr. 72 (abweichend). Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 244. (15r\endash 17v) ABLASSGEBETE. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio Clementis pape post missam dicenda flexis genibus et conceduntur ccc dies indulgentiarum et remissio omnium defectuum in missa\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Obsecro te, domine Ihesu Christe, ut passio tua gloriosissima sit michi virtus, qua muniar, protegar, visiter et defendar\u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (15v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Johannes papa vicesimus secundus dat omnibus subscriptam orationem devote legentibus in genibus xx milia dierum criminalium et xx milia venialium\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[16].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O anima Christi, sanctifica me, corpus Christi, salva me, aqua lateris Christi, lava me, sanguis Christi, inebria me \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Druck: Klapper, Schriften, S. 107 f., Nr. 107 (abweichend); Wilmart S. 21, Anm. 3 und S. 377, Anm. 1. RH Nr. 1090; Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 88 f., G56; Paulus, Geschichte des Ablasses, S. 250. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Julius secundus du\plain \f1\fs22 - (16r) -\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 plicavit omnes indulgentias predecessorum suorum super omnes gregorianas concessas et unam addidit, scilicet \u8218 \'82O dulcissime\lquote  ita, quod indulgencie se iam extendant ad centum milia octoginta quattuor milia annorum et quadraginta annos adiunctis quadraginta diebus\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[17].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O domine Ihesu Christe, adoro te in cruce pendentem et coronam spineam in capite portantem \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Druck: Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 346 (hier um einen Gebetteil erweitert:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  O dulcissime domine Ihesu Christe, adoro te venturum ad iudicium \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 .). Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 92, Anm. 542 und S. 121, Anm. 710; VL 2 Bd. 3, Sp. 233\endash 244, hier Sp. 241 f.; Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 76, G4. (16v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[18].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O domine Ihesu Christe, pastor bone, iustos }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[18].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 (17r) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[18].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 confirma, peccatores iustifica \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 346.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[19].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O clementissime domine, pater, ecce ego offero tibi innocentem mortem dilectissimi filii tui \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 1, S. 207; ebd. 2, S. 61. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[20].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O domine Ihesu Christe, fili deivivi, qui sanctissime passionis tue misterium beato Gregorio, famulo tuo, mirabiliter revelasti \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 228. (17v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Alexander papa sextus sequentem orationem composuit et contulit omnibus vere penitentibus eam tribus vicibus flexis genibus dicentibus ante ymaginem sancte Anne xm annorum indulgentiarum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[21].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ave Maria, gratia plena, dominus tecum, tua gracia sit semper mecum, benedicta tu in mulieribus et benedicta sit sancta Anna, mater tua sanctissima \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Vgl. Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 125, Anm. 748; Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 120, G227; Paulus, Geschichte des Ablasses, S. 251. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio brevis et devota ad beatam virginem\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[22].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Salve, pia virgo, decus virginum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (18r\endash 29v) BENEDICTIONES. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De benedictionibus ornamentorum altaris et sacrorum vestimentorum, in quibus abbas fulcietur stola et baculo\plain \f1\fs22 .< (\u8230 \'85)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Oremus\plain \f1\fs22 .{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[23].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine, deus omnipotens, qui ornamenta et lintheamina Moysen, famulum tuum, facere per dies quadraginta docuisti \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (18v) PRG XL, 83; Deshusses Nr. 4148; PRG XL, 85; Deshusses Nr. 4147; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[24].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O deus, qui per Moysen, famulum tuum, pontificalia sacerdotalia atque levitica vestimenta ad explendum in conspectu tuo }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[24].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 (19r) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[24].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 eorum ministerium et ad laudem nominis tui fieri voluisti \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (19v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Pro humerali\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[25].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus immense, cui queque gravia facilia sunt, hoc humerale tue pietatis respectu sanctifica et presta\u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Pro alba. Oremus.\plain \f1\fs22 <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[26].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Omnipotens, sempiterne deus, te suppliciter exoramus, ut hanc albam aut has albas glorie tui nominis preparatam aut preparatas benedicere digneris \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Pro cingulo\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[27].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Omnipotens, sempiterne <deus>, qui Aaron et filios eius in sacerdotali ministerio cingulo seu baltheo in renibus stringi iussisti \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (20r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Pro mappula seu manipulo oratio\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[28].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Devocionis infusor et omnium bonorum largitor deus, benedicere dignare hunc manipulum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Pro stola. Oremus\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[29].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus, qui solis predicatoribus collum et pectus muniri orario concessisti, benedicere dignare hanc stolam \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (20v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Pro casula seu planeta benedictio. Oremus\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[30].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus, fons bonitatis et iusticie, qui tui operis ministros ad extremum vestimento casule, cuius munimine omnia interiora tegerentur vestiri sanxisti, annue precibus nostris et benedicere dignare hanc casulam \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Oremus, dilectissimi fratres, ut deus omnipotens hoc vasculum sue benedictionis tutamine suique filii, domini nostri Ihesu Christi, munere \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 vgl. PRG XL, Nr. 86; (21r) PRG XL, Nr.87; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio baculi pastoralis\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[31].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sustentator humane imbecillitatis deus, benedic baculum istum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio \plain \f1\fs22 (21v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  super annulum\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[32].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sanctifica, quesumus, domine, annulum istum et presta \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Super sandalia benedictio\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[33].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Tocius honestatis auctor \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Super cyrothecas benedictio\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[34].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Creator tocius creature deus, benedicere dignare has cyrothecas \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio thuribuli\plain \f1\fs22 .< (22r) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[35].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine deus, qui dum filios Israel ob rebellem sui contumaciam \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; PRG XL, Nr. 106; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio ad pedules\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[36].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Omnipotens, sempiterne deus, benedicere dignare hec calciamenta \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio nove crucis. Primitus fiat benedictio aque, postea letania ac deinde\plain \f1\fs22 .< PRG XL, Nr. 97; (22v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Item alia\plain \f1\fs22 .< PRG XL, Nr. 98; Deshusses Nr. 4107; 4327; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Prefatio\plain \f1\fs22 .< PRG XL, Nr. 99; (23v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Item alia\plain \f1\fs22 .< PRG XL, Nr. 103; PRG XL, Nr. 104; anschlie\u223 \'dfend CAO Nr. 7266 und 7936; (24r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Collecta\plain \f1\fs22 .< CO Nr. 158; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio ad capsas vel ymagines consecrandas\plain \f1\fs22 .< PRG XL, Nr. 111; (24v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Prefatio\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Vere dignum et iustum est equum et salutare, nos tibi semper et ubique gracias agere, domine sancte, pater omnipotens, eterne deus, inestimabilis et ineffabilis deus \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ; (25v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oremus\plain \f1\fs22 .< PRG XL, Nr. 113; (26v) (\u8230 \'85) CAO Nr. 8070; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Collecta\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[37].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Propiciare, quesumus, domine, nobis, famulis tuis, per sancta dei genitricis et virginis Marie atque ceterorum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Alia benedictio brevior super ymagines et capsas\plain \f1\fs22 .<PRG XL, Nr. 114; (27r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio\plain \f1\fs22 .< PRG XL, Nr. 115; (27v) (\u8230 \'85) CAO Nr. 8070; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Collecta\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[38].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Propiciare, quesumus, domine, nobis, famulis tuis, per sancta dei genitricis Marie atque ceterorum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (28r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio super ymaginem aliquam quando non habentur reliquie sanctorum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[39].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine Ihesu Christe, qui de intemerato beate Marie virginis utero nasci dignatus es \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio super ymagines aliquas quando non imponuntur sanctorum reliquie\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Domine Ihesu Christe, qui de intemerato beate Marie virginis utero nasci dignatus es \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ; (28v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio aliarum vestium, scilicet capparum et dalmaticarum\plain \f1\fs22 .< PRG XVI, Nr. 11 und 14a; ebd. XL, Nr. 80; (29r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur pro susceptione hospitum. Aspergat primo aqua benedicta. Si episcopus vel abbas fuerit, offeratur ei aspersorium cum osculo manus\plain \f1\fs22 .< >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Si suscipiendus hospes psalmos noverit, dicatur ab ipso et a suscipiente Psalmus\plain \f1\fs22 :<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Deus misereatur nostri \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Ps 66,2\endash 8].\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Gloria patri. Sicut. Kyrieleyson, Chisteleyson, Kyrieleyson. Pater noster. Et ne nos\plain \f1\fs22 . Anschlie\u223 \'dfend CAO Nr. 7343. (29v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Oremus. \plain \f1\fs22 CO Nr. 1226a. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Completa oratione detur osculum pacis hospiti. Postmodum ducatur ad domum hospitum et tradetur secundum persone exigentiam humaniter. Si hospes psalmos non noverit, omnia per suscipientem compleantur\plain \f1\fs22 .<}

