\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 3\plain \f1\fs22 0r\endash 36v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 MODUS VISITANDI MONASTERIA}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Modus et forma visitandi monasteria\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Visitatores cum ad visitandum aliquod monasterii accesserint, si fieri potest, eodem sero connocent abbatem et conventum, monachos et conversos professos ad locum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (32r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De generalibus possunt aliqua inquiri\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Item. An servent veram obedientiam abbati et suis prepositis secundum regulam sancti Benedicti \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 (33r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Interrogationes circa abbates, prepositos sive priores, si monasteriorum supreme rectores existent\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  In primisa ergo interrogetur, an etiam zelum dei et animarum habeat sicut pastorem decet \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 (33v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De priore\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Item. Utrum continue sit in conventu. Si est zelosus pro disciplina secundum statuta partum \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De cellerario, quis sit et qualis\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Item. Si officium suum diligenter implet \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 (34r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De ceteris autem fratribus visitatores\plain \f1\fs22 <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  secundum quod eis visum fuerit oportunum, inquirere possunt de charitate mutua \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 (35r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De finali exhortatione facienda\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Postquam omnes, qui sunt proclamandi, fuerint proclamati \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 (35v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De absolutione consueta\plain \f1\fs22 .< (36r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De cartha visitationis facienda\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Secundum statute partum peracta visitatione ordinandus exit status monachorum visitatorum in Cartha, in qua sunt necessarii articuli inserendi, in quibus se singuli debeant emendare \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 Item visitatores possunt exigere a visitatis tres florenos renenses pro viatico secundum statuta patrum. Et sic est finis de modo visitandi monasteria\plain \f1\fs22 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 37rv {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 FORMAE ABSOLUTIONIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 .\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Forma absolutionis plenarie. Misereatur tui omnipotens deus etc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Dominus noster Ihesus Christus per merita sue sanctissime passionis te absolvat \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \plain \f1\fs22 (37v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 quando alias fueris in mortis articulo. In nomine patris et filii et spiritus sancti. Amen. Absolutio pro his, qui non sunt ordinis nostri. Auctoritate dei omnipotentis et clavium ecclesiasticarum a censuris ecclesiasticis vos absolvimus \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 atque ad executionem agendorum reabilitamus. In nomine patris et filii et spiritus sancti. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . Anschlie\u223 \'dfend Notiz des Johannes de Groningen:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Nos Johannes, abbas monasterii Werdensis, commissarius huius monasterii sanctorum Machabeorum, prescriptam conpunctionem ex quo coram conventu facta est et ab eodem tamquam benefactam eciam admissa, sic nos eandem similiter admittimus atque approbamus sub testimonio manus mee\plain \f1\fs22 .}

