\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 38r\endash 91v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 COLLECTANEA MONASTICA}}\plain \f1\fs22 , Autograph des Johannes von Groningen. Exzerptensammlung zu verschiedenen Themen: \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 de oboedientia, de statu religiosorum, de religionis ingressione, de visitatione monasteria, de venerabili sacramento, de castitate, de conversione morum, de paupertate, de continentia, de dilectione dei, de triplici hoste: carne, mundo et demone\plain \f1\fs22 . Genannte Autoren und Quellen: Ambrosius, Augustinus, Basilius, Benedictus de Nursia: Regula, Bernardus, Bernardus Cassinensis (Bernardus Ayglerius): Expositio regulae Benedicti, Biblia, Bonaventura, Chrisostomus, Gregorius, Hieronymus, Isidorus, Johannes Cassianus: Conlationes patrum, Johannes de Turrecremata, Leo papa, Origenes, Seneca, Thomas de Aquino. Darunter (66r\endash 74v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Exhortatio ad fratres\plain \f1\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Fratres dilectissimi, vocati sumus a domino ad statum perfectionis \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash \u8230 \'85 et iam diximus instrumenta et oportuna media. Prestante domino nostro Jhesu Christo\plain \f1\fs22 . Anschlie\u223 \'dfend (75r\endash 81r) Textkompilationen (de statu religionis, de triplici voto religionis: votum paupertatis / obedientiae / continentiae).\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Paupertas namque voluntaria primum fundamentum est, ad hanc perfectionem obtinendam dicende domino: Si vis perfectus esse }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 [Mt 19,21] }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 ut iam diximus instrumenta et oportuna media prestante domino Jhesu Christo. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . (81v\endash 86r) FORMA PROFESSIONIS.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Forma professionis hec est: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ego frater N promitto stabilitatem et conversionem morum meorum et obedientiam secundum regulam sancti Benedicti}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  coram deo et sanctis eius in hoc monasterio, quod constructum est in honore sancti N in presentia domini N abbatis\plain \f1\fs22 . Anschlie\u223 \'dfend Auslegung:{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 In qua professione tria substancialia monastice professionis tangitur, scilicet stabilitas morum, conversio et obediencia \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (86v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Bernardus in sermone de venerabili sacramento: Duo venerabile sacramentum operatur in nobis \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et deus pacis erit vobiscum. \plain \f1\fs22 \endash  91v leer.}

