\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 Bl. 92\endash 135: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezsoz[0].4600/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Werden, Benediktinerabtei}}\plain \f1\fs22 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5060[0].5064/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 um 1520}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; sp\u228 \'e4tere Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge (16. und 17. Jh.) \u183 \'b7 Wz.: Buchstabe L\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 mit\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Lilie im\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Wappen, nicht identifiziert, Typ\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Briquet 8289 (1535); auch\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 in Teil I dieser\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Hs.;\plain \f2\charscalex99\expndtw90\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Lilie\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Gruppe\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 PiccLi\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 III\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 1804\endash 1808\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (1518,\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 1519),\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 auch\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 in\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Teil\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 III\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 dieser\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Hs.\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 \u183 \'b7\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Lagen:\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (IV\endash 1)98\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 +\plain \f2\charscalex99\expndtw75\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 IV106\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 + (IV\endash 1)113\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 + VII127\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 + IV135 \u183 \'b7\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Lagenz\u228 \'e4hlung: \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 i\plain \f1\fs22 , \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 k\plain \f1\fs22 , \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 l\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 \u183 \'b7\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 moderne Foliierung in Bleistift (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 92\plain \f1\fs22 \endash \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 135\plain \f1\fs22 ) \u183 \'b7 Schriftraum 10\endash 11 x 7\endash 7,5 \u183 \'b7 16\endash 25 Zeilen \u183 \'b7 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 humanistische}}\plain \f1\fs22  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 sp\u228 \'e4tgotische Kursive}}\plain \f1\fs22  \u183 \'b7 mehrere H\u228 \'e4nde (122r\endash 126v: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes von Groningen}}\plain \f1\fs22 ).}

