\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 1rv {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 ORATIONES ANTE ET POST MISSAM}}\plain \f1\fs22 . Vor den Gebeten ein Hieronymus zugeschriebenes Zitat:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  A quamcumque ecclesiam te transtuleris, usui ecclesie illius acquiescas, donec tante auctoritatis fueris, ut illum, si enormis fuerit, subvertere possis\plain \f1\fs22 . Hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Hec dicit beatus Jheronimus\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio sacerdotis bona ante missam dicenda\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine Ihesu Christe, fili dei vivi, immensam clementiam tuam humili devocione deposco \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 286. (1v) >\plain \f1\i\fs22 O\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 racio post missam\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Gracias tibi ago, dulcissime domine Ihesu Christe, lux vera, salus credentium, solatium tristium, gaudium angelorum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 ubi est vera beatitudo, clara lux et sempiterna leticia. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . Ebd. S. 244.}

