\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 37v\endash 41r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 LITURGISCHE MERKVERSE}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quando \u8218 \'82Gloria in excelsis\lquote  servatur. Versus\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Numquam te sine glo sed ter dicas sine te glo}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  / In vi pas ascen penthecost hec tria serva \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quando \u8218 \'82Credo\lquote  servandum est. Versus\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Nox pas ascen pe dominus lux credo reservant}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  / Missa prior dominus cantabitur ante deum te \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quando \u8218 \'82Credo\lquote  servandum est\plain \f1\fs22 .< Walther I Nr. 3475; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Epy terribilis cum apostolis duodenis}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  / \u8218 \'82Credo\lquote  canunt semper crux iuncta die genitrice\plain \f1\fs22 . (38r) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Magdala terribilis crux Christus apostolus omnis}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  / Et domini feria \u8218 \'82Credo\lquote  canit atque Maria. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Omnibus officium de sanctis dum canis ipsa}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  / Cantetur domini prefacio cottidiana\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De octavis sanctorum. Versus\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Nativitas epy pas pen