\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 42r\endash 45r [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 THOMAS DE AQUINO}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 SUMMA THEOLOGIAE}}\plain \f1\fs22 ], pars 3, q. 83, art. 6, Exzerpt. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De periculis et defectibus misse\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Nota quod periculis seu defectibus circa sacramentum altaris evenientibus hoc modo sub venien dum est secundum Decretales sancte matris ecclesie. Primo si sacerdos morte vel gravi infirmitate occupetur \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 Et hoc probabilius videtur\plain \f1\fs22 . \endash  Ed.: Opera omnia (Editio Leonina), Bd. 12, Rom 1906, S. 283 ff. (mit Abweichungen).}

