\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 55r\endash 73v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 CONSUETUDINES ECCLESIAE GERISHEMENSIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De modo thurificandi et in quibus festis thurificetur in seculari ecclesia Gerishemensi\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 In sabbato adventus domini thurificetur sic \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (64v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De ordinacione et celebracione aliquarum missarum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Notandum quod in die sancti Johannis evangeliste post nativitatem domini missa primarum celebratur in novo altari, quod Godefridus de Broichusen fundavit propter patrocinium \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 (66v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In quibus festis ministratur ad altare\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Notandum quod in subscriptis diebus ministratur ad altare per diaconum et subdiaconum in seculari ecclesia sancti Ipoliti Gerishemensi \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 (67r\endash 71v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sententia arbitralis inter abbatissam et canonicos Gerishemensis lata etc\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Universis presentes litteras visuris vel audituris, quorum interest vel interesse poterit quovismodo in futurum innocescat. Quod dudum inter venerabilem dominam dominam Idam, abbatissam secularis ecclesie in Gerisheym \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 testibus ad premissa vocatis et rogatis anno nativitatis domini millesimo ccco sexagesimo secundo, die duodecima mensis Marcii\plain \f1\fs22 . (71v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De anno gracie canonicorum in Gerisheym\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  In nomine sancte et individue trinitatis ego Guda, miseracione domina abbatissa Gerishemensis, omnibus in Cristo fidelibus tam presentibus quam futuris, ad quorum noticiam hoc scriptum pervenerit imperpetuum \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 tam sigilli quam beati Ipoliti, ecclesie Gerishemensis patroni, apprensione et municione coram testibus est reformatum\plain \f1\fs22 . \endash \plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Druck:\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 J.\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 H.\plain \f2\expndtw30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Kessel,\plain \f2\charscalex99\expndtw75\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Der\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 selige\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Gerrich,\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Stifter\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 der\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Abtei\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Gerresheim.\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Ein\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Beitrag\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 zur\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Gr\u252 \'fcndungsgeschichte\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 des\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Christentums\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 im\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Bergischen\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Lande,\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 D\u252 \'fcsseldorf\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 1877, S.\plain \f2\expndtw-30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 189\plain \f2\expndtw-30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 f.\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (Text\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 nach\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 der\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 im\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 D\u252 \'fcsseldorfer\plain \f2\expndtw45\l