\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\fs22 1r\endash 3v Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge des 13. Jh.s. (1r\endash 2r) Zum Ablauf der Offizium-Feier, Anfang fehlt. Erhalten:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Cursus de sancta trinitate \plain \f2\fs22 und \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Cursus de sancto spiritu\plain \f2\fs22 . (2r\endash 3v) ORATIONES. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio de beata virgine Maria\plain \f2\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  O sublimis angelorum domina, o Ihesu mater piissima \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\fs22 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 De sancto Michaele\plain \f2\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Deus, qui beatum Michaelem archangelum electionis tue populis constituisti principem \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\fs22 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 De sancto Johanne ewangelista\plain \f2\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Iohannes dei gratia subtilis ut aquila \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\fs22 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio saluberrima, quam, qui intimo corde cotidie dixerit, confidat beatam Mariam in omnibus angustiis et in obitu suo pro eo apud filium suum intercessuram\plain \f2\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O gloriosissima virgo Maria, quam ineffabilem gratiam apud dominum invenisti \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\fs22 ; (2v) [JOHANNES FISCANNENSIS: ORATIO ANTE MISSAM]. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio ante communionem\plain \f2\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Summe sacerdos et vere pontifex \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 neque esuriam neque siciam in eternum. \plain \f2\fs22 \endash  Wilmart, Auteurs spirituels, S. 101\endash 125, Text S. 114 f. VL 2 Bd. 1, Sp. 327 ff., hier Sp. 327 f.; (3r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Orationes, quibus quemlibet sanctum vel sanctos plures vel omnes poteris invocare\plain \f2\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sancte N, apostole Christi inclite vel martyr aut confessor, intercede pro me, peccatore, et pro omnibus ex debito familiaritatis et consanguinitatis coniunctis \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\fs22 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 De sancto Andrea oratio\plain \f2\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Obsecro te, beate Andrea, apostole et martyr Christi, intercede \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\fs22 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Unde supra oratio ad dominum directa\plain \f2\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Queso, domine, deus omnipotens, inestimabilem suavitatis tue clemenciam, ut per merita sancti N, apostoli, martyris vel confessoris tui, inchoata in me bona perficias \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\fs22 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio ante celebrationem misse\plain \f2\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Domine Ihesu Christe, fili dei vivi, propicius esto peccatis nostris et negligentiis infinitis \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\fs22 (3v) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Post missam vel sacram communionem\plain \f2\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Gratias ago tibi, domine Ihesu Christe, quid me, miserrimum peccatorem, consolari dignatus es\u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\fs22 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominus\plain \f1\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\fs22 [!],\plain \f1\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 qui\plain \f1\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 sanctos tuos\plain \f1\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 mirabiliter te\plain \f1\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ipso\plain \f1\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 reficis,\plain \f1\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 da\plain \f1\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 nobis\plain \f1\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 supplicantibus,\plain \f1\i\e