 elevatione\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 hostie\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 dicetur\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 hec\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 salutatio,\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 hoc\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 placet\plain \f2\i\charscalex99\expndtw60\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 domino deo: Ave domine Ihesu Christe, verbum patris, filius virginis, agnus\plain \f2\i\charscalex99\expndtw90\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 dei,\plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 salus\plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 mundi\plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 \endash \plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 requies\plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 nostra,\plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 vita\plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 perhennis.\plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Amen\plain \f1\fs22 .\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Wilmart S.\plain \f2\expndtw-15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 412\plain \f2\expndtw-30\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 f.;\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 vgl.\plain \f2\expndtw60\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais,\plain \f2\expndtw60\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Livres\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 d\rquote heures\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 2,\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 S.\plain \f2\expndtw-15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 381.\plain \