\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 1r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 ORATIONES ANTE COMMUNIONEM}}\plain \f1\fs22 , unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig (zusammengeh\u246 \'f6rig mit Bl. 151v). ||\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  mente veli et velam deservire. Rogo te per vincula, quibus innocente \u8230 \'85 Rogo te, domine Ihesu, per obprobria, irrisiones, sputa \u8230 \'85 Da mihi, domine, tue humilitatis, paciencie, obediencie et caritatis indesinenter sequi exempla \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Tu panis invisibilis, tu potus ineffabilis\u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Es folgt: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Letania ante communionem\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Kyrieleison, Christeleison, Kyrieleison, Christe, audi nos, pater de celis deus, in quem oculi matris mee sperant, ut des illis escam in tempore oportunitatis, miserere michi \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et ne vobiscum epulari merear, orate pro me\plain \f1\fs22 . Mit Anrufung der Dreifaltigkeit, der Engel, Erzengel, Patriarchen, Apostel, M\u228 \'e4rtyrer, Bekenner, Jungfrauen, Allerheiligen.}

