\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 133r\endash 143v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 CANTICA}}\plain \f1\fs22 . (132v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Canticum Ysaye prophete.\plain \f1\fs22 < (133r) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Confitebor\plain \f2\i\charscalex99\expndtw60\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 tibi,\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 domine\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 [Is\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 12,1\endash 6];\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Canticum\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ezechye\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 prophete.\plain \f1\fs22 <\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (133v)\plain \f2\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ego\plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 dixi\plain \f2\i\charscalex99\expndtw60\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 in dimidio dierum  meorum\plain \f2\i\expndtw60\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Is 38,10\endash 20]; (134r)  >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Canticum  Anne.\plain \f1\fs22 <\plain \f2\charscalex99\expndtw60\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Exultavit\plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 cor\plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 meum\plain \f2\i\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\i\expndtw60\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 [I\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Sm\plain \f2\expndtw60\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 2,1\endash 10];\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (134v)\plain \f2\expndtw45\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\