\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 146r\endash 151r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 ORATIONES}}\plain \f1\fs22 . (145v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio ante eucharistiam\plain \f1\fs22 .< (146r) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Redemptionis mee singulare precium sumptura, obsecro te \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 beate consummationis finis adoptivus e t perpes clausula. Agne dei, cuius sanguis dirum virus fugat \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Ihesu victor, Jhesu vita, Jhesu vite via trita \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 AH Bd. 54, Nr. 149 (Str. 19 und 20);\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Christe patris unice, qui humanam nostri causa formam assumpsisti \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 facere digneris unice dei. Christe, consanguinee nostre nature, nos fove \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  O vere digna hostia, per quam. Quesumus, auctor omnium, per hoc sacrosanctum corporis et sanguinis tui mysterium \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 vgl.AHBd.51,Nr.83,AnfangderStr.5und7(hierentsprechendver\u228 \'e4ndert).Anschlie\u223 \'dfendAnf\u228 \'e4ngederStr.1\endash 4vonAHBd.51,Nr.89.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Tu esto nostra semita \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Tu esto nostrum meritum \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Miserere, miserere, miserere populo tuo \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ; (146v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ad sumendum in remissione omnium peccatorum meorum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Precibus ac meritis sanctissime genitricis tue Marie et omnium sanctorum tuorum miserere mei, clementissime deus pater \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et ad societatem civium supernorum pervenire merear. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . Ps:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominus reg\plain \f1\fs22 (it)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  me\plain \f1\fs22 . Ps [26]:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominus ill\plain \f1\fs22 (uminatio)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  m\plain \f1\fs22 (ea). Ps [31]:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  In te, domine, sp\plain \f1\fs22 (eravi).\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Tuam, domine, excita potenciam et veni ad salvandum nos. Veni, domine, visitare nos in pace, ut letemur coram te corde perfecto. Pater noster. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Concede, quesumus, omnipotens deus, ut quicquid in mentibus nostris viciosum est \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O sancte spiritus, qui uterum virginis Marie virtute tua fecundasti eamque dei filium parere fecisti \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 ut per hoc partem eterne beatitudinis habere merear in celis. Amen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Omnipotens, sempiterne deus, miserere nobis famulis et famulabus tuis et dirige nos secundum tuam clemenciam in viam salutis \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine Ihesu Christe,fili dei vivi, qui ex voluntate patris cooperante spiritu sancto per propriam mortem tuam mundum vivificasti \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (147r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Presta, queso, omnipotens deus, ut per invocacionem sancti nominis tui \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et custodiat nos nunc et in perpetuum. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . (147rv) [JOHANNES FISCANNENSIS]: ORATIO.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ecce advocatus meus apud te \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 in quo tibi bene complacuit\plain \f1\fs22 . \endash  Druck: PL 40, Sp. 905 f. (Ps.-Augustinus, Meditationes; vgl. CPPM Bd. 2, Nr. 3072 und 3072a) und PL 158, Sp. 859\endash 861 (Ps.-Anselmus Cantuariensis: Oratio ad deum patrem per merita filii incarnati). Vgl. auch P. Glorieux, Pour revaloriser Migne. Tables rectificatives, Lille 1952 (M\u233 \'e9langes de science religieuse 9, 1952 Cahier suppl\u233 \'e9mentaire), S. 62. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Gracias tibi ago, benedicte et amabilis conditor noster \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  O virtus nostra, domine, deus meus, vera lux eterna \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 tibi laus, tibi gloria in secula seculorum. Amen. Tibi laus, tibi gloria, tibi graciarum actio, o beata et benedicta gloriosa trinitas, pater, filius et spiritus sanctus.{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 OdomineIhesuChriste,filideivivi,unicaspessalutismee\u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 in gloria dei patris\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Item oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O benigne Ihesu, qui te deo patri in ara crucis hostiam vere dignam, vere pacificam pro nobis miseris et indignis offerre dignatus es \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (148r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[13].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ave in eternum sanctissima Christi caro \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[14].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Percepcione corporis et sanguinis domini nostri Ihesu Christi precibus ac meritis ipsius genitricis, virginis Marie \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 tribuat michi omnipotens et misericors dominus. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quando accedam\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Ecce Ihesu, benignissime redemptor atque salvator seculi piissime \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ave in eternum sanctissima caro}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  et sanguis. Ave in perpetuum summa dulcedo. Ecce advocatus \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 vgl. Bl. 147r (hier nur Anfang), anschlie\u223 \'dfend:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Nunc dimittis\plain \f1\fs22 .\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Iam corpus eius\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Post communionem\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[16].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Gratias tibi ago, domine deus, pater omnipotens, qui me, peccatricem, saciare dignatus es corpore et sanguine \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Wilmart, Auteurs spirituels, S. 381, Anm. 2; (148v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[17].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine Ihesu Christe, qui es cum patre et spiritu sancto unicus essencie deus, in quo vera est omnium peccatorum remissio \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[18].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine Ihesu Christe, creator et restaurator generis humani, qui iugiter pro nostra salute ymmolaris \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[19].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine Ihesu Christe, qui de hoc mundo transisti ad patrem et dilexisti tuos, qui erant in mundo et postquam cenasti cum discipulis tuis \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[20].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Participatio corporis et sanguinis domini nostri Ihesu Christi animam meam purget a crimine \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[21].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sacrificium, domine, quod indigna suscepi, mihi proficiat ad prosperitatem presentis et eterne felicitatis \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[22].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine, deus meus, misericordia mea, refugium meum et consolacio mea et unica spes mea, miserere anime mee \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (149r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[23].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Senciam, domine Ihesu Christe, tui perceptione corporis et sanguinis virtutem in me \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 ante conspectum tuum. Amen. Domine Ihesu Christe, fili dei vivi, te supplex queso, ut in die et in hora exitus mei sanctum corpus et sanguinen tuum \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[24].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deprecor te, domine Ihesu Christe, per hec sacramenta, que sumpsimus \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash \u8230 \'85 permaneat nobiscum usque in eternum. Amen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[25].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Tua, queso, domine, sacramenta me, indignam famulam tuam, et flos et filius tuus custodiant \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et eternis suppliciis carere valeamus. Per\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio pro fine\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[26].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine Ihesu Christe, qui propter nos in agonyam venisti et pro nobis sanguinem sudasti \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 in sinu tuo recipias. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[27].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine Ihesu Christe, qui sanctam crucem ascendisti, mundi tenebras illuminasti \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 rex glorie qui vi\plain \f1\fs22 (vit)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  et r\plain \f1\fs22 (egnat)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  d\plain \f1\fs22 (ominus).\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[28].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus, propicius esto michi, indigne peccatrici, per illam compunctionem \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 73 mit Anm. 403; (149v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[29].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus, propicius esto michi, indigne peccatrici, per illas gloriosas lacrimas \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[30].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus, propicius esto michi, indigne peccatrici, per illud vinculum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[31].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus, propicius esto michi, indigne peccatrici, per illam angustiam mortis \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[32].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus, propicius esto michi, indigne peccatrici, per illum dolorem \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et omnes christianos. Amen. Domine, exaudi or\plain \f1\fs22 (acionem)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  m\plain \f1\fs22 (eam)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  aur\plain \f1\fs22 (ibus).\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Media vita. Pater noster\plain \f1\fs22 . Versikel:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  In manus t\plain \f1\fs22 (uas) und\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Custodi animam m\plain \f1\fs22 (eam)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  et er\plain \f1\fs22 (ue)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  me\plain \f1\fs22 .Vgl. dazu E. Pauls, Zauberwesen und Hexenwahn am Niederrhein, in: Beitr\u228 \'e4ge zur Geschichte des Niederrheins 13, 1898, S. 134\endash 242, hier S. 169, Anm. 3 (Hs. genannt). COMMENDATIO ANIMAE.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[33].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 In illa commendacione, piissime deus, quam tu in humanitate moriturus \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et meam multimodam indigenciam. Amen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[34].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Per piissimam mortem tuam, domine Ihesu Christe, in hora mortis \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 (150r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  qui vivit er regnat per omnia secula seculorum. Amen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[35].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Dum conturbata fuerit misera anima mea \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 in me, peccatrice, recordare. Amen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[36].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Oblatus et quia ipse voluit \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 sanctis videndo dominum facie ad faciem. Amen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[37].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Salvator mundi, domine Ihesu Christe, obsecro te per illam sanctissimam passionem, in qua te totum expandisti super lignum crucis ad redimendum mundum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[38].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine, creator meus, liberator meus, susceptor meus \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[39].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Rogo te, domine, per sanctam incarnacionem, tuam perpetuam nativitatem \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[40].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Commendo animam meam domine mee, sancte Marie \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 (150v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  consolacione perpetua perfrui mereatur. Amen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[41].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Commendo tibi, domina mea, sancta Maria, extremum diem et horam obitus mei \u8230 \'85 }}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et ab eterna dampnacione. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[42].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O Maria gloriosa, summi regis genitrix ante mundi constitutionem preelecta}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 ego peccatrix enormitate scelerum valde opressa ad tuam singularem confugio miseracionem \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[43].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Supplico, domina piissima, ut sicut omnibus miseriis subvenis ita michi \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Optine nobis, gloriosissima virgo Maria, spacium penitencie et locum venie \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ; (151r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[45].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Commendo tibi, domina mea, animam meam et corpus meum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 dominum nostrum in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . ORATIO DE NOMINE IESU. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[45].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O dulcissime et amantissime Ihesus, Jhesus nomen bonum, nomen preciosum, nomen, quod est super omne nomen \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et usque in speculum. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . COMMENDATIO ANIMARUM AD BMV. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[46].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domina sancta Maria, in sinum tue pietatis commendo hodie et omni tempore corpora et animas omnium carorum meorum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 quoniam tu domina adiuvisti eos et consolata es eos. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 .}

