\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 1\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 242\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 PROPRIUM DE SANCTIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 , Anfang fehlt. ||\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  famosissima rutilabat quanto a populoso \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Nicolaus (6. Dez.)]. Die vollst\u228 \'e4ndigen Texte umfassen Feste von Octava Andreae (7. Dez., 12\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 ) bis Andreas (30. Nov.). Bemerkenswert: (26\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 32\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In conversione sancti Pauli\plain \f1\fs22 .< (25. Jan.) mit (27\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 ) AH Bd. 23, Nr. 450 (Str. 1 und 5); (38\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Natalis sancte Waldethrudis virginis\plain \f1\fs22 .< (3. Feb.); (52\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 ) Auf dem freigelassenen Raum sp\u228 \'e4tere Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge: 1)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Benedictio pomorum. Benedic, domine, hoc fructum \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ; 2)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  De uno martire\plain \f1\fs22 . (53\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit de festivitatibus sanctorum in paschali tempore\plain \f1\fs22 .< (58\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In natale sancti Domitiani episcopi\plain \f1\fs22 .< (7. Mai); (58\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 59\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Servatii episcopi\plain \f1\fs22 .< (13. Mai); (61\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 67\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 ) Johannis Baptistae (24. Juni) mit (61\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 ) AH Bd. 50, Nr. 96 (Str. 1\endash 8 und 13); (69\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 73\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In martyrio apostolorum Petri et Pauli\plain \f1\fs22 .< Mit (69\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 ) AH Bd. 51, Nr. 188; (82\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 88\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In natale sancte Marie Magdalene\plain \f1\fs22 .< (22. Juli) mit AH Bd. 52, Nr. 285; (91\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 )>\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Glodesindis\plain \f1\fs22 .< (25. Juli); (103\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In transfiguratione domini\plain \f1\fs22 .< (5. Aug.); (138\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 140\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Remacli confessoris\plain \f1\fs22 .< (3. Sept.); (146\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 147\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Theodardi martyris\plain \f1\fs22 .< (10. Sept.); (155\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 162\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De sancto Lamberto\plain \f1\fs22 .< (17. Sept.) Reimoffizium AH Bd. 26, Nr. 79 (Hs. genannt); (162\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 172\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In octava.\plain \f1\fs22 < [sancti Lamberti] (24. Sept.). (163\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 171\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 ) Nachtr\u228 \'e4glich eingebundene Lage mit >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Lectiones de sancto Lamberto\plain \f1\fs22 .< Lesungen aus: Vita Landiberti episcopi Traiectensis vetustissima. Druck: MGH SS rer. Merov., Bd. 6, S. 354\endash 372. BHL Nr. 4677; CPL Nr. 2121. (199\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 201\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Severini episcopi\plain \f1\fs22 .< (23. Okt.); (199\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ode vidue\plain \f1\fs22 .< (24. Okt.); (204\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quintini et Foillani\plain \f1\fs22 .< (31. Okt.); (214\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 218\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In natale sancti Huberti episcopi\plain \f1\fs22 .< (3. Nov.); (231\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Trudonis\plain \f1\fs22 .< (23. Nov.).}

