\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 8\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 11\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 COLLECTAE SANCTORUM}}\plain \f1\fs22 . (8\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 9\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipiunt sanctorum collecte, qui proprietatem non habent\plain \f1\fs22 .< 27 kurze Gebete.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Deus, qui nos beati confessoris tui annua sollempnitate letificas \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 dona gratie tue assequamur. Per\plain \f1\fs22 . (9\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 11\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipiunt sanctorum collecte, qui proprietatem habent\plain \f1\fs22 .< 22 kurze Heiligengebete (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Marcelli\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Prisce\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Agnetis\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Tyburcii et Valeriani\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Georgii\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Vitalis martyris\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Johannis apostoli\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Marcellini et Petri\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Abdon et Sennen\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Cyriaci martyris\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Ypoliti martyris\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Tymothei et Symphoriani\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Hermetis martyris\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Sabine virginis\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Audacti et Felicis\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Prothi et Jacinti martyrum\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Nicomedis martyris\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Lucie et Geminiani\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Quatuor coronatorum\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Theodori martyris\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Felicitatis virginis\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Calixti martyris\plain \f1\fs22 ). (9\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 )\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Preces populi tui quesumus domine clementer exaudi \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 per sanctorum tuorum exempla restaurare. Per dominum\plain \f1\fs22 . Anschlie\u223 \'dfend Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge von einer anderen Hand: kurzes Gebet (>\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Saturnini martyris\plain \f1\fs22 <); anschlie\u223 \'dfend Vermerk >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Officium sicut de beato Nicholao\plain \f1\fs22 < und ein Gebet zum hl. Edmund. \endash  11\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v \plain \f1\fs22 leer.}

