\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 503r\endash 507v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 CANTICA}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In nativitate domini, epiphania et purificacione\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Populus, qui ambulabat in tenebris \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Is 9,2\endash 7]; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Letare Iherusalem et diem festum agite \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [vgl. Is 66,10\endash 16]; (503v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Urbs fortitudinis nostre \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Is 26,1\endash 12]; (504r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In pascha, ascensione et penthecosten cantica\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Quis est iste qui venit de Edom \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Is 63,1\endash 5]; (505v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Venite et revertamur \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Os 6,1\endash 6]; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Expecta me, dicit dominus \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [So 3,8\endash 12]; (505r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominicis diebus et sancti Michaelis cantica\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Domine, miserere nostri \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Is 33,3\endash 10]; (505v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Audite, qui longe estis \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Is 33,13\endash 18]; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Miserere, domine, plebi tue \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Sir 36,14\endash 19]; (506r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De apostolis et martyribus cantica\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Vos sancti domini \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Is 61,6\endash 9]; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Reddet deus mercedem \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Sap 10,17\endash 20]; (506v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De uno martyre vel confessore\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Beatus vir, qui in sapiencia morabitur \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Sap 14,22; Sap 15,3\endash 4; Sap 15,6]; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Benedictus vir, qui confidit in domino \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Ier 17,7\endash 8]; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Beatus vir, qui inventus est sine macula \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Sir 8\endash 11]; (507r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De virginibus\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Audite me divini fructus \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Sir 39, 17\endash 21]; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Gaudens gaudebo in domino \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22  [Is 61,10\endash 11; Is 62,1\endash 3]; (507v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Non vocaberis ultra derelicta \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Is 62,4\endash 7]. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De sancta cruce. In dedicacione\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Domine audivi. Pro iniquitate. Egressus es in salu\plain \f1\fs22 (tem)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 . Letatus sum. Nisi dominus. Lauda Iherusalem\plain \f1\fs22 .}

