2 .< AH Bd. 50, Nr. 67 (ohne Str. 2 und 4); >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In palmis tamen vesperis, nocturnis, laudibus\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 51, Nr. 74; (511r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad terciam per totam ebdomadam\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 50, Nr. 6; (511v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 An pascha usque ad ascensionem vesperis, nocturnis, laudibus preter festa sanctorum\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 50, Nr. 12; (512r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad completorium eisdem diebus usque ad ascensionem preter sanctam crucem\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 51, Nr. 83; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad terciam per octo dies pasche et diebus dominicis et festis, quibus non laboramus usque ad ascensionem domini preter festum sancte crucis\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 50, Nr. 215; (512v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In ascensione domini vesperis, nocturnis et laudibus usque in penthecosten.\plain \f1\fs22 < AH Bd. 51, Nr. 87; (513r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad completorium usque in vigilia penthecosten\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 51, Nr. 89 (ohne Str. 6); >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eodem tempore ad terciam usque ad penthecosten\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 51, Nr. 88 (ohne Str. 5 und 7); (513v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In penthecosten vesperis, nocturnis, laudibus usque ad sabbatum\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 51, Nr. 92; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad completorium usque ad sabbatum\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 51, Nr. 91; (514r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eodem tempore ad terciam usque ad dominicam sequentem\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 50, Nr. 144. (514v\endash 520r) SANCTORALE. (514v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Stephani prothomartyris\plain \f1\fs22 .< RH Nr. 19483; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Johannis Ewangeliste\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 50, Nr. 9; (515r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Agnetis\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 50, Nr. 11; (515v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In omnibus sollempnitatibus sancte Marie\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 51, Nr. 128; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad completorium\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 51, Nr. 123 (nur Strophenanf\u228 \'e4nge). CPPM Bd. 2, Nr. 1654; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad terciam per octavam\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 51, Nr. 126; (516r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Agathe virginis\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 51, Nr. 135; (516v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In invencione et exaltacione sancte crucis ad vesperas et laudes ymnus\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Ymnum dicamus \plain \f1\fs22 /\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Fidem refundens / Qui premium\plain \f1\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad completorium\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Crux fidelis \plain \f1\fs22 /\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Eterna Christi\plain \f1\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad terciam\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 50, Nr. 67 (nur Anfang); >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In nativitate et decollacione sancti Johannis Baptiste\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 27, Nr. 137; (517r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Petri et Pauli ymnus\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 50, Nr. 15; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Marie Magdalene\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 51, Nr. 74 (Anf\u228 \'e4nge der Str. 1\endash 3 und 13; zisterziensisch); (517v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Laurencii\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 50, Nr. 16; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Bernardi abbatis\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 52, Nr. 136 (zisterziensisch); (518r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Michaelis\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 14a, Nr. 74; (518v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Luce ewangeliste\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Ihesu corona celsior\plain \f1\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Omnium sanctorum ad vesperas et laudes\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 52, Nr. 79 (zisterziensisch); >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad nocturnos\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 50, Nr. 17 (nurAnfang); >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad completorium\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 51, Nr. 130; (519r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad terciam\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 50, Nr. 153; (519r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Martini episcopi\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 51, Nr. 176; (519v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Andree\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 51, Nr. 139; (520r\endash 521v) COMMUNE SANCTORUM. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De apostolis et martiribus ymnus\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 50, Nr. 17. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De uno martire ymnus\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 51, Nr. 114b; (520v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De uno confessore\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 51, Nr. 116 (zisterziensisch; Str. 1 und 2); >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Subsequentes versus intermittendus est Roberti, Petri, Remigii et in translatione sancti Benedicti\plain \f1\fs22 .< RH Nr. 1128; (521r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De virginibus\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 50, Nr. 21; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In dedicacione\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 51, Nr. 103.}

