\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 8r\endash 10v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 COLLECTAE}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipiunt collecte, qui proprietatem non habent\plain \f1\fs22 .< 25 kurze Gebete.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Da, quesumus, omnipotens deus, ut qui beati N martyris tui atque pontificis sollempnia colimus \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 ita pie devocionis erudiamur\plain \f1\fs22 . (9r\endash 11r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipiunt collecte sanctorum, qui proprietatem habent\plain \f1\fs22 .< 24 kurze Heiligengebete (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Marcelli\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Prisce\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Emerenciane\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Prothi et Iacincti, Abdon et Sennen\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Ciriaci et sociorum, Tymo\plain \f1\fs22 (thei)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  et Symph\plain \f1\fs22 (oriani),\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Hermetis martyris\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Nycomedis martyris, Lucie et Geminiani, Theodori, Felicitatis martyris.\plain \f1\fs22 (9v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Preces populi tui, quesumus, domine clementer exaudi \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 nos tribue meritis adiuvari\plain \f1\fs22 . \endash  11r\endash 12r leer.}

