\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 2r\endash 7v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 LITURGISCHES KALENDAR}}\plain \f1\fs22 . Feste der Kreuzherren:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Quiriaci episcopi et martyris \plain \f1\fs22 (4. Mai: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 duplex\plain \f1\fs22 <, anstelle von\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Corona domini \plain \f1\fs22 nachgetragen);\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Monice vidue \plain \f1\fs22 (11. Mai: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 duplex\plain \f1\fs22 <, nachgetragen),\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Translacio sancte Odilie virginis et martyris \plain \f1\fs22 (18. Juli: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 duplex\plain \f1\fs22 <),\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Helene regine \plain \f1\fs22 (18. Aug.: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Totum duplex\plain \f1\fs22 <);\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Augustini episcopi et confessoris \plain \f1\fs22 (28. Aug.: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 totum duplex\plain \f1\fs22 <),\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Octava sancti Augustini \plain \f1\fs22 (4. Sept.: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 simplex\plain \f1\fs22 <),\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Translacio sancti Augustini \plain \f1\fs22 (11. Okt.: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 duplex\plain \f1\fs22 <); >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Undecim milium virginum\plain \f1\fs22 < (21. Okt.: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Totum duplex\plain \f1\fs22 <). Charakteristisch f\u252 \'fcr den Kreuzherrenkonvent Marienfrede: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Anthonii abbatis\plain \f1\fs22 < (17. Jan.: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 totum duplex\plain \f1\fs22 <), >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ludgeri episcopi et confessoris\plain \f1\fs22 < (24. Apr.: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Simplex\plain \f1\fs22 <).}

