\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 139v\endash 142v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 CAPITULA ET ORATIONES AD HORAS BMV}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipiunt capitula et collectae ad horas beate Marie virginis. In cursu ipsius. Ad matutinas. Capitulum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Ego quasi vitis \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Sir 24,23]. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio\plain \f1\fs22 .< CO Nr. 706. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De omnibus sanctis. Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .< Vgl. CO Nr. 5921. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Pro pace. Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .< CO Nr. 1088a. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad primam. Capitulum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Ab inicio et ante se\plain \f1\fs22 - (140v) -\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 cula \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Sir 24,14]. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .< CO Nr. 2748. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad terciam. Capitulum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Et sic in Syon firmata sum \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Sir 24,15]. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Collecta ut supra in matutinis\plain \f1\fs22 .< >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad sextam. Capitulum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Et radicavi in populo honorificato \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Sir 24,16]. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .< CO Nr. 4756b. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad nonam. Capitulum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Quasi cedrus exaltata \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22  [Sir 24,17]. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .< CO Nr. 2649. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad vesperas. Capitulum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Sicut cynamonum \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 [Sir 24,20]. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Collecta ut supra in matutinis\plain \f1\fs22 .< >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad completorium. Capitulum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Ego mater pulchre dileccionis \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22  [Sir 24,24]. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .< Vgl. CO Nr. 663. (141v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In adventu domini. Hec sequens oracio dicatur. Ad laudes et ad terciam et ad vesperas. Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .< CO Nr. 1518. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 A nativitate domini usque ad purificacionem. Ad laudes et ad terciam et ad vesperas. Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .< CO Nr. 2113b. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quindecim gradus. In sabbatis dicendi, quando de beata virgine agitur\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Ad dominum\plain \f1\fs22 .\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Ps: Levavi. Ps: Letatus\plain \f1\fs22 . (\u8230 \'85) (142r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .< CO Nr. 16.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Sequitur Ps: Qui confidunt\plain \f1\fs22 . (\u8230 \'85) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .< CO Nr. 1143.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Sequitur Ps: De profundis\plain \f1\fs22 . (\u8230 \'85) (142v) CO Nr. 4587a.}

