\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 142v\endash 143v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 ORATIONES}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In cena domini ad locionem altarium dicantur oraciones sequentes sicut ad horas premissio\plain \f1\fs22 .< >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De sancta cruce. Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Deus, qui pro nobis filium tuum crucis patibulum subire voluisti \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ; (143r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De beata virgine. Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Concede nos, famulos tuos, quos, quesumus, domine deus, perpetua mentis et corporis salute gaudere \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De angelis. Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .< CO Nr. 1798; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De apostolis. Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Deus, qui nos per beatos apostolos tuos ad agnicionem tui nominis venire tribuisti \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De confessoribus. Oratio\plain \f1\fs22 .< (143v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Deus, qui nos sanctorum confessorum tuorum confessionibus gloriosis circumdas \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De virginibus. Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .< \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Omnipotens, sempiterne deus, qui infirma mundi eligis \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De omnibus sanctis. Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .< CO Nr. 5357. \endash  144rv leer.}

