\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 145r\endash 146v Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge des 16. Jh.s (Capitula, Orationes) zu den Festen Transfiguratio domini (1496 eingef\u252 \'fchrt) mit CO Nr. 1627; (145v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  sancti Ioseph \plain \f1\fs22 (1534 eingef\u252 \'fchrt): >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Deus, qui fidelissimo patriarche Ioseph incomparabilem thesaurum tue genitricis beate Marie semper virginis servandum tradidisti \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ; Compassio BMV (1504 eingef\u252 \'fchrt): >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .< \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Beate et gloriose semper virginis Marie nos tibi, domine, commendet oratio \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ; (146r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancte Monice vidue\plain \f1\fs22 < (1504 eingef\u252 \'fchrt): >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio\plain \f1\fs22 .< \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Deus, qui beate Monice pias lacrimas in gloriosi doctoris atque pontificis Augustini conversione propicius exaudisti \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 precum nostrarum salutarem consequamur effectum. Per\plain \f1\fs22 .}

