\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 3\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 14\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 LITURGISCHES KALENDAR}}\plain \f1\fs22 . Feste der Kreuzherren:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Quiriaci episcopi et martyris \plain \f1\fs22 (4. Mai:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  duplex\plain \f1\fs22 , Nachtrag:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  totum\plain \f1\fs22 ),\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Monice vidue \plain \f1\fs22 (11. Mai:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  duplex\plain \f1\fs22 ),\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Conversio sancti Augustini \plain \f1\fs22 (15. Mai:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  duplex\plain \f1\fs22 , Nachtrag des 17. Jh.s),\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Odilie virginis et martyris \plain \f1\fs22 (18. Juli:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  duplex\plain \f1\fs22 ),\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Helene regine \plain \f1\fs22 (18. Aug.:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  totum duplex\plain \f1\fs22 ),\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Augustini episcopi et confessoris \plain \f1\fs22 (28. Aug.:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  totum duplex\plain \f1\fs22 ),\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Octava Augustini \plain \f1\fs22 (4. Sept.:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  simplex\plain \f1\fs22 ),\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Translacio sancti Augustini \plain \f1\fs22 (11. Okt.:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  duplex\plain \f1\fs22 ),\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Undecim milium virginum \plain \f1\fs22 (21. Okt.:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Totum duplex\plain \f1\fs22 ).Rot her vorgehoben sind das Fest der hl. Agatha (5. Febr.: urspr\u252 \'fcnglich\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  totum duplex\plain \f1\fs22 , zu \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 duplex \plain \f1\fs22 ge\u228 \'e4ndert) sowie die Feste der Di\u246 \'f6zese L\u252 \'fcttich:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Servatii \plain \f1\fs22 (13. Mai:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  simplex\plain \f1\fs22 ; sp\u228 \'e4ter ge\u228 \'e4ndert in\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  duplex\plain \f1\fs22 );\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Lamberti \plain \f1\fs22 (17. Sept.:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  duplex\plain \f1\fs22 ),\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Dionisii \plain \f1\fs22 (9. Okt.:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  simplex\plain \f1\fs22 , sp\u228 \'e4ter ge\u228 \'e4ndert in\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  duplex\plain \f1\fs22 ).\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Antonii abbatis \plain \f1\fs22 (17. Jan.) nachtr\u228 \'e4glich von\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  duplex \plain \f1\fs22 in\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  totum duplex \plain \f1\fs22 ge\u228 \'e4ndert.}

