\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 53r\endash 67r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 SEPTEM PSALMI PAENITENTIALES CUM LITANIA ET ORATIONIBUS}}\plain \f1\fs22 . (53r\endash 61v) Ps 6, 31, 37, 50, 101, 129 und 142. (61v\endash 65r) Litania omnium sanctorum. Genannt sind u.a. Heilige des Kreuzherrenordens: Quiriacus, Augustinus, Anna, Odilia, Helena, Monika. (65r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Memoria pro peccatis\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ne reminiscaris, domine, delicta  nostra vel parentum nostrorum}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  neque vindictam sumas \plain \f1\fs22 (65v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  de peccatis nostris propter nomen tuum. \plain \f1\fs22 Klapper, Schriften, S. 307; CAO Nr. 3861.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Kyrieeleison, Christeeleyson, Kyrieeleison. Pater noster. Et ne nos. Ego dixi: Domine, miserere mei, sana animam, quia peccavi tibi \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ; (66r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Exaudi, quesumus, domine, supplicum preces et confitencium tibi \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 CO Nr. 2541; Klapper, Schriften, S. 329 und 334; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus, cui proprium est misereri et parcere \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 CO Nr. 1143; Klapper, Schriften, S. 332 (mit Abweichungen); (66v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ineffabilem misericordiam tuam, domine, nobis clementer ostende \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 CO Nr. 3129; Klapper, Schriften, S. 332; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Pro fractione silencii\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Ne reminiscaris, ut supra\plain \f1\fs22 . (\u8230 \'85) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .< (67r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Exaudi, domine, preces nostras et confitencium tibi parce peccatis \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 indulgencia tue pietatis absolvat. Per\plain \f1\fs22 .}

