\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 93r\endash 106v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 ORATIONES DE PASSIONE DOMINI}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Bonificacius \plain \f1\fs22 [!]\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  papa concessit omnibus dicentibus 20 diebus continuis oracionem sequentem ore confesso et ore contrito remissionem peccatorum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine deus, qui voluisti pro redempcione mundi nasci \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 39; \u228 \'e4hnlicher Text vgl. PL 217, Sp. 915 und CO Nr. 2315; (93v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio de septem verbis Christi in cruce\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine Jesu Christe, fili dei vivi, qui septem verba die ultimo in fine vite tue in cruce pendens dixisti \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Druck: PL 94, Sp. 561 f.; Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 342. CPPM Bd. 2, Nr. 3186a; (95v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Salutaciones ad omnia membra Christi\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Salve gloriosum caput nostri salvatoris \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 40; Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 80, Anm. 458; (96v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio sancti Ambrosii episcopi de passione domini\plain \f1\fs22 .< (97r){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine Jesu Christe, fili dei vivi, creator et resuscitator generis humani \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 1, S. 321; Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 80, Anm. 456; (101r\endash 102r) Orationes ad faciem salvatoris. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quicumque sequentem oracionem devote legerit inspiciendo faciem salvatoris domini nostri Iesu Christi, ille consequitur\plain \f1\fs22 <(sp\u228 \'e4terer Nachtrag:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  maxima merita\plain \f1\fs22 ). RH Nr. 18189; Walther I Nr. 17153; Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 101, G117; anschlie\u223 \'dfend Versikel:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Signatum est super nos lumen vultus tui, domine \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Deus misereatur nostri et benedicat nobis \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 und >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus, qui nobis signatis lumine vultus tui }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 (102r)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  ad instanciam Veronice tuam nobilissimam imaginem eius sudario mirabiliter impressam relinquere voluisti \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 350; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio de passione Iesu Christi et de septem verbis ultimis\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 Salve, Iesu, patrem in hora necessitatis invocans \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (103r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Item de eadem\plain \f1\fs22 .<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Eya rubens rosa flagrantissime charitatis, obsecro te per virtutem amoris \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (103v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De passione Christi oracio ad patrem\plain \f1\fs22 .< (104r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine, sancte pater, propter tuam largitatem et filii tui passionem, qui pro me sustinuit mortem \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Klapper, Schriften, S. 65, Nr. 7 (mit Abweichungen); (104r\endash 106r) Zwei Gebete aus dem [STIMULUS AMORIS]. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Alia de passione Christi ad filium\plain \f1\fs22 .< (104v) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O domine Iesu Christe, cor meum tuis vulneribus saucia et mentem meam tuo sanguine inebria \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Druck: Stimulus amoris fr. Iacobi Mediolanensis, in: Biblioteca Franciscana Ascetica Medii Aevi, Bd. 4, 2. Aufl., Quaracchi 1949, S. 1\endash 132, hier S. 13. (105r) Prologgebet. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De eadem\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Transfige, dulcissime Iesu, medullas anime mee suavissimo ac saluberrimo amoris tui vulnere \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Druck: Ebd., S. 3 ff. Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung des Gebetes vgl. F. Eisermann, \u8222 \'84Stimulus amoris\ldblquote . Inhalt, lateinische \u220 \'dcberlieferung, deutsche  \u220 \'dcbersetzungen, Rezeption, T\u252 \'fcbingen 2001 (MTU, 118), S. 250 f.; zur Rezeption des Werkes im Kreuzherrenorden unter dem Einfluss der Devotio moderna vgl. ebd., S. 329\endash 338. (106r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quicumque hanc oracionem contritus et confessus dixerit devote, maximas indulgencias consequitur\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine Iesu Christe, fili dei vivi, qui in tua benignissima passione perditum ho- }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 (106v)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  -minem restaurasti \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 ac gaudia consequi merear eterna. Qui vivis et regnas deus per o\plain \f1\fs22 (mnia)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  s\plain \f1\fs22 (ecula)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  s\plain \f1\fs22 (eculorum).\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\fs22 A\plain \f1\fs22 (men).}

