\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 128r\endash 129v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 [PS.-]THOMAS DE AQUINO}}\plain \f1\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 ORATIONES}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio sancti Thome pro conservacione sui status\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Concede mihi, misericors deus, que tibi placita sunt, ardenter concupiscere \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Druck: Thomas de Aquino: Opuscula omnia, Bd. 4, Paris 1927, S. 538 f. Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 391 (Register); Wilmart, Auteurs spirituels, S. 379 f., Anm. 1; S. 387, Anm. 6 und S. 584; Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, G82. Zur Verfasserfrage vgl. VL2 Bd. 9, Sp. 813\endash 838, bes. Sp. 833 f. (129v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sanctus Thomas antequam predicaret, studeret, legeret, dictaret, sic orabat\plain \f1\fs22 :< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Creator ineffabilis, qui de thesau}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 - (130r) -}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ris sapientie tue novem angelorum hierarchias annotasti }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash \u8230 \'85 Qui cum patre et spiritu sancto vivis et reg\plain \f1\fs22 (nas)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  deus laudabilis, gloriosus et benedictus in infinita secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 218. Zur Verfasserfrage in Bezug auf beide Gebete vgl. Grabmann, Werke, S. 370 ff.}

