\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 130v\endash 134r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 ORATIONES DIVERSAE}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio devota pro castitate\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O puritas, rosa florens, aurora nitidior \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (131v\endash 133v) Orationes paenitentiales. Rubrik gr\u246 \'f6\u223 \'dftenteils ausradiert; Schluss: (132r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Insuper est sciendum, quod sanctus Johannes evangelista revelavit hanc oracionem tante fore efficacie et veritatis sicut evangelium suum \u8218 \'82In principio\lquote \plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O domine Iesu Christe, suscipe hanc dominicam oracionem in memoriam illius sanctissime mortis tue \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (132v) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O domine Iesu Christe, suscipe hanc oracionem in memoriam illius gaudii, quod habuit benedicta anima tua in limbo inferni \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (133r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O domine Iesu Christe, suscipe hanc dominicam oracionem in memoriam illius gaudii, quod habuit beatissima mater tua \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (133v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio post confessionem dicenda\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Omnipotens sempiterne deus misericordissime, qui venisti peccatores redimere, peto te per dulcissimum sacramentum corporis et sanguinis tui mysterium \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 134, Anm. 825; (134r) Anfang des n\u228 \'e4chsten Textes abgeschnitten. Es handelt sich um das Gebet: O bone Iesu, duo in me cognosco: naturam, quam tu fecisti et peccatum, quod ego adieci \u8230 \'85 vgl. Leroquai, Livres d\rquote heures 1, S. 77.}

