\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 141r\endash 143r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 PLANCTUS BMV}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Planctus beate Marie virginis, quem qui devoto corde dixerit, consequitur\plain \f1\fs22 < (sp\u228 \'e4tere Erg\u228 \'e4nzung:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  maximum meritum\plain \f1\fs22 ). Der weitere Text der Rubrik getilgt. AH Bd. 54, Nr. 201. Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 99, G107; anschlie\u223 \'dfend (142v) Versikel:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  In omni tribulacione, turbacione, desolacione et angustia nostra subveniat nobis pia virgo Maria \plain \f1\fs22 und >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Omnipotens, eterne deus, qui devotissimam virginem Mariam doloris gladio infantum nece filii amissione sauciare voluisti \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et tecum celestis regni participes esse mereamur. Per e\plain \f1\fs22 (undem)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Christum\plain \f1\fs22 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

