\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 150rv {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 ORATIONES AD BMV}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Leo papa secundus concessit omnibus vere penitentibus \plain \f1\fs22 (sp\u228 \'e4terer Nachtrag ohne Rubrizierung:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  reconfessis omnium peccatorum remissionem\plain \f1\fs22 )\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  scriptam orationem dicentibus\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ave virgo gloriosa, stella sole clarior \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Druck: Meersseman, Hymnos, Bd. 1, S. 220 (in der Hs. nur der Anfang). RH Nr. 2214 (Ave virgo gratiosa); (150v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Hec quicumque legerit coram imagine virginis accensa candela cum 15 Ave Maria, quitquid pecierit, obtinebit\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O gloriosa anima Marie, illumina me, o dignum, fidum cor Marie, sim ego tibi cure \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et periculis adesto mihi et libera me. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 .}

