\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 165v\endash 166v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 ORATIONES DE PASSIONE DOMINI ET IN ELEVATIONE HOSTIAE}}\plain \f1\fs22 . Anstelle der urspr\u252 \'fcnglichen Rubrik sp\u228 \'e4terer Nachtrag:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Sequens oratio de passione domini virtuosa et devota, valde meritoria dicentibus\plain \f1\fs22 . (166r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Obsecro te, domine dulcissime Iesu Christe, ut passio tua sit mihi virtus, qua muniar, protegar atque defendar \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio in elevacione\plain \f1\fs22 .< RH Nr. 2059. Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 106; Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 87, G52.}

