\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [1]r Sp\u228 \'e4tere Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge (Tinte stark abgerieben). Besitzvermerk:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De Lienden Stephano pertinet iste liber. Hoc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  est hunc: De Lyenden Alberto pertinet iste liber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Si\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  prioribus verumtamen annis pertinuit honorabili discretoque viro, necnon utriusque iuris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (durchgestrichen und am rechten Rand nachgetragen:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  licenciato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  magistro Goswino de Lienden\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Orarius iste cuius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  vita nonnullis annis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  fructus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sepultus et in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [\u8230 \'85].\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Cuius anima requiescat in perpetua pace. Amen. Orarius Stephani Liendensis Zwollis litteris operam adhibentis tercioque loco insidentis. Orarius Alberti Stephani huius filii Lyendensis Daventrie litteris operam adhibentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [\u8230 \'85]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  loco insidentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .}

