\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\fs22 117\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f2\fs22 \endash 140\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ORATIONES ET SUFFRAGIA}}\plain \f2\fs24 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Decem milium martyrum. O fortissimi milites decem milium martyrum, succurite mihi in presenti tribulacione}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\fs24 ;(118\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16 r\plain \f2\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De sancto Eusebio. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Inclite martir Eusebi, qui fla- }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (118v)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  -granti zelo dominum Ihesum Christum perfectissime diligebas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\fs24 ; (120\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16 r\plain \f2\fs24 \endash 121\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16 r\plain \f2\fs24 ) Orationes de passione domini.\plain \f2\fs24\chcbpat17  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Domine Ihesu Christe, qui in cruce mor<i>ens morte tuam ortem nostram parasti}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\fs24 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Piissime domine Ihesu Christe, qui }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (120}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs16\chcbpat17 v}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 pro mundi redempcione voluisti a Iudeis reprobari}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\fs24 ; (121\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16 r\plain \f2\fs24 ) Oratio in tribulationibus.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Adiuva nos, deus, salutaris noster, adiuva nos in tribulacionibus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\fs24 ; (121\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16 v\plain \f2\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Contra incursum raptorum proficit dicere oracionem benediccionem scilicet\plain \f2\fs24 :< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Deus misericors, deus misericors, deus misericors, de manu inimicorum extollat et libera me propter nomen sanctum tuum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\fs24 ; (122\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16 v\plain \f2\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item contra timores raptorum valet fiducialiter dicere officium de sancta cruce, valet eciam fiducialiter dicere officium de beata virgine, scilicet \u8218 \'82Salva sancta parens\lquote  cum ewangelio sancti Jo\plain \f2\fs24 (hannis).< Io1,1\endash 14; (123\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16 v\plain \f2\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oracio de beata virgine gloriosa Maria\plain \f2\fs24 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Domina mea, sancta Maria, perpetua virgo, mater summe benignitatis et misericordie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\fs24 Druck: Klapper, Schriften, S. 343\endash 350 (gek\u252 \'fcrzt; stellenweise mit Abweichungen). Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 81, Anm. 467 (?) und S. 92, Anm. 552 (?); Wilmart, Auteurs spirituels, S. 516, Anm. 1, Nr. 5; (127\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16 r\plain \f2\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic pete, quid vis\plain \f2\fs24 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pro que te suppliciter et devote exoro \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\fs24 ; (128\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16 v\plain \f2\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quicumque oracionem predictam existens in gracia per xxx dies continuatos devote et intente dixerit, quidquid a domina nostra salubriter et utiliter petierit, indubitanter obtinebit\plain \f2\fs24 .< >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancto sacramento\plain \f2\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Domine, non sum dignus, ut intres sub tectum meum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\fs24 Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 80 f., G18; (130\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16 r\plain \f2\fs24 ) Suffragium de sancta Catharina. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancta Katharina. Antiphona\plain \f2\fs24 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  O gloriosa et beata virgo martyr Katharina, tue virginitati me et omnia munera mea hodie et in omni tempore commendo \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\fs24 (130\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16 v\plain \f2\fs24 ) AH Bd. 29, Nr. 217 (Str. 1 und 3); anschlie\u223 \'dfend Versikel und Collecta:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[14].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Deus, qui per beatam et gloriosam Katharinam, virginem et rethorem tuam, populi multitudinem ab erroribus renovasti}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\fs24 ; (131\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16 r\plain \f2\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oracio valde bona\plain \f2\fs24 .< [B\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ERNARDINUS \plain \f2\fs24 S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ENENSIS \plain \f2\fs24 (?)]: O\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 RATIO DE NOMINE \plain \f2\fs24 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ESUS\plain \f2\fs24 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 O bone Ihesu, o piissime Ihesu, o dulcissime Ihesu, o Ihesu, fili virginis Marie, plenus misericordia et pietate}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\fs24 Druck: Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 345. Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 81,  Anm. 474; VL\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16 2 \plain \f2\fs24 Bd. 1, Sp. 789\endash 793, hier Sp. 792 f.; DLL MA Bd. 2, Sp. 872 ff., hier Sp. 874; Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 77 f., G8; D. Pacetti, De sancti Bernardini Senensis operibus, Quaracchi 1947, S. 101 f.; (133\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16 r\plain \f2\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quicumque hanc oracionem sequentem cotidie semel in die dixerit, habebit dies indulgenciarum vi\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs16 c\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vi\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs16 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  lxxvi, quia tot vulnera habuit dominus noster Ihesus Cristus. Et hec est\plain \f2\fs24 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Precor te, piissime domine Ihesu Christe, per illam eximiam caritatem, qua humanum genus dilexisti}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\fs24 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 443 (Register); vgl. ebd. 1, S. XXXI und 336 (Precorte, amantissime \u8230 \'85); Wilmart, Auteurs spirituels, S. 377 f., Anm. 1, Nr. 12;  Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 80, Anm. 457 und S. 124, Anm. 735; VL\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16 2 \plain \f2\fs24 Bd. 1, Sp. 687 f.; Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 90 f., G64; (134\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16 r\plain \f2\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Octo versus sancti Bernardi\plain \f2\fs24 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Illumina oculos meos, ne umquam obdormiam in morte}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\fs24 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 443 (mehrere Stellen); Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 91 f.,  G66; (135\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16 r\plain \f2\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Collecta\plain \f2\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Omnipotens, s}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\fs24\chcbpat17 (empiterne) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 deus, qui Ezechie, regi Iude, tecum lacrimis deprecanti vite spacium pretendisti}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\fs24 ; (135\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16 r\plain \f2\fs24 \endash 136\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16 v\plain \f2\fs24 ) Suffragia de sanctis. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancto Christoforo. Antiphona\plain \f2\fs24 .< RH Nr. 18445 mit Versikel CAO Nr. 8081 und Kollekte CO Nr. 783; (136\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16 r\plain \f2\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancto Adriano. Antiphona\plain \f2\fs24 .< AH Bd. 25, Nr. 4, S. 19 [ad Magnificat], mit Versikel und Kollekte: (136\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16 v\plain \f2\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Deus, qui beatum Adrianum sociosque suos multiplici martirio decorasti}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\fs24 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancta Barbara\plain \f2\fs24 .< Versikel:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ora pro nobis beata Barbara. Ut \plain \f2\fs24 (137\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16 r\plain \f2\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  digni efficiamur promissione Christi\plain \f2\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Collecta\plain \f2\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[13].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Deus, qui beate Barbare, martiris tue, annua sollempnitate letificas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\fs24 ; Oratio ad BMV. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oracio valde bona\plain \f2\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Obsecro te, domina sancta Maria, mater dei pietate plenissima, summi regis filia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et exaudi me, dulcissima Maria, mater dei et misericordie. \plain \f2\fs24 Druck: Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 346 f.; Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S.76 f., G6.}

