\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 150r\endash 151r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 GEBETE UND NEKROLOGISCHE NOTIZEN}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O Ihesu bone, spes penitentium, qui Marie peccatrici}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O Maria, dei genitrix, virgo gloriosa, omnium desolatorum ad te clamantium consolatrix}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Domine Ihesu Christe, fac me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 nomen thezauri scire \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [?] Text durch Tintenabrieb gr\u246 \'f6\u223 \'dftenteils unleserlich); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Simplex et rectus, humilis pietatis amicus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  / Morum collegis lux radiosa suis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Nekrologischer Eintrag:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Anno domini millesimo quingentesimo tricesimo tercio, sexto Idus novembris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (8. Nov.),\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  mortem oppetyt pius pater meus dictus Stephanus de Lyenden mane, circiter horam octavam. Cuius anima requiescat in pace. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . (151r) Zwei Notizen: erste Notiz unleserlich durch Tintenabrieb: [\u8230 \'85]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  post nativitatis Johannis Baptiste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Altera vero dedicatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [\u8230 \'85] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 post nativitatis beate virginis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; anschlie\u223 \'dfend weitere nekrologische Eintr\u228 \'e4ge: 1)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Anno domini millesimo quin- gentesimo secundo, vi Idus februarias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (8. Feb.),\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  mortem oppetijt pius pater meus dictus Goesswinus de Lyenden tempore vespertino, circiter horam sextam. Cuius anima requiescat in pace. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . 2)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Anno domini Millesimo quingentesimo primo, Nonis Aprilibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (5. Apr.),\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  septimam ferme circiter horam temporeque vespertino, pia mater mea dicta Hildegond de Oemeren vita functa est ac nature deoque concessit. Cuius anima requiescat in pace. Amen\plain \f3\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Darunter Federproben.}

