\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 123r\endash 133r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 CANTICA}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Canticum.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Confitebor tibi, domine \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  [Is 12,1\endash 6]; (123v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Canticum.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Ego dixi in dimidio dierum meorum \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  [Is 38,10\endash 20]; (124v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Canticum.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Exultavit cor meum \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  [I Sm 2,1\endash 5], Text unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig durch Blattverlust; (125r) Teil des Canticum\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Cantemus domino \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  [Ex 15,1\endash 19], hier erhalten Ex 9\endash 19; (125v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Canticum.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Domine, audivi audicionem tuam \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  [Hab 3,2\endash 19]; (127r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Canticum.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Audite celi, que loquar \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  [Dt 32,1\endash 43]; (130r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Canticum.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Te deum, CPL Nr. 650; (131r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Canticum.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Benedicite omnia opera domini \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  [Dn 3,57\endash 88]; (132r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Canticum.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Lc 1,68\endash 79 (Benedictus); (132v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Canticum.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Lc 1,46\endash 55 (Magnificat); (133r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Canticum.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Lc 2,29\endash 32 (Nunc dimittis). Stegm\u252 \'fcller RB Nr. 21g\endash h.}

