\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 3r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 QUATUORDECIM PERICULA DEFECTUS IN MISSA}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sciendum sumopere, quod secundum scripta sanctorum doctorum Thome, Alberti, Monoldi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [!]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , Richardi, Ubertini, Raymundi quatuordecim sunt pericula defectus vel negligencie, que in missa contingere possunt. Primus defectus est, si sacerdos morte vel gravi infirmitate occupetur ante consecracionem, non oportet, quod per alium suppleatur \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 Item si sine stola vel manipulo quis celebraverit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (?),\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  graviter delinquit, consecrat tamen. Finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .}

