\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 3v Schemata zu (1) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 [PS.-]BONAVENTURA}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 TABULA DE CONSIDERANDIS A MISSA CELEBRATURIS}}\plain \f3\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Speculum sacerdotum sancti Bonaventure Cardinalis. Dedit legenti ante missam 40 dies indulgenciarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Intentionis discussione propter vanam gloriam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Distelbrink Nr. 225. Franz, Messe, S. 474 f. Unter dem Schema Exzerpt aus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ps.-Anselmus Cantuariensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : Orationes. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Est autem de hoc, quantum mihi videtur, expeditum et salubre consilium a peccatis cessare et sacrificium offerre deo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 quam propter formidinem peccati etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Druck: PL 158, Sp. 912. (2) [PS.-]BONAVENTURA: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 INSTRUCTIO SACERDOTIS AD SE PRAEPARANDUM AD CELEBRANDUM MISSAM}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Hec sanctus Bonaventura in stimulo amoris, libro sic dicto, capitulo 17o etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< Druck: Bonaventura, Opera omnia, hg. v. A. C. Peltier, Bd. 12, Paris 1868, S. 288\endash 291. Distelbrink Nr. 146.}

