\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 4r\endash 8r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ORATIONES}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 PS.-ANSELMUS CANTUARIENSIS}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : ORATIONES (Oratio 33)]. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio sancti Jheronimi ante missam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Si tantum, domine, reatum nostre delinquentie cogitemus \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Druck: PL 158, Sp. 926 (hier l\u228 \'e4ngere Fassung). Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 1, S. 51; anschlie\u223 \'dfend CO Nr. 361. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Notabile\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominus Nicolaus de Cusa cardinalis legatus instituit et quinquaginta dies indulgentiarum dedit legenti hanc subsequentem clausulam dominicis diebus post ultimam collectam in missa. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Et famulos tuos N papam et N antistitem nostros}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  una cum universa ecclesia chatholica ab omni adversitate custodi. Per dominum etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . (4v) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio sancti Augustini episcopi ante missam dicenda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O pulcherrime domine Ihesu Christe, rogo te per illam sacratissimam effusionem preciosissimi sanguinis tui}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Gebet auf der Grundlage von: Ps.-Augustinus: Manuale; Druck: PL 40, Sp. 956 f. (mit Abweichungen). CPPM Bd. 2, Nr. 3074; Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 102 f., Anm. 600; (5r) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 JOHANNES FISCANNENSIS}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ]: ORATIO ANTE MISSAM. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio sancti Ambrosii episcopi devota ante missam dicenda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Summe sacerdos et vere pontifex \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Ed.: Wilmart, Auteurs spirituels, S. 114\endash 124. VL2 Bd. 1, Sp. 327 ff., hier Sp. 327 f.; (7r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio post missam dicenda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Gracias tibi ago, domine, sancte pater, omnipotens, eterne deus, quodme, indignum famulum tuum, saciare dignatus es corpore et sanguine unigeniti filii tui}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Druck: Thomas de Aquino, Opera omnia, Bd. 32, Paris 1879, S. 821 f., Nr. 8. Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 1, S. 156, 258, 279; ebd. 2, S. 37, 39, 232; Wilmart, Auteurs spirituels, S. 381, Anm. 2; Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 86, G48. Zur Verfasserfrage vgl. Grabmann S. 371; (7v) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad beatam virginem oracio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O serenissima et inclita mater domini nostri Ihesu, sanctissima virgo Maria, regina celi et domina mundi, que  eundem deum omnium creaturarum in tuo sanctissimo utero digna fuisti portare}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Commendo corpus meum et animam meam, domine Ihesu Christe, in tuam graciam et custodiam tuam piissimam misericordiam humiliter deprecando}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (8r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Clemens papa componens hanc oracionem dat omnibus post missam eam legentibus veniam omnium defectuum in missa et 3c dies indulgenciarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Obsecro te, dulcissime domine Ihesu Christe, ut passio tua sit mihi virtus, qua muniar, protegar atque defendar \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Sixtus quartus concessit omnibus hanc orationem devote dicentibus coram ymagine beate Marie in sole xi milia annorum indulgencie in gracia existentibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ave sanctissima Maria, mater dei, regina celi, porta paradisi, domina mundi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 381; Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 93, Anm. 555; Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 98 f., G105; VL2  Bd. 11, Sp. 4\endash 7, hier Sp. 4 ff.; DLL MA Bd. 2, Sp. 1462 f., hier Sp. 1462; Paulus, Geschichte des Ablasses, S. 251; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Alexander papa sextus concessit decem milia mortalibus et xx\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (\u252 \'fcber der Zeile\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  annorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 milia pro venialibus dicenti hanc oracionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ave Maria gracia plena, dominus tecum, tua gracia sit mecum, benedicta tu in mulieribus et benedicta sit sancta Anna, mater tua}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 125, Anm. 748; Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 120, G227; Paulus, Geschichte des Ablasses, S. 251.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Trina vice coram imagine sancte Anne ac virginis Marie etc., quas proprio ore promulgavit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (unter der Zeile\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et pronunciavit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  anno 1494o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  8v\endash 9v leer\plain \f2\fs24 .}

