\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 1r\endash 46v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 LIBELLUS ANTIQUARUM DEFINITIONUM ORDINIS CISTERCIENSIS}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (von 1316), am Anfang unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig durch Blattverlust. (1r\endash 2v) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 CHARTA CARITATIS  POSTERIOR}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  ||\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  magis gaudeant \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  Anfang von Kap. 3. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De generatione filiarum abbatiarum et de auctoritate capituli generalis. Capitulum iii\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Dum vero aliquarum nostrarum ecclesiarum dei gracia adeo creverit \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 celebrabitur\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Explicit carta caritatis.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < \endash  Druck: PL 166, Sp. 1377\endash  1384; Nomasticon Cisterciense S. 68\endash 73. (2v\endash 8r) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 CLEMENS PAPA IV.}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 BULLA \u8218 \'82PARVUS FONS\lquote }}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Prefacio super Clementinam.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Supradictum itaque decretum seu caritatis cartam \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (3r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Unde ortum habuerit Clementina\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Verum inimico humani generis caritati predictorum patrum ac fratrum invidente \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit ordinacio Clementis pape quarti de commendatione ordinis Cisterciensis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Clemens episcopus servus servorum dei ad perpetuam rei memoriam. Fons parvus, qui creavit\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  [!]\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  in fluvium \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 vel ei ausu temerarie contraire\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  Druck: Magnum Bullarium Romanum, Bd. 3,1, S. 429\endash 433; Nomasticon Cisterciense S. 367\endash 376. Potthast Nr. 19185. (8r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit distinctio ii, que habet ii capitula, ut in omnibus monasteriis ordinis habeantur transcripta privilegiorum communium et ut omnes presertim abbates ad tuicionem ipsorum intendant. Cap. i\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Supradictam domini Clementis pape iiii decisionem et ordinacionen tam graciosam tam utilem nec non et sepe dictam caritatis cartam \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et observant ipse ac faciant ab aliis firmiter observari\plain \f1\fs22 .\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Explicit\plain \f1\fs22 . (44\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 46\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis. \endash  Druck: Nomasticon Cisterciense S. 376\endash 378 und 395\endash 470. Zum Text vgl. Lucet, Codifications, S. 256 f. \endash  47\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 48\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22  leer.}

