\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 161r\endash 163r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 MECHTHILD [VON HACKEBORN}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 LIBER SPECIALIS GRATIAE}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ], pars 1, cap. 19 (Exzerpt). >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequuntur quinque oraciones de quinque gaudiis dominice resurrectionis beate Machteldi quodam paschatis die divinitus revelate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Laudo, adoro et magnifico, glorifico et benedico te, Jesu bone, in illo ineffabili gaudio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 ut habeam una cum eis gaudium et omne bonum, hic et in eternum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  Druck: Revelationes Gertrudianae et Mechtildianae, Bd. 2: S. Mechtildis virginis ordinis s. Benedicti Liber specialis gratiae. Opus editum Solesmensium O.S.B. monachorum cura et opera, Paris 1877, S. 65\endash 67.}

