\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 163r\endash  164v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 THOMAS DE AQUINO}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 SEQUENTIA DE CORPORE CHRISTI}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Prosa a sancto Thoma Aquinate composita, in qua compendiose mysterium sacrosancti sacramenti eucharistie sive altaris continetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< AH Bd. 50, Nr. 385. \endash  165 leer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

