\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 4ra\endash 313va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 BIRGITTA SUECICA}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 REVELATIONES}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . (4ra\endash 6rb) Kapitelverzeichnis zu Liber 1. Am oberen Rand von Bl. 4r Vermerk: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 1461. Hoc opus est ceptum, dum festum est gregorianum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< (6va\endash 26r) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 MATTHIAS LINCOPIENSIS}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 PROLOG}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Mistica scribenti cum sit michi tremulus index: Te, pie nate die, sis, rogo, dux calami\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< (6vb) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit prologus in libris revelacionum dei beate Brigitte divinitus revelatis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 < (6v)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Stupor et mirabilia audita sunt in terra nostra \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 ab ipso missa fatebuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . (10ra\endash 57vb) Liber 1.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ego sum creator celi et terre \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 usquequo veniant ad locum, qui michi placuerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Explicit liber primus celestis revelacionum dei beate Brigitte, principisse Nericie de regno Swecie, divinitus revelatus. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< (57vb\endash 95ra) Liber 2. (57vb\endash 59ra) Kapitelverzeichnis. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit liber celestis revelationum dei secundus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Filius loquebatur ad sponsam dicens: Quando dyabolus temptat te \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 sed cum tempus fuerit loquendi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Explicit liber secundus celestis revelacionum dei beate Brigide, principisse Nericie de regno Swecie, divinitus revelatus. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< (95rb\endash 129rb) Liber 3. (95rb\endash 96vb) Kapitelverzeichnis. (96vb) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit liber celestis tercius revelationum beate Brigide, principisse Nericie de regno Suecie, divinitus revelatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< (97ra)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ihesus Christus, deus et homo, qui venit ad terram \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 que deficiebant exponenda in dicta visione, ut sequitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Explicit liber celestis tercius revelacionum dei beate Brigide divinitus revelatus. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< (124ra\endash 206vb) Liber 4. (124ra\endash 129rb) Kapitelverzeichnis. (129rb) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit liber quartus celestis revelationum dei beate Brigide, principisse etc., divinitus revelatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< (129va)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Apparuit sponse persona quedam, cuius crines videbantur circumcise cum obprobrio \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et non sedebit cum iudicantibus orbem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Explicit liber quartus celestis revelacionum dei beate Brigide, principisse Nericie de regno Swecie, divinitus revelatus. Deo gracias. Completus 1462 in vigilia beati Mathie apostoli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< (207ra\endash 228ra) Liber 5. (207ra\endash 208vb) Kapitelverzeichnis. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Rubrice libri questionum quinti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< (209ra) Prolog:{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Incipit liber quintus celestium revelacionum Christi ad beatam Brigidam de regno Suecie \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 prout alios libros revelacionum transferre solitus erat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . (209rb) (am unteren Rand: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit liber quintus celestium revelacionum, qui intitulatur liber questionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<). >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Visio prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Vidi thronum in celo, in quo sedebat dominus }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 (209vb)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  Ihesus Christus ut iudex \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 Itaque cum veneris ad ista loca, ostendam tibi plura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Explicit liber quintus celestis questionum revelatarum a Christo sponse sue beate Brigide, principisse Nericie de regno Suecie. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< (229ra\endash 291vb) Liber 6. (229ra\endash 233vb) Kapitelverzeichnis. (234ra) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit liber celestis revelationum dei sextus beate Brigide de regno Suecie divinitus revelatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Mater dei loquebatur ad sponsam dicens: Ego sum regina celi \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et laborare manibus quam in heremo vel religione stare sine caritate dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Deo gratias. Explicit liber sextus revelationum dei beate Brigide, principisse Nericie de regno Suecie, divinitus revelatus. Completus anno etc. 1462\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< (292ra\endash 313va) Liber 7. (292ra\endash 293va) Kapitelverzeichnis. (293vb)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Cum esset in Roma domina Brigida, sponsa Christi \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 inter manus predictarum personarum emisit spiritum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Eplicit ultimus liber celestis revelationum dei beate Brigide, principisse Nericie de regno Suecie, divinitus revelatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< \endash  Ed.: Buch 1: C.-G. Undhagen (Hg.), Sancta Brigitta: Revelaciones, Book I with Magister Mathias\rquote  prologue, Uppsala 1978 (Hs. genannt S. X; Kurzbeschreibung der Hs. und Textbestand S. 192 f.); Buch 2: C.-G. Undhagen / B. Bergh (Hg.), Sancta Birgitta: Revelaciones, Book II, Stockholm 2001; Buch 3: A.-M. J\u246 \'f6nsson (Hg.); Sancta Birgitta: Revelaciones, Book III, Stockholm 1998; Buch 4: H. Aili (Hg.), Sancta Birgitta: Revelaciones, Book IV, Stockholm 1992; Buch 5: B. Bergh (Hg.), Sancta Birgitta: Revelaciones, Book V, Uppsala 1971; Buch 6: B. Bergh (Hg.), Sancta Birgitta: Revelaciones, Book VI, Stockholm 1991 (bis Kap. 119; Kap. 65 wurde in zwei Teile gegliedert, wodurch Buch 6 in der Hs. insgesamt 120 Kapitel z\u228 \'e4hlt); Buch 7: B. Bergh (Hg.), Den heliga Birgittas Revelaciones, Bok VII, Uppsala 1967 (in der Hs. Aufteilung in 32 Kapitel). K. B. Westman, Birgitta-Studier, Bd. 1, Uppsala 1911, S. 271 (Hs. genannt). VL2 Bd. 1, Sp. 867 f.; CALMA Bd. 2,4, S. 410 f., Nr. 1. \endash  314 leer. \endash  313vb\endash 314vb leer.}

