\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 315ra\endash 361v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 BIRGITTA SUECICA}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 LIBER CAELESTIS IMPERATORIS AD REGES}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Revelationes, Liber 8). (315ra\endash 316ra) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ALFONSUS GIENNENSIS}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 EPISTULA SOLITARII AD REGES}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Cap. 1). >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit epistola solitarii ad reges reprehenduntur hic illi, qui ex abrupto et improvise nullo examine precedente approbant aut reprobant personas se asserentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (\u252 \'fcber Zeile:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  habere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  visiones et revelaciones divinas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O serenissimi reges et utinam veri reges in Christo, domini mei precarissimi \u8230 \'85 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quoniam moris regum existit velle curiose discutere \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 ut illusions pessimas illas debemus despicere et eis nullatenus fidem dare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . (316ra) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ponitur hic in theorica modus examinis faciendi de qualitate persone videntis visiones et de modo habendi eas ac de qualitate materie visionum et revelacionum. Cap. ii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Dicunt sancti patres et doctores ecclesie, quod persona visiones videns debet tali modo examinari \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et videbitis in consciencia vestra, quod ego sum suavis et mitis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  Ed.: H. Aili (Hg.), Sancta Birgitta: Revelaciones, Book VIII, Stockholm 2002 (Text des Prologs nach der Ed. von A. J\u246 \'f6nsson). Ed. des Prologs: A. J\u246 \'f6nsson, Alfonso of Ja\u233 \'e9n. His life and works with critical editions of the \ldblquote Epistola Solitarii\rdblquote , the \ldblquote Informationes\rdblquote  and the \ldblquote Epistola Serui Christi\rdblquote , Lund 1989 (Studia Graeca et Latina Lundensia, 1), S. 117\endash 179. CALMA Bd. 2,4, S. 410 f., Nr. 1. Zu Alphonsus Giennensis vgl. CALMA Bd. 1,2, S. 189, ALPH 23, Nr. 4.}

