\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 26r\endash 31v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 PROPOSITIONES PRINCIPALES CUM PRAEAMBULIS DE REFORMATIONE ORDINIS CISTERCIENSIS.}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quatuor propositiones preambule sequentibus aliis quatuor propositionibus premittende. Prima propositio preambula. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Usurpationes et abusus dominorum abbatum cistercii contra communem ordinis statum libertates et iura minus valde forent tollerabiles quam inferiorum ordinis abbatum paribus aliis excessus consimiles \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (28r)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sequuntur quatuor propositiones principales. Prima proposicio principalis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Per abusum enormem et ampliationem indebitam potestatis tam ordinarie quam reformatorie domni cisterciensis totus corpus ordinis intollerabiliter exturbantur }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 (31r)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Et similiter in annua monasterii cistercii visitatione de cetero modis omnibus observentur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Es folgt eine Zusammenfassung in sechs Punkten.}

