\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 158rv {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ORATIO DE PASSIONE CHRISTI}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio ad laudem passionis Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ave sacratissimum sanguis domini nostri Jhesu Christi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 de omnibus peccatis meis. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 158v\endash 172v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ABLASSGEBETE}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Wer dit gebet spricht, uerdeynt dusent jair aflais degelicher s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (unden).<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  O leue herre Jhesu Christe, ich biden dich durch dyn dure, werde bloit \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (158v\endash 166r) Paternoster Gebet. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Der dit gebet spricht, uerdeynt uan v paissen uan\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  dage\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< (159r) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O barmhertziger, milder ind alre leifster herre Jhesu Christe, ich offeren dir dit pater noster dem werdichen, reynen, kyntliche blode tzo eren}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Passionsgebet mit acht Paternostern (gewidmet dem Blut, dem Schwei\u223 \'df, den Schmerzen, der Dornenkr\u246 \'f6nung, den verwundeten F\u252 \'fc\u223 \'dfen und H\u228 \'e4nden sowie dem Tod Christi); (166r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 So wer dit gebet leist off deit lesen drissich dage, dem it also veil nutz off he alle dage hundert selter leisse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< (166v)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O alre sanftmoediche here Jhesu Christe, de uan dem schois des almechtigen uaders bis in dese werelt komen de sunden tzo uergeuen \u8230 \'85 verloese ind sterck vns, leue here, uan den bedroiffenys, dar wir yn gesat syn}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 wir dancken dir, du, de da benedyt durch all de werelt. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 172v\endash 186v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ORATIONES ET SUFFRAGIA DE SANCTIS}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Rubriken:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ad proprium angelum tuum, de sancto Johanne Baptista, de sancto Johanne apostolo, de sancto Petro apostolo, de venerabili patre nostro Bernardo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (175r),\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  de sancto Benedicto, de sancto Servacio episcopo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (176r)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , de tribus regibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[23].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Rex Melchior, Caspar, rex Balthasar, rogo vos hodie per singularia vestra nomina, rogo vos trinos sanctos per sanctam trinitatem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 135)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , de Anthonio sancto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (u.a. CO Nr. 1486)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , de sancto Quirino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (178r)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , de Christofero martire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (u.a. gek\u252 \'fcrzte Fassung von CO Nr. 783)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , de sancto Sebastiano martire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (u.a. gek\u252 \'fcrzte Fassung von CO Nr. 3755b)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , de sancto Laurencio martyre, de sancto Georgio, de sancto Michaele, de sancto Jacobo maior, de sancto Huberto, de sancto Cornelio, de sancto Herasmo, ad decem milium martyrum, ad sanctum Jheronimum, de sancto Egidio, de sancto Materno, de sancto Blasio, ad sanctum Martinum, de sancta Margareta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Initien im Register.}

