\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 165r\endash 174v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 EPISTULAE AD SORORES}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . (165r\endash 170v) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 DE PROFESSIONE ET CLAUSTRO}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Oberer Rand: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Deus assit et mater eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Van gelofften der geestelicker lude. Ende van beslot.Een Epistel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Die selue gruete my in uwen brieff voergescreuen, scryue ic v weder toe troest uwes druckes als dat druckelicke leuen ons lieuen heren \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 dat wy ten lesten comen moegen totten ewigen vrede. Amen. Gescreuen van enen monick xl jair int beslot geweest. Bidt god voir one\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . (171r\endash 174v) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 DE SCAPULARI}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Eyn epistel van den scapelier der geestlicker lude\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Jhesus Cristus, die om onsen wille totter martelien syn cruys op sinen scholderen droich \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 Niet meer op dese tyt. Mer ic haep als dese epistel die susteren horen lesen, die te voren een swair dobbel hoick op oren scolderen wael plegen te dragen \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (\u8230 \'85)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Gescreuen op sunte Cristoffers auent, die den suete Jhesus in kintlicker formen op sinen scolderen droich myt swaerheit, mer ten lesten mennigerley pine omme sinen wil leet myt williger vuericheit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  M. M. Kors, Epistolaire aspecten van de geestelijke brief (ca. 1350\endash 1550), in: Th. Mertens (u.a.), Boeken voor de eeuwigheid. Middelnederlands geestelijk proza, Amsterdam 1993 (Nederlandse literatuur en cultuur in de middeleeuwen, 8), S. 52\endash 69, Anmerkungsteil S. 380\endash 386 (Hs. genannt S. 64, 381, Anm. 10, S. 382, Anm. 22 und 37, S. 383, Anm. 58, S. 384, Anm. 73 und 77, S. 385, Anm. 84, 85 und 91).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 175r\endash 176v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 EXEMPLA DE FRATRIBUS ORDINIS CISTERCIENSIS}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . (175r\endash 176r) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 CONRADUS EBERBACENSIS}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 EXORDIUM MAGNUM CISTERCIENSE}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , dist. 2, cap. 24. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Een exempel staet gescreuen inden bueke vanden bruederen in sunte Bernards oirden geheiten de illustribus viris.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Het was een monick in Clarenvaile van groter heilicheit \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 myt desen woirden sciet he van hem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  Ed. der lat. Vorlage: CCCM 138 (zu \u220 \'dcbersetzungen ebd. S. 24* f.). CALMA Bd. 2,6, S. 679, Nr. 2; VL2  Bd. 5, Sp. 156\endash 159; DLL MA Bd. 3, Sp. 188 ff.; Mazurek, Handschriften, S. 93. (176rv) De fratre nomine Libenter. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Eyn exempel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Men leeste en ander exempel, dat in sunte Bernarts cloistere en brueder was, die alsoe gehoirsam was, dat men em geen dincken conde geheiten, done hij en seyde: geerne \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 die in ons geapenbaert sal werden. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

