\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 1\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 \endash 4\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ORATIONES ET BENEDICTIONES}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit Manuale seu devocionale devotissimum. Cum mane surgere vel quoquam pergere velis, dic:\plain \f1\fs22 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Benedicat me imperialis maiestas, protegat me regalis divinitas \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 68; Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 80, Anm. 462; S. 86, Anm. 507; S. 91,Anm. 539 und S. 124, Anm. 738; Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 105, G146; (1\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio devota, quam Leo papa misit regi Ciprie contra omnia pericula dicenda omni die\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Pax domini nostri Ihesu Christi et virtus passionis eius \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 72, Anm. 392; S. 80, Anm. 462; S. 87, Anm. 511; S. 130, Anm. 796; (2\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De nocte quando transis dormitum benedictio valde bona\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Benedicat me deus pater, qui me creavit, benedicat me deus filius, qui pro me passus est \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (2\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De mane quando surgis oratio et benedictio valde devota\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Gracias ago tibi, domine, sancte pater, omnipotens, eterne deus, quod dignatus es me custodire in hac nocte \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 1, S. 234; (3\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 v\plain \f1\fs22 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio adversus temptaciones\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Benedictio dei patris omnipotentis et filii et spiritus sancti venerandeque trinitatis sit super me \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 101.}

