\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 4r\endash 7v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ORATIONES}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur devota oracio sancti Augustini. Qui devote dixerit vel audierit, illa die non peribit nec in igne, nec in aqua, nec in prelio, nec iudicio, nec subitanea morte interibit, nec quid mortiferum ei nocebit et quidquid iustum a deo \plain \f1\fs22 (4v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  pecierit, impetrabit cum anima eius de corpore exierit infernus eam non possidebit et est sibi a spiritu sancto revelata\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Deus, propicius esto mihi peccatori et custodi me omnibus diebus et noctibus vite mee \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 396 (Register);Haimerl, Gebetbuchliterartur, S. 178; Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 103, G134; (6r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Cum aliquis horas canonicas vel missam inchoat\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f1\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine, in unione caritatis, qua ipse in terris laudes deo patri persolvisti, hanc tibi horam }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 >}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 vel}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 < }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 missam per solvo}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 .}}\plain \f1\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio sequens debet dici post divinum cultum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Benignissime pater, eterne deus, qui me, indignum famulum tuum, laudi tue dignatus es interesse \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (7r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad sanctam trinitatem\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Summa et eterna et ineffabilis trinitas, pater et filius et spiritus sanctus, unus solus verus et incommutabilis deus \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 tueque iucundissime contemplacionis beatitudinem. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 8r\endash 24v [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ARNULFUS DE LOVANIO}}\plain \f1\fs22 ]:\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 DE PASSIONE DOMINI}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (SALUTATIO AD MEMBRA CHRISTI). >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur oracio devotissima beati Bernhardi, abbatis Clarevallensis, quam cum semel diceret ante ymaginem crucifixi, ipsa ymago de cruce se inclinans et eum amplexata est\plain \f1\fs22 .< 8v leer. (9r) RH Nr. 18073, 17989, 17984, 17992, 18164, 19737 (Verfasser: Hermann Josephus Steinfeldensis [?]), 17985, 18167; Walther I Nr. 17126. VL 2 Bd. 1, Sp. 500; VL 2 Bd. 3, Sp. 1062\endash 1066, hier Sp. 1065; VL 2 Bd.8, Sp. 511\endash 515, hier Sp. 514; Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 75, G1; zum letzten Gedicht (RH Nr. 18167) vgl. Mone, Hymnen, Bd. 1, S. 171. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend CAO Nr. 7936 und (24r) ORATIO PRO DEFUNCTIS: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oremus\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine Ihesu Christe, rogo te per misterium sancte incarnationis tue \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et miserationum tuarum. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . \endash  23v und 24v leer.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 25r\endash 65r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 ORATIONES DE PASSIONE DOMINI (CUM INDULGENTIIS)}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequuntur orationes de passione domini\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Pie Ihesu, recordare, quam crudeliter et quam amare in ligno crucis laborasti \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (27r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur alia oratio de passione domini\plain \f1\fs22 .< (27v) RH Nr. 4908; Walther I Nr. 4815; (30v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur alia oratio de passione domini devota\plain \f1\fs22 .<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Origo omnium bonorum, misericors deus, qui de sinu patris in uterum Marie matris de tua inmarcessibili gloria ad nostram fragilem materiam descendisti \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (31v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur alia devota oracio de passione domini\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ave clementissime domine Ihesu Christe, ver}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 - (32r) -}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 bum patris de virgine natum, in presepio reclinatus, circumcisus et magis monstratus \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 ad gaudia eterna misericorditer perducere digneris. Qui cum deo patre et spiritu sancto vivis ac regnas deus per omnia secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 . 34v leer. (35r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur oratio cuiusdam episcopi, qui eam quottidie dicebat in honore passionis Ihesu Christi et compassionis gloriose virginis Marie\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O Jhesu, rex celice, clamose coram iudice es accusatus \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; anschlie\u223 \'dfend Versikel:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Domine, exaudi oracionem meam\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oremus\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Omnipotens, sempiterne deus, qui proprio filio tuo non pepercisti \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (36v) [PS.-BEDA VENERABILIS]: DE SEPTEM VERBIS CHRISTI IN CRUCE. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur oracio venerabilis Bede presbyteri de septem ultimis verbis domini nostri Ihesu Christi in cruce pendentis, de qua fertur: Qui quottidie devote flexis genibus dixerit, nec diaboli, nec hominis nocumenta pacietur, inconfessus non discedit ac per triginta dies ante \plain \f1\fs22 (37r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  obitum suum gloriosam virginem Mariam ad suum auxilium videbit preparatum absque aliis privilegiis at indulgenciis a summis pontificalibus misericorditer concessis\plain \f1\fs22 .< 37v leer. (38r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine Ihesu Christe, fili dei vivi, qui septem verba die ultimo vite tue in cruce pendens dixisti \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Druck: PL 94, Sp. 561 f.; Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 342. CPPM Bd. 2, Nr. 3186a; (40r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur oracio omnium oracionum de totali passione domini nostri Ihesu Christi beati Ambrosii episcopi, quam beatus Anastasius papa confirmavit ac quingentos dies criminalium peccatorum omnibus devo\plain \f1\fs22 - (40v) -\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 te dicentibus misericorditer indulsit videbitque dominum nostrum Ihesum Christum in suis extremis apparere\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine Ihesu Christe, fili dei vivi, creator et resuscitator humani generis \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 1, S. 321; Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 80, Anm. 456; (42v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Innocentius papa istam oracionem composuit de passione domini nostri Ihesu Christi et omnibus eam devote dicentibus passionem Christi \plain \f1\fs22 (43r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  intimo corde revolventes septem annos indulgenciarum donavit\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine Ihesu Criste, fili dei vivi, fons vite et origo tocius bonitatis \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 1, S. 152; (44r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quicumque infra tres scriptas oraciones devote oraverit, habet ab ecclesia sancta de prima oracione mille annos venialium peccatorum, de secunda mille annos oblitorum peccatorum, de tercia mille annos mortalium peccatorum cum suis carrenis\plain \f1\fs22 .< (44v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  O domine Ihesu Christe, suscipe hanc oracionem in memoriam illius sacratissime mortis \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  O domine Ihesu Christe, suscipe \plain \f1\fs22 (45r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  hanc oracionem in memoriam illius gaudii, quod habuit benedicta anima in limbo inferni \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  O domine Ihesu Christe, suscipe hanc oracionem in memoriam illius gaudii, \plain \f1\fs22 (45v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  quod habuit beatissima mater tua, domina nostra virgo Maria, in die resurrectionis tue \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs22 ; (46r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quicumque sequentem oracionem oraverit ante ymaginem Christi portantis crucem in humeris, consequitur indulgencias dierum quinque milium. Quadringentorum sexaginta a triginta apostolicis et viginti archiepiscopis\plain \f1\fs22 .< 46v leer. (47r) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O mundi creator et redemptor, qui ad passionem iturus non pro tua necessitate, sed nobis ad exemplum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais 1, S.51; (48 r) [PS.-]GREGORIUS I. PAPA: ORATIO. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quicumque dixerit oracionem sequentem coram ymagine apparicionis sancti Gregorii, habet viginti duo milia annorum et alios viginti quattuor annos et viginti tres dies indulgenciarum de iniunctis penitenciis. In quo nulli sit dubium, quia certum est, quod causa brevitatis obmitto\plain \f1\fs22 .< 48v leer. (49r) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O domine Ihesu Christe, adoro te in cruce pendentem et coronam spineam in capite portantem \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Druck: Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 346. Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 92, Anm. 542 und S. 121, Anm. 710; VL 2 Bd. 3, Sp. 233\endash 244, hier Sp. 241 f.; Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 76, G4; (51r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur oracio, cuius summa indulgenciarum est quindecim milium dierum octingentorum et duodecim, quacumque die vel hora homo devote coram crucifixo oraverit\plain \f1\fs22 .< 51v leer. (52r) RH Nr. 18123; (52v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De sequenti oracione Johannes papa vicesimus secundus dat trecentos dies indulgenciarum\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Fremuit Ihesus et turbavit se ipsum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 81. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Kyrieeleison, Christeeleison, Kyrieeleison. Pater noster. Ave Maria. Et ne.\plain \f1\fs22 ; mit Versikel:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Quoniam tu illuminas \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 und (53r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Domine, exau\plain \f1\fs22 (di)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  oracionem. Dominus vobiscum\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oremus\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus, cuius unigenitus assumpte humanitatis probabile argumentum inresus citacione Lazari lacrimando exhibuit \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 81; (54r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De oracione sequenti concedunt omnibus dicentibus semel in die cum devocione flexis genibus octoginta milia annorum indulgencie pro mortalibus peccatis\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus, qui pro redempcione mundi voluisti nasci, circumcidi, a iudeis reprobari \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 1, S. 153; Paulus, Geschichte des Ablasses, S. 250; (55r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequens oracio edita est per Johannem papam duodecimum, qui concessit omnibus eam devote dicentibus inspiciendo Veronicam decem milia dierum indulgenciarum aut dicat loco eius quinque pater noster cum devocione idem valet\plain \f1\fs22 .< 55v leer. (56r) RH Nr. 18189; Walther I Nr. 17153; Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 101, G117; Paulus, Geschichte des Ablasses, S. 249f.; (57v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequens oracio est Innocencii. Et dedit eam dicentibus tres annos indulgenciarum\plain \f1\fs22 .< (58r) RH Nr. 1787; Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 125, G256. 58v leer. (59r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Salutacio ad arma Christi\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Cruci, clavis, corone spinee, flagellis, sacroque ferro lancee honorem inpendamus \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 vgl. Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 1, S. 186 und 322; anschlie\u223 \'dfend CAO Nr. 7936. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oremus\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[13].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus, qui diversarum penarum tuarum insigniis signatis passionis tue victoriam nobis demonstrasti \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 92, Anm. 544; (59v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequens oracio est de armis Christi, de qua habentur indulgencie novem milia dierum. Versus: Insuper ter quinque o peccator scelus lingue. Arma Ihesu speculeris et salutem consequeris. Hii patres pro affectu pro Veronice aspectu dant contritis quadragenam, ut non intrent eternam penam\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 8, Nr. 13; Walther I Nr. 3541a; (63v) [PS.-]GREGORIUS I. PAPA: ORATIO DE QUINQUE VULNERIBUS IESU CHRISTI. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur oracio beati Gregorii pape de quinque vulneribus Ihesu Christi. Et quicumque hanc cum devocione dixerit, habebit quingentos annos indulgenciarum. Et unicuique oracioni adde unum pater noster. Ave Maria\plain \f1\fs22 .< RH Nr. 1771; Walther I Nr. 1909; VL 2 Bd. 3, Sp. 233\endash 244, hier Sp. 242; Paulus, Geschichte des Ablasses, S. 249; anschlie\u223 \'dfend (64v) Versikel:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Vulneratus est propter iniquitates nostras\plain \f1\fs22 .\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Attritus est propter scelera nostra\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oremus\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[14].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Concede, quesumus, omnipotens deus, ut sanctissima vulnera dulcissimi filii tui, domini nostri Ihesu Christi, cordibus nostris imprimantur \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur oracio pro graciarum actione\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O generosa et pulcerrima divinitas milia milium celestium agmi- }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 (65r)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  -num tibi ministrancium te ex me salutent \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et collaudent nunc et in eternum et in speculum seculi. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 99v\endash 105r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 ROSARIUM BMV}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur Rosarium beate Marie virginis cum articulis vite Christi. Quod quicumque dixerit devote, maximas acquiret indulgencias \plain \f1\fs22 (\u8230 \'85).< 100r leer. (100v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Suscipe rosarium, virgo, deauratum, Jhesu per compendium vita decoratum \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 Druck: Meersseman, Hymnos, Bd.2, S.153\endash 156 (ohne Klausel 49). RH Nr. 19951. Klinkhammer, Adolf von Essen, S. 262 und S. 396, Anm. 66 (Hs. genannt). Schlussgebet: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oremus\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Interveniat pro nobis, quesumus, domine Ihesu Christe, nunc et in hora mortis nostre aput tuam clemenciam gloriosa virgo Maria \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et compassionis pertransivit. Qui cum deo patre\plain \f1\fs22 . Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S.34.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 105v\endash 121r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 ORATIONES DE BMV}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequens oracio est beati Thome episcopi Canthuariensis \plain \f1\fs22 (\u8230 \'85).< (106v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Gaude flore virginali \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 AH Bd. 31, Nr. 189. VL2 Bd. 8,Sp. 1158\endash 1168, hier Sp. 1163\endash 1166; anschlie\u223 \'dfend Antiphon:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  O sponsa dei, dilecta, sancta, humilis et benigna ac pulcerrima virgo Maria \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 mit Versikel:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Ora pro nobis mater misericordie \plain \f1\fs22 und Schlussgebet: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oremus\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine Iesu Christe,fili dei vivi, qui beatam, gloriosam, humilem, benignam et pulcer}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 - (108r) -}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 rimam virginem Mariam, matrem tuam, perpetuis et felicibus gaudi iste cum in celo coronatam letificasti \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Druck (mit Schlussgebet): Meersseman, Hymnos, Bd. 2, S. 203 f.; Wilmart, Auteurs spirituels, S. 329, Anm. 1; Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 93f., G77 und G772; (108v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur oracio Theophili, quondam apostate. Qui devote dixerit, si absque confessione et communione moriatur, intercessione tamen Marie virginis salvabitur, quam Celestinus papa confirmavit et quadraginta dies indulgenciarum indulsit presertim sacerdoti volenti celebrare\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  O sancta virgo virginum, quem \plain \f1\fs22 [!]\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  genuisti dominum \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 RH Nr. 13694; Walther I Nr. 12972; (110v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Conclusio\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 In manus tuas, o domina sancta Maria, commendo animam meam, corpus meum, sensus meos, actus meos \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 (111v) Versikel:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  In omni tribula\plain \f1\fs22 (tione).\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Interveniat pro nobis\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequentem orationem Johannes papa secundus et dedit omnibus dicentibus trecentos dies indulgenciarum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Ave plena gracia virgo fecundata \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 Druck: Mone, Hymnen, Bd. 2, S. 288, Nr. 511; (113r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequens oracio est Sixti pape quarti. Et dedit xi milia dierum tociens quociens dicenda coram ymagine beate virginis Marie sole amicta\plain \f1\fs22 .< 113v leer. (114r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ave domina sancta Maria, mater dei, regina celi, porta paradisi \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 381; Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 93, Anm. 555; VL2 Bd. 11, Sp. 4\endash 7, hier Sp. 4 f.; DLL MA Bd. 2, Sp. 1462 f., hier Sp. 1462; Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 98 f., G105; Paulus, Geschichte des Ablasses, S. 251; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur alia oracio Allexandri pape sexti. Et dedit omnibus contritis et confessis dicentibus ante ymaginem sancte Anne, matri dei, x milia annorum criminalium et xx milia venialium annorum et trina vice dicta valet contra \plain \f1\fs22 (114v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  pestilenciam. Et idem papa confirmavit eandem anno domini M cccc xciiiito\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Ave Maria, gracia plena, dominus tecum, benedictus fructus ventris tui, Ihesus Christus, et benedicta sit mater tua, Anna sanctissima \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 125, Anm. 748; Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 120, G227; Paulus, Geschichte des Ablasses, S. 251. 115r leer; (115v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Alia devota oracio de beata virgine pro omni statu\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O beatissima virgo Maria, dei genitrix, virgo perpetua, suscipe laudes glorie tue, quas ego, Rudpertus, indignus famulus tuus et peccator, orare presumo \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (116r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur oracio de quinque festivitatibus beate Marie virginis\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Ave cuius conceptio solenni plena gaudio \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 1, S. 78, schlie\u223 \'dft mit Versikel: (116v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Ora pro nobis\plain \f1\fs22 .>\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oremus\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus, qui nobis concepcionis, annunciacionis, purificacionis, assumpcionis et nativitatis beate Marie virgi- }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 (117r)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  -nis gaudia recolentibus letificas \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (117v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur oracio de quinque compassionibus sive doloribus beate Marie virginis\plain \f1\fs22 .< RH Nr. 1783; Walther I Nr. 1911 mit Antiphon:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Sancta Maria, sub tuam protectionem \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 (119r) Versikel:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  In omni tribulacione\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oremus\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus, cuius unigeniti tui mater, sanctissima virgo Maria, omnes paupertates et miserias ac dolores, quos idem unigenitus tuus in suo sanctissimo corpore pertulit \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ;(119v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur oracio sancti Ambrosii de compassione beate Marie virginis et Innocencius papa relaxat dicenti eam septingentos dies indulgenciarum et quatuor karrenas\plain \f1\fs22 .< (120r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Stabat mater dolorosa \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 AH Bd. 54, Nr. 201. Wilmart, S. 508 f.; VL2 Bd. 9, Sp. 207\endash 214, hier Sp. 207\endash 210; anschlie\u223 \'dfend (121r) Versikel:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  In omni tribula\plain \f1\fs22 (tione). >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oremus\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Interveniat pro nobis\plain \f1\fs22 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 121v\endash 127r OFFICIUM DE COMPASSIONE BMV. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur cursus de compassione beate Marie virginis\plain \f1\fs22 .< Reimoffizium. Walther I Nr. 10974. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend Versikel:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Stetit Maria iuxta crucem Ihesu\plain \f1\fs22 . \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Habens passionem ipsius in corde suo \plain \f1\fs22 und Gebete: (123r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oremus\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Omnipotens, clementissime deus, qui gloriosam virginem Mariam, matrem tuam, tuo sacratissimo saguine perfundisti \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (123v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequentem oracionem confirmavit Bonifatius papa et dedit dicenti septem annos et quatuor karrenas. Prima\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Memorare florida dominarum rosa illius mesticie doloris}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs22 Eine aus f\u252 \'fcnf Teilen bestehende Betrachtung, nach jedem Teil ein Gebet. \endash  127v.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 128r\endash 137r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 ORATIONES DE SANCTIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipiunt oraciones de sanctis et primo de proprio angelo et aliis\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 15, Nr. 136 (ohne Str. 16) mit (130r) Versikel CAO Nr. 8092 und Gebet CO Nr. 1798. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur oracio devota de proprio angelo\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O benedicte angele dei, qui es deputatus custos vite anime mee \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (131r) Es folgen Rubriken:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Commune de sanctis \plain \f1\fs22 (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De ewangelistis\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  De apostolis\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  De uno martire\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  De martiribus\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  De uno martire et patrono\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  De pluribus patronis\plain \f1\fs22 : am Anfang eine Strophe [ad Magnificat] aus dem Reimoffizium AH Bd. 28, Nr. 41;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  De uno confessore\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  De una virgine et martire\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  De una virgine non martire\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  De una vidua\plain \f1\fs22 ,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  De una sancta penitente\plain \f1\fs22 ). Initien im Register. (135v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De omnibus sanctis\plain \f1\fs22 .< AH Bd. 15, Nr. 134. (136v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequens oracio est ad deum, ad beatam virginem et omnes angelos satis devota\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Omnipotens miserere, Maria semper assiste \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 quies evasit defunctis. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs22 137r\endash 142v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs22\chcbpat17 ORATIONES PRO DEFUNCTIS}}\plain \f1\fs22 . >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Secuntur oraciones pro defunctis. Et de sequenti dedit papa Johannes xxii dicenti tot dies indul\plain \f1\fs22 (gentiarum),\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  quot corpora sunt Rome. Alia rubrica habet sic, quod corpora in eodem cimiterio utrumque bonum et devotum\plain \f1\fs22 .< 137v leer. (138r) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Avete omnes christifideles anime, quorum corpora hic et ubique requiescunt in pulvere terre \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 1, S.140; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur alia oracio pro omnibus fidelibus defunctis in recessu\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Valete omnes fideles anime, quorum corpora iacent in gremio terre, longe lateque benedicat vos sol iusticie \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 127, Anm. 786; (138v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur alia oracio, de qua habentur lx dies indulgenciarum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Avete omnes fideles anime, det vobis requiem ille, qui est vera requies, Ihesus Christus \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; anschlie\u223 \'dfend (139r) Versikel:\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  Requiem eternam. Kyrieeleison Christeeleison Kyrieeleison. Pater noster. Ave Maria\plain \f1\fs22 ; anschlie\u223 \'dfend CAO Nr. 7923. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oremus\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Respice, quesumus, domine Ihesu Christe, animas omnium fidelium defunctorum christianorum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Anno domini M cccc lixo, ipso die sancte Katherine virginis, Pius papa secundus ad instanciam cuiusdam sibi dilati largitus est dicentibus \plain \f1\fs22 (139v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  infra scriptas oraciones cum devocione pro animarum salute tociens, quociens centum dies indulgenciarum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Miserere mi, domine, animabus, que singulares aput te non habent intercessores \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs22 Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 127, Anm. 786; (140r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sanctus Gregorius concessit dicentibus hos versus sequentes in cimiterio cum uno pater noster et Ave Maria xl dies indulgenciarum\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O pie rex Christe, propter tua vulnera quinque da requiem cunctis hic et ubique sepultis \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (140v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur oracio pro parentibus et benefactoribus\plain \f1\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Rex tremende et terribilis deus, quem metuunt angeli \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\fs22 ; (142r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur oracio ex caritate pro persona quacumque tibi denunciata dicenda\plain \f1\fs22 .<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Obsecro te, domine Ihesu Christe, per amarissimam passionem et mortem tuam \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 ad laudem et gloriam nominis tui sanctissimi. Qui vivit et regnat cum deo patre et spiritu sancto in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\fs22 .}

