\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 1r\endash 8v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 BENEDICTIONALE}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictiones quaedam in s. Ordine nostro Cister\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (ciense)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  usitatae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< Benedictio aquae. Rituale Cisterciense S. 593\endash 596. Deshusses Nr. 1451\endash 1456. (2r\endash 3r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio vini in die Sancti Johannis Evangeliste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In principio erat verbum etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [Io 1,1]. CAO Nr. 5309 mit Versikel:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Cibavit illum dominus pane vite et intellectus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  und Responsorium:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Et aqua sapient\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (ie)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  sal\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (utaris)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  pot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (abit)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ill\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (um).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Collecta: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus et pater domini nostri Jhesu Christi, cuius verbo celi firmati sunt ...}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  vgl. Franz, Benediktionen, Bd. 1, S. 312 f.; (2v) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Collecta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus, qui apostolo tuo Iohanni speciali amoris privilegio secreta celestia pandere dignatus es \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Alia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< Deshusses Nr. 4351; Franz, Benediktionen, Bd. 1, S. 261. (3r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 In purificatione beate Marie benedictio cereorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominus vobiscum. Oremus. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus inestimabilis potentie, cuius unigenitus cum nostra humanitate hodierna die in templo est a matre virgine presentatus \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio cinerum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominus vobiscum. Oremus. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus, qui non mortem, sed penitentiam desideras peccatorum, }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 (3v)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  fragilitatem nostram benignissime respice \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio super ramos palmarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< PRG XCIX, Nr. 177; (4r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio ignis in vigilia Pasche\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominus vobiscum. Oremus. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine, deus pater, lumen indeficiens, exaudi nos, tu es, sancte}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 , }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 conditor omnium luminum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  vgl. PRG XCIX, Nr. 217; Deshusses Nr. 4358; (4v) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio herbarum in festo Assumptionis Beate Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Adiutorium nostrum in nomine domini. Qui fecit celum et terram. Dominus vobiscum. Oremus. Omnipotens, sempiterne deus, qui celum et terram, mare cunctaque visibilia et invisibilia verbo tuo creasti ex nihilo \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Franz, Benediktionen, Bd. 1, S. 398 f.; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictiones vasorum et vestimentorum quorumdam ad consecrationem spectantium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< (5r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio stole\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine, sancte pater, omnipotens, eterne deus, qui per unicum filium tuum, dominum nostrum Jesum Christum, stolam immortalitatis, quam protoparentis culpa perdideramus et reddere dignatus es \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio stole vel planete\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< PRG XVI, Nr. 11 und 14a; ebd. XL, Nr. 81; Rituale Cisterciense S. 589 f.; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio calicis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Oremus, dilectissimi fratres, ut deus noster calicem hunc in ministerium consecrandum celestis gratie inspiratione sanctificet\u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Alia oratio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . (5v) PRG XL, Nr. 93, 94; Deshusses Nr. 1259; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Consecratio pateris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< PRG XL, Nr. 88 und  91; Deshusses Nr. 1257/4096 und 1258/4097; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio corporalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< PRG XL, Nr. 85; Deshusses Nr. 4147; Rituale Cisterciense S. 591 f.; (6r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 De benedictione tabernaculi sive vasculi pro eucharistia conservanda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< Rituale Cisterciense S. 585; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio ad omnia vestimenta sacerdotalia seu secretorum ordinum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< PRG XL, Nr. 80; vgl. Rituale Cisterciense S. 689; (6v) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio ad omnia in usu altaris vel basilice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< PRG XL, Nr. 78; (7r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit officium ordinis ad monachum benedicendum professum. Hic ordo extenditur etiam ad moniales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< Rituale Cisterciense S. 396\endash 399; (8v) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio super dirigendos in via\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< Deshusses Nr. 1317; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Super reversos de via\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Omnipotens, sempiterne deus, miserere servis famulis tuis et quidquid eis in via surripuit visus aut auditus male rei}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  aut otiosi sermonis totum ineffabili pietate propitiatus indulge. Per Christum d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (ominum)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  n\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (ostrum).}

