\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 68ra\endash 108ra [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 BENEDICTUS DE NURSIA}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 REGULA}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ]. (68ra\endash 69rb) Prolog, Anfang fehlt (Blattverlust): ||\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  nobis dominus viam vite. Succinctis ergo fide vel observancia bonorum actuum lumbis nostris \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 ut regni eius mereamur esse consortes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . (69ra\endash 108ra) Text:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  >De generibus monachorum.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Monachorum quatuor esse genera manifestum est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 doctrine virtutumque culmina deo protegente pervenies. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  Ed.: CSEL 75, S. 1\endash 181, hier S. 4\endash 181. In dieser Hs. liegt die zisterziensische Fassung des Textes vor; vgl. dazu ebd., S. LXIII f. CPL Nr. 1852; CALMA Bd. 2,2, S. 210.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 108ra\endash vb [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 COMMEMORATIO DEFUNCTORUM}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ].\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Anime fratrum, familiarium et benefactorum nostrorum hoc anno defunctorum requiescant in pace. Amen. De profundis. Pater noster. Et ne nos. Requiem eternam. A porta inferi. Dominus vobiscum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oremus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Deus, venie largitor et humane salutis auctor \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  vgl. CO Nr. 2205. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend in kleinerer Schrift (108rb) [DE OFFICIIS DEFUNCTORUM]. Anfang getilgt [\u8230 \'85]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  postquam dictum est in capitulo \u8218 \'82Loquamur de ordine nostro\lquote , antequam venie petantur, ad monicionem cantoris surgat conventus versus orientem et fit absolucio defunctorum hoc modo: Qui presidet capitulo, dicat: Anime fratrum, familiarium et benefactorum nostrorum hoc anno defunctorum requiescant in pace \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 Alii vero monachi et conversi duo psalteria. Primum dicent monachi cum collecta \u8218 \'82Deus, qui caritatis dona\lquote  secundum cum collecta \u8218 \'82Inclina pluraliter\lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .}

