\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 69r\endash 91r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 BENEDICTUS DE NURSIA}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 REGULA}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Qui levi iugo Christi colla submittere cupis \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Walther I Nr. 15528. (69r\endash 70r) Prolog:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  >Incipit prologus in regulam sancti Benedicti abbatis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ausculta, o fili, precepta magistri et inclina aurem cordis tui \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 ut regni eius mereamur esse consortes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . (70rv) Kapitelverzeichnis. (71r\endash 91r) Text:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  >De generibus monachorum.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quatuor esse genera monachorum manifestum est \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 doctrine virtutumque culmina deo protegente pervenies. Amen. >Facientibus hec regna patebunt eterna. Explicit regula sancti Benedicti abbatis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Ed.: CSEL 75. CPL Nr. 1852; CPPM Bd. 2, Nr. 3605; CALMA Bd. 2,2, S. 210. Zisterziensische Fassung \u252 \'fcberliefert in Ms. C 4, 127v; Ms. C 5, 121v und unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig in Ms. C 85, 68r. \endash  91v leer.}

