\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 1v\endash 15v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ORDINARIUS MINOR}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . (1r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit ordinarius minor et primo de adventu domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< (1v)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Adventus domini, qui semper dominica post sexto kalendas decembris inchoatur usque ad dominice nativitatis diem precipua devocione recolitur \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 consequi mereamur: Per Christum dominum nostrum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Notabile\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Legens in privato primam aut completam tali modo dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Confiteor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \lquote \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 Eciam si sacerdos fuerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .}

