\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 16r\endash 60v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 PSALTERIUM FERIATUM}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Cursus Romanus. Psalmen und Cantica in liturgischer Reihenfolge, f\u252 \'fcr Laudes, Kleine Horen, Vesper und Komplet. Mit den Hymnen: (18r) AH Bd. 51, Nr. 31; (20r) ebd., Nr. 32; (33v) ebd., Nr. 41; (38r) AH Bd. 50, Nr. 18; (39v) ebd., Nr. 19; (41r) ebd., Nr. 20; (44r) AH Bd. 51, Nr. 34; (45v) ebd., Nr. 35; (46v) ebd., Nr. 36; (48r) ebd., Nr. 37; (50v) ebd., Nr. 38; (53v) ebd., Nr. 39; (57r) AH Bd. 50, Nr. 7; (58v) AH Bd. 51, Nr. 44. (35r\endash 36r) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 SYMBOLUM ATHANASIANUM}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Symbolum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quicumque vult sal\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (vus)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  esse \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 sal\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (vus)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  esse non po\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (terit). CPL Nr. 167; CPPM Bd. 2, Nr. 38, 699.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Gloria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (patri). (37rv) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 COMMEMORATIO DEFUNCTORUM}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  IN OFFICIO CAPITULI. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequentes dicuntur in domo capituli post lectionem martirologii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Preciosa est in con\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (spectu)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  domini. Exultabunt sancti in gloria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Oremus: Sancta mater domini nostri Ihesu Christi, pia et perpetua virgo \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Commemoracio omnium fidelium defunctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Requiescant in pace. Amen. Ps: De profundis. Ver: A porta inferi \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Collecta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< (37v) CO Nr. 74.}

