\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 323r\endash 324r (= 10r\endash 11r) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 EXCERPTA VARIA DE SANCTA CAECILIA}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ambrosius in prefacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sancta Cecilia celesti dono repleta}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 quantum valeat devocio castitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Hec Ambrosius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< Exzerpt aus Jacobus de Voragine: Legenda aurea (cap. De sancta Cecilia); Ed.: Maggioni, Legenda aurea, S. 1183. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Item Lendolphus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [!]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Carthusiensis in libro de vita Ihesu. Cecilia virgo clarissima absconditum semper evangelium Cristi gerebat in pectore suo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hoc sic intelligendum videtur, quod ipsa de vita domini Ihesu in evangelio tradita, quedam devociora sibi preelegerat}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 consilio collocavit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Druck: Ludolphus the Carthusian, Vita Christi, Bd. 1, Paris u.a. 1865 (Nachdruck Salzburg 2006) (Analecta Cartusiana, 241), hier S. 3. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Item Vincencius in Speculo historiali, parte quarta, libro xxvo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [recte: 24],\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  capitulo xxvio de translacione corporis eius. Sigibertus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Anno Ludovici imperatoris viio, qui fuit filius Karoli Magni}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 in ecclesiam a se eis edificatam transposuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Druck: Vincentius Bellovacensis: Speculum historiale, Graz 1965 (Nachdruck der Ausg. von 1624), hier S. 971. (323v) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ex cronica Martiniana de Paschali papa primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hic, scilicet Paschalis papa, habuit revelacionem de beata Cecilia martire}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 in ecclesia sancte Cecilie honorifice collocavit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< Exzerpt aus Martinus Oppaviensis: Chronicon pontificum et imperatorum. Ed.: MGH Scriptores, Bd. 22, S. 377\endash 475, hier S. 427.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Item ex cronica venerabilis patris fratris Anthonini archiepiscopi Florentini ordinis predicatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 P\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 aschalis primus, vir sanctus, multa sanctorum corpora requirens invenit extra muros romane civitatis \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 illaque omnia sub sacro altari collocavit. Ex secunda parte, tytulo xvi, capitulo 1, \u167 \'a7 ii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Exzerpt aus Antoninus Florentinus: Chronicon. Verglichen mit Antoninus Florentinus, Chronicon. N\u252 \'fcrnberg: Anton Koberger, 31.7.1484 (GW 2072), M\u252 \'fcnchen SB, 2o Inc.c.a. 1430 d-2 (Digitalisat). Kaeppeli Nr. 240; CALMA Bd. 1,3, S. 299, Nr. 1.}

