\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 324r\endash 327v (= 11r\endash 14v) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 VINCENTIUS FERRERIUS}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 SERMO DE SANCTA CAECILIA}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f1\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\expndtw15\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Liberasti me}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [Sir 51,16].\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Recitatum est in epistola hodierna. Hodie in ecclesia fit solempnitas et officium unius gloriose virginis et martyris, beate Cecilie, de qua erit sermo \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 ideo eius exemplo continuate in bona vita. Explicit sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  Druck: GW 9834\endash 9846. Kaeppeli Nr. 4027. S. Brettle, San Vicente Ferrer und sein literarisches Nachlass, M\u252 \'fcnster in Westfalen 1924 (Vorreformationsgeschichtliche Forschungen, 10), S. 90.}

