\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 1r\endash 9r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ORATIONES DE SANCTA CRUCE, DE SANCTA TRINITATE ET DE BMV}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio bona de sancta cruce. Et potest dici in die sancto parasceves, quando crux adoratur aut in utroque festo sancte crucis vel etiam cotidie coram imagine crucifixi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Salve crux sancta, salve crux gloriosa, salve crux vivifica, salve mundi decus \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (2v) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Alia oratio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sanctifica me, domine, hoc signaculo sancte crucis, ut fiat michi obstaculum contra seva iacula inimicorum omnium \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ECBERTUS SCHONAUGIENSIS}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ORATIO AD COR BMV}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio multum devota ad beatam virginem Mariam dicenda in eius solennitatibus aut in diebus sabbati et presertim in ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 - (3r) -\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 clesiis ipsi beatissime virgini consecratis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Loquar ad cor tuum, o Maria, speculum claritatis angelice, loquar ad cor tuum mundum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Deschamps/Mulder, Inventaris, S. 75, G2; CALMA Bd. 3,2, S. 190, Nr. 10; (4r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Salutationes ad singula membra virginea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Salvete oculi virginei omnium oculorum felicissimi \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (5v) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Orationes ad sanctam trinitatem. Et primo ad patrem oratio. Pater de celis, deus, miserere nobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine, sancte pater, omnipotens, eterne deus, qui coequalem, consubstancialem et coeternum tibi ante omnia secula filium ineffabiliter genuisti \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (6r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad filium oratio. Fili, redemptor mundi deus, miserere nobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine Iesu Christe, fili dei vivi, qui es verus et omnipotens deus, splendor glorie et imago patris et vita eterna \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad spiritum sanctum oracio. Spiritus sancte deus, miserere nobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine, sancte spiritus, eterne deus, qui coequalis, consubstancialis et coeternus patri filioque existens \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 19, Anm. 93; Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 401 (mehrere Stellen); (6v) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad sanctam trinitatem oracio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sancta trinitas, unus deus, miserere nobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine, omnipotens, eterne, ineffabilis, sine fine et absque principio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , quem unum in trinitate et trinum in unitate confitemur, te laudo, te adoro, te glorifico \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 19, Anm. 94; Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 398 (mehrere Stellen); (7r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio de sancta trinitate, de qua habentur xv milia dies mortalium peccatorum indulgentie et x carene\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sancta trinitas et inseparabilis unitas, alma maiestas, te deprecor per tuam magnam potentiam et meam impotentiam \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sequens oratio dicitur aurea eo, quod nulla ea dulcior et beate virgini Marie acceptior sensu humano dictari potest. Si cum devotione dicatur, prout ipsamet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (7v)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  habens eandem salutationem aureis litteris in pectore suo scriptam cuidam devote persone legitur revelasse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< AH Bd. 30, Nr. 126; (8r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad beatam virginem Mariam oratio salverrima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Obsecro te, o mater summe benignitatis, per illam inestimabilem letitiam \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Alia oratio ad eandem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< (8v)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ave gloriosa virgo virginum Maria, omnipotentis dei mater et filia dignissima \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (9r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Bonifacius papa dedit omnibus sequentem orationem devote dicentibus centum dies indulgentiarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ave Maria alta stips }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 [!]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  lilii castitatis, ave profunda viola vallis humilitatis \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 omnis divine suavitatis et devotionis. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 9r\endash 103r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 SUFFRAGIA ET ORATIONES DE SANCTIS}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Michael (u.a. CO Nr. 1156), Gabriel (RH Nr. 33174 mit Versikel und Oratio CO Nr. 21), Raphael, omnes angeli, angelus proprius, omnes chori angelorum, Joachim, Joseph (AH Bd. 26, Nr. 63, S. 183 f. [ad Magnificat] mit CAO Nr. 8096 und einer Oratio), Johannes Baptista (u.a. AH Bd. 29, Nr. 208 und CO Nr. 4492; CAO Nr. 8075), patriarchae et prophetae, Petrus (u.a. CAO Nr. 8200; CO Nr. 1411 und 1467a), Paulus (u.a. CO Nr. 1808), Andreas (AH Bd. 51, Nr. 107, Str. 1 mit R 1, erweitert), Johannes Evangelista (u.a. AH Bd. 15, Nr. 189, stellenweise gek\u252 \'fcrzt), Jacobus maior (u.a. CAO Nr. 8148), Thomas apostolus, Philippus et Jacobus, Bartholomaeus, Matthaeus, Simon et Juda (u.a. CAO Nr. 8148), Matthias, Barnabas, Marcus (u.a. CAO Nr. 8097), Lucas, omnes apostoli, divisio apostolorum (u.a. RH Nr. 13397), Stehanus protomartyr, Innocentes (u.a. AH Bd. 50, Nr. 28, Str. 1, 2, 6, 7; weitere Str. abweichend), Thomas Cantuariensis (AH Bd. 13, Nr. 92, Exzerpte), Sebastianus (u.a. AH Bd. 33, Nr. 191 mit Versikel; 30v: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Versus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Exora summum martyr clarissime regem / Liberet ut famulos peste vigente tuos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ), Patroclus (u.a. CAO Nr. 8081), Vincentius, Blasius (u.a. RH Nr. 2056), Valentinus, Georg (u.a. RH Nr. 13030), Petrus martyr de ordine predicatorum, Quirinus, Pancratius, Erasmus (u.a. CAO Nr. 8120), Vitus, Gervasius et Prothasius (CAO Nr. 3437 und 8070 mit einer Oratio), decem milia martyres (u.a. AH Bd. 29, Nr. 244 und CAO Nr. 8112), Kylianus (u.a. CO Nr. 2086), Christophorus (u.a.:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[271].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sancte Cristofere, martyr dei preciose, rogo te per nomen Christi, creatoris tui \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 450; CO Nr. 783), Panthaleon, Machabaei, Cyriacus (u.a. CAO Nr. 8081), Laurentius, Inventio Stephani, Decollatio sancti Johannis Baptistae, Adrianus (u.a.:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ave martyr Adriane, qui martyrium immane passus es in corpore \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  RH Nr. 2106 [Ave sancte Adriane \u8230 \'85]), Cornelius, Lambertus (u.a. CAO Nr. 3666), Mauritius et socii (u.a. CAO Nr. 8112), Cosmas et Damianus (u.a. CAO Nr. 8120 und Bruylants, Oraisons, Nr. 667), Dionysius et socii (u.a. AH Bd. 4, Nr. 225 und CAO Nr. 8120), Gereon et Victor (u.a. Bruylants, Oraisons, Nr. 865), Quintinus (u.a. CAO Nr. 8081), Clemens (CO Nr. 3967), unus martyr vel confessor, plures sancti (u.a. CAO Nr. 8070), Sancti quindecim patrones, tres reges (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Rex Iaspar, rex Melchior, rex Balthasar, rogo vos per singula nomina, rogo vos per sanctam trinitatem \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 135 mit CAO Nr. 8180, erweitert; anschlie\u223 \'dfend CO Nr. 2133b, mit Abweichungen), Erhardus (u.a. CAO Nr. 7941), Anthonius (u.a. RH Nr. 12657; CO Nr. 1486), Karolus rex, Guilhelmus (u.a. RH Nr. 10114), Thomas de Aquino (AH Bd. 52, Nr. 354), Gregorius (RH Nr. 13356; CO Nr. 1354), Benedictus (u.a. CO Nr. 3948), Joseph, Ambrosius (u.a. RH Nr. 13435), Vincentius praedicator (u.a. AH Bd. 5, Nr. 91, S. 250 [ad Magnificat]), Liudger, Servatius (CAO Nr. 1192; CO Nr. 2008), Alexius, Translatio trium magorum, Liborius (RH Nr. 3107), Dominicus (u.a. CO Nr. 766), Rochus, Bernardus, Augustinus (u.a. AH Bd. 29, Nr. 179, ohne Str. 2; RH Nr. 4796), Egidius, Maternus (CAO Nr. 3429 und 8115, erweitert; anschlie\u223 \'dfend eine Oratio), Hieronymus (u.a. RH Nr. 16253 und 1811), Remigius, Franciscus (u.a. Bruylants, Oraisons, Nr. 384), Gallus (u.a. CAO Nr. 5316), Severinus (AH Bd. 29, Nr. 238), Wolfgang, Hubertus, Leonardus, Martinus, Cunibertus, Nicolaus (u.a. AH Bd. 33, Nr. 182), Joachim pater Mariae, Iudocus, Agnes, Agatha (u.a. CO Nr. 3176), Dorothea, Apollonia, Eulalia, Euphrasia, Gertrudis (AH Bd. 8, Nr. 179),\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  Monica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (69v), Cunera, Margaretha (u.a. AH Nr. 29, Nr. 221 und RH Nr. 2137),\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  Odilia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (70v, RH Nr. 13421 mit CO Nr. 1227, im Wortlaut abweichend), Maria Magdalena (u.a. AH Bd. 9, Nr. 290, vgl. RH Nr. 6895; CO 1370, abweichend im Wortlaut; AH Bd. 46, Nr. 266, abweichend im Wortlaut, mit Ablass des Papstes Innozenz IV.), Birgitta (u.a. RH Nr. 12671), Christina, Anna (u.a. RH Nr. 6773), Martha (u.a. AH Bd. 28, Nr. 20, S. 58 [ad Magnificat]), Sophia, Afra (u.a. AH Bd. 50, Nr. 247, Versikel abweichend), Maria Egyptiaca (AH Bd. 28, Nr. 8 [In 3. nocturno] mit CAO Nr. 8201, anschlie\u223 \'dfend eine Oratio), Clara (RH Nr. 18240),\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  Helena\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (76v), Eufemia, Tecla, Onkommera, Ursula regina, Martha, Elisabeth (u.a. RH Nr. 1820), Cecilia (u.a. erweiterte Antiphon CAO Nr. 3991 und CO Nr. 1127, gek\u252 \'fcrzt), Katherina (u.a. AH Bd. 33, Nr. 141, Str. 10 abweichend, Str. 11 und 12 fehlen; AH Bd. 29, Nr. 217), Barbara (RH Nr. 2251; AH Bd. 55, Nr. 79), Lucia,\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  Quiriacus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (91r), Erasmus, Christophorus, Olaf, Oswald, Adrianus, Natalia (uxor Adriani), Cornelius, Crispinus et Crispinianus, Quintinus, Bernardus heremita, Severus, Lebuinus, Eligius. Darunter mehrere Reimgebete und Hymnen. Initien im Register.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 103r\endash 105v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ORATIONES DIVERSAE}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . (103r\endash 104v) Orationes pro defunctis. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oracio devota pro exulibus animabus Christi fidelium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< (103v)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Miserere, clementissime domine,animabus, que nec specie ab aliquo habent aut consolationem ullam in tormentis \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ad Mariam pro defunctis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Felicissima virgo Maria, spes et fiducia desolatorum, mediatrix dei et hominum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Alia ad eandem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O pia mater dulcissima, angelorum regina dignissima, ad te }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 (104r)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  meste suspirant mortui, cupientes de penis erui et adesse tuo conspectui \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Adhuc alia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Melliflua pulcerrima regina celi, gaude, predives celeberrima, perenni digna laude \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (104v) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad piissimum Iesum oracio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Adiuvame,fili dei Iesu, miserere mei, audi, Iesu, meam precem, cordis mei munda fecem\u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad piissimam Mariam oratio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O sanctarum sancta, dulcissima, sola tanto partu dignissima, ut de tua carne mundissima nasceretur maiestas maxima\u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (105r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Orationes devote ad dominum Iesum, que sepe legende sunt propter spiritualem dulcedinem, quam conferunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O domine Iesu Christe, piissime salvator, adoro te affectuose genibus flexis pro me incarnatum in prosepio ante animalia humillime collocatum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; dreiteiliges Gebet mit Paternoster und Avemaria; weitere Initien im Register; (105v) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad Christiferam Mariam devote oratiuncule\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ave dignissima mater dei, gloriosissima virgo Maria, ammoneo te amicabiliter de magno gaudio, quod sensisti}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , quando angelo nunciante in utero tuo virginali virtus altissimi corpus suum sacrosanctum fabricavit \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ave Maria gracia etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ave, benignissima regina misericordie, venerandissima virgo Maria, ammoneo te de ineffabili gaudio, quod habuisti, quando vidisti deum, verum hominem, ex te natum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 Ora pro me, o potentissima virgo, quod tam desidiosus eius servitio sepe extiti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

