\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 118r\endash 121v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 MEDITATIONES DE SACRAMENTO ALTARIS CUM PRECIBUS}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipiunt meditationes devote de sacramento altaris cum precibus utilibus. Prima meditatio secundum rationem fidei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< (118v) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ave vivens hostia, veritas et vita \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 Per te tandem cernere da remunerator\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  Druck: Wackernagel, Kirchenlied, Bd. 1, Nr. 408 (Str. 1\endash 13, 15, 16); nach jeder Strophe Paternoster. Vgl. AH Bd. 50, Nr. 395 (in der Ausgabe nur die ersten zwei Strophen); RH Nr. 2278; Walther I Nr. 2023. Wilmart S. 368, 403, Anm. 1. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend (120v) Verse: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad sacerdotem celebrare volentem. Versus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ad mensam pergens Christi sis criminal tergens \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 De venerabili sacramento. Versus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Plebs Moysi petiit carnes, sed manna recepit \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad Ihesum in cruce et Mariam et Iohannem Evangelistam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Me tibi perpetue commendo, Ihesu benedicte \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (121r) Gebet:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O salutaris victima, hostia pacis et sacrificium preciosum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et populo acquisitionis tue merear inveniri. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

