\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 122\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 r\endash 123v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 EXERCITIUM IN ADVENTU DOMINI}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exercitium in adventu domini. In adventu domini preparemus dulcissimo Iesu presepe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (\u8230 \'85) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et super hoc exercitium istam orationem recites\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Imperialis gloria sit tibi, o altissime, gloriosissime, dulcissime, piissime, nobilissime Iesu, regalis proles deifici et magnifici germinis \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; es folgen weitere Anweisungen zur Meditation sowie folgende Gebete: (122\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alia oratio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 O dulcissime ac fervidissime amator hominum, domine Iesu Christe, gracias ago tibi ex totis viribus et ex intimis desideriis anime mee \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (123\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oratio ad beatam virginem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 O gloriosissima mater dei omnipotentis, opiissima mater, o mater immaculata, o mater misericordie, o mater pietatis et bonitatis, commendo me eternaliter tue materne pietati et maxime in hora mortis mee \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \endash  \u8230 \'85 quem in virginali corpore tuo gestasti Jesum Christum dominum nostrum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

