\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 123v\endash 127v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ORATIONES IN NATIVITATE DOMINI}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 In nativitate domini salutatio devota ad parvulum Iesum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ave puer parvule, celorum rex sublimis \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (125r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad puerum Iesum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quid tu hoc in stabulo, celestis margarita, nam in duro lectulo supinus iaces ita? \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  beide Gebete stammen aus AH Bd. 31, Nr. 23, Str. 1\endash 45 (hier stellenweise im Wortlaut abweichend). Walther I Nr. 1963; RH Nr. 2062; (125v) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad eundem puerum Iesum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ave Iesu, verbum dei, ave dei sapientia, ave virtus in puero \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (126r) Suffragium de BMV. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad beatam virginem Mariam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Tolle tuum filium, o mater amorosa, semper habe gaudium, tu lilium cum rosa \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Anfang des Textes: AH Bd. 31, Nr. 23, Str. 46\endash 48; anschlie\u223 \'dfend (127r) Versikel CAO Nr. 8169 und >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Presta nobis, quesumus, eterne salvator, ut sicut tu de maternis uberibus corporale suxisti nutrimentum \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad sanctum Ioseph\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O bone Ioseph, iubila et letare in tua coniuge, in virgine, dei matre et in verbo dei filio tibi dato \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash  \u8230 \'85 et impetra nos indignos indilectos filios adoptari ab ipsa. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .}

